(162178, 8869, 3936, '<td valign="top">Very pretty.  Nice mood photo.  Something I''d like to see on my wall.  Possibly a smidge light on the sky near the horizon, but within the limits of the rules would be hard to hold the foreground water from going too dark.  Very good work.  9</td>', 'Very pretty.  Nice mood photo.  Something I''d like to see on my wall.  Possibly a smidge light on the sky near the horizon, but within the limits of the rules would be hard to hold the foreground water from going too dark.  Very good work.  9', '2002-12-04 01:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
