(162180, 8871, 2302, '<td valign="top">A different crop to move the plane out of the center would have helped this shot in my opinion. But I like the clarity and focu.</td>', 'A different crop to move the plane out of the center would have helped this shot in my opinion. But I like the clarity and focu.', '2002-12-02 12:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(162181, 8871, 2716, '<td valign="top">Love the negative space you used.  Good luck in the challenge.  Jacko.</td>', 'Love the negative space you used.  Good luck in the challenge.  Jacko.', '2002-12-02 20:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(162182, 8872, 4625, '<td valign="top">That glare is great! Whatever that cable is on the right side of the picture is distracting, maybe a closer crop of the buliding would have done better for this shot. I think I would have liked to see the building much closer to the right side of the picture, with more sky to the left.</td>', 'That glare is great! Whatever that cable is on the right side of the picture is distracting, maybe a closer crop of the buliding would have done better for this shot. I think I would have liked to see the building much closer to the right side of the picture, with more sky to the left.', '2002-12-02 01:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(162183, 8872, 4906, '<td valign="top">The star look a bit much. A 4 or 6 star would have been better.</td>', 'The star look a bit much. A 4 or 6 star would have been better.', '2002-12-02 05:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(162184, 8872, 117, '<td valign="top">not a bad image--street is a little dark--don''t like flare but this one''s not that bad--powerlines wish we could clone them here--6bobgaither</td>', 'not a bad image--street is a little dark--don''t like flare but this one''s not that bad--powerlines wish we could clone them here--6bobgaither', '2002-12-02 11:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(162185, 8872, 2472, '<td valign="top">Quite nice architechtural image. IMHO I would have cropped out the right side wire and the upper right corner buiding. Good shot, and it''s a nice detail the reflection of the sun on the upper window.</td>', 'Quite nice architechtural image. IMHO I would have cropped out the right side wire and the upper right corner buiding. Good shot, and it''s a nice detail the reflection of the sun on the upper window.', '2002-12-02 13:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(162186, 8872, 5212, '<td valign="top">I love this shot except for the large dark space in the lower left corner and the upper right.</td>', 'I love this shot except for the large dark space in the lower left corner and the upper right.', '2002-12-02 16:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(162187, 8872, 5070, '<td valign="top">I''d prefer to se more cropping, especially on the right side.</td>', 'I''d prefer to se more cropping, especially on the right side.', '2002-12-02 17:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(162188, 8872, 327, '<td valign="top">TD.....what is that? Okay this shot is almost a homerun. I really do like it, good sky, the sun flare is very cool along with the glass windows. I''m not crazy for the dark on the left and the dark trees center. Maybe you could of adjusted the levels? ....that or cropped that part out. Still congrats on a neat shot!!! Justine</td>', 'TD.....what is that? Okay this shot is almost a homerun. I really do like it, good sky, the sun flare is very cool along with the glass windows. I''m not crazy for the dark on the left and the dark trees center. Maybe you could of adjusted the levels? ....that or cropped that part out. Still congrats on a neat shot!!! Justine', '2002-12-02 19:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(162189, 8872, 4210, '<td valign="top">lol! That lightburst is so perfect it looks like it should be in a movie. Good job.</td>', 'lol! That lightburst is so perfect it looks like it should be in a movie. Good job.', '2002-12-03 02:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(162190, 8872, 4815, '<td valign="top">My personal picture would be just the top of the building plus those nice clouds.Otherwise not a bad shot...5 bullwinkle</td>', 'My personal picture would be just the top of the building plus those nice clouds.Otherwise not a bad shot...5 bullwinkle', '2002-12-03 19:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(162191, 8872, 3306, '<td valign="top">This is a good picture. I think I would have liked it better if you could have cropped out the the lights, wire and building on the right side. The building stands by itself. I really like the star reflection and the blue sky. Lnede</td>', 'This is a good picture. I think I would have liked it better if you could have cropped out the the lights, wire and building on the right side. The building stands by itself. I really like the star reflection and the blue sky. Lnede', '2002-12-03 22:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(162192, 8872, 4162, '<td valign="top">A close up crop of the building, sky and star like light would have been so great! Everything else kind of spoils the picture. IMO!</td>', 'A close up crop of the building, sky and star like light would have been so great! Everything else kind of spoils the picture. IMO!', '2002-12-03 22:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(162193, 8873, 4967, '<td valign="top">I would have tried pushing up the contrast if possible, it all looks about the same grey to me.  I wish you could see the expression on his face, as it is he could have been just sleeping... The little knob on the left I would have tried to crop out, and also, I would have left less blank space at the top.</td>', 'I would have tried pushing up the contrast if possible, it all looks about the same grey to me.  I wish you could see the expression on his face, as it is he could have been just sleeping... The little knob on the left I would have tried to crop out, and also, I would have left less blank space at the top.', '2002-12-02 01:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(162194, 8873, 4753, '<td valign="top">yes!  and not a drop of blue in it... perfect<br/>10... my first</td>', 'yes!  and not a drop of blue in it... perfect10... my first', '2002-12-02 01:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
