(162220, 8879, 327, '<td valign="top">I think you had a good idea, but I think it''s just too dark for any impact.  The idea is oringinal, the color is good, but it''s lost in the blackness. No, sweat I see what you were doing and appreciate your work. Justine</td>', 'I think you had a good idea, but I think it''s just too dark for any impact.  The idea is oringinal, the color is good, but it''s lost in the blackness. No, sweat I see what you were doing and appreciate your work. Justine', '2002-12-02 18:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(162221, 8879, 4186, '<td valign="top">the shaving gel (cream?) is rather interesting, but the razor is too dark against the black background, and is a little hard to pick out. other than that, the composition is well thought out, and the colors work well. the choice of a reflective surface was a good one.</td>', 'the shaving gel (cream?) is rather interesting, but the razor is too dark against the black background, and is a little hard to pick out. other than that, the composition is well thought out, and the colors work well. the choice of a reflective surface was a good one.', '2002-12-02 23:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(162222, 8879, 4267, '<td valign="top">I like the lighting... but give me more blue<br/>~anachronite</td>', 'I like the lighting... but give me more blue~anachronite', '2002-12-04 00:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(162223, 8879, 5436, '<td valign="top">I really like the color and lighting</td>', 'I really like the color and lighting', '2002-12-04 01:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(162224, 8880, 4625, '<td valign="top">Oh Impressive use of text in a picture, So much is conveyed in this one. It makes me think not only is the nurse dumb because she wrote it and the ones for the eyes have to be taken last... but the picture is in black and white! I don''t know which pills are what colors! Poor Bettie :( Great picture, well done, fits the challenge perfectly.</td>', 'Oh Impressive use of text in a picture, So much is conveyed in this one. It makes me think not only is the nurse dumb because she wrote it and the ones for the eyes have to be taken last... but the picture is in black and white! I don''t know which pills are what colors! Poor Bettie :( Great picture, well done, fits the challenge perfectly.', '2002-12-02 01:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
