(162228, 8880, 4967, '<td valign="top">I don''t get it... why did you choose black and white for this?  Sorry... It''s very nicely composed though... but the contrast looks a little off for black and white.</td>', 'I don''t get it... why did you choose black and white for this?  Sorry... It''s very nicely composed though... but the contrast looks a little off for black and white.', '2002-12-02 19:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
