(162336, 8906, 3859, '<td valign="top">I think if, in editing, you had increased the saturation and contrast this would be much more dramatic.  And more blue.</td>', 'I think if, in editing, you had increased the saturation and contrast this would be much more dramatic.  And more blue.', '2002-12-03 23:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(162337, 8907, 4625, '<td valign="top">I like this angle a lot. The crop is nice too, overall nice picture, though the blue is very limited in the shot.</td>', 'I like this angle a lot. The crop is nice too, overall nice picture, though the blue is very limited in the shot.', '2002-12-02 02:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(162338, 8907, 3112, '<td valign="top">I have stated before that eyes are very difficult to capture sharply.  This holds true here. it appears that your camera focused on the edge of the eyelid, effectively softening the iris.</td>', 'I have stated before that eyes are very difficult to capture sharply.  This holds true here. it appears that your camera focused on the edge of the eyelid, effectively softening the iris.', '2002-12-02 16:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(162339, 8907, 4494, '<td valign="top">Pretty eyes.</td>', 'Pretty eyes.', '2002-12-03 00:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(162340, 8913, 4267, '<td valign="top">give me more blue... would be a neat shot if the clouds were gone and we had lots more sky<br/>~anachronite</td>', 'give me more blue... would be a neat shot if the clouds were gone and we had lots more sky~anachronite', '2002-12-02 00:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(162341, 8913, 4514, '<td valign="top">OK.  Houston we have a problem.</td>', 'OK.  Houston we have a problem.', '2002-12-02 00:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(162342, 8913, 4625, '<td valign="top">Maybe more sky, less dark ground... but only a bit...</td>', 'Maybe more sky, less dark ground... but only a bit...', '2002-12-02 02:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(162343, 8913, 2302, '<td valign="top">Too dark of foreground for me. I think the shot would have been better if more of the sky was in the picture</td>', 'Too dark of foreground for me. I think the shot would have been better if more of the sky was in the picture', '2002-12-02 11:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(162344, 8913, 4536, '<td valign="top">very nice. IMO there is too much black on the bottom, still a great shot.</td>', 'very nice. IMO there is too much black on the bottom, still a great shot.', '2002-12-02 12:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(162345, 8913, 1779, '<td valign="top">very nice. if i may, try giving the "earth" less space (1/3 is good) and the rest give to the ski and see how you like it. LM</td>', 'very nice. if i may, try giving the "earth" less space (1/3 is good) and the rest give to the ski and see how you like it. LM', '2002-12-02 12:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(162346, 8913, 5070, '<td valign="top">THe colors of the sky are interesting and sky should have made up 80% of the photo.</td>', 'THe colors of the sky are interesting and sky should have made up 80% of the photo.', '2002-12-02 16:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(162347, 8913, 3306, '<td valign="top">Great Sky. I would have shown more of the sky and less of the dark ground. A little grainy too. Good effort. Lnede</td>', 'Great Sky. I would have shown more of the sky and less of the dark ground. A little grainy too. Good effort. Lnede', '2002-12-02 20:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(162348, 8913, 4388, '<td valign="top">too much black and not enough sky.</td>', 'too much black and not enough sky.', '2002-12-02 22:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(162349, 8913, 4186, '<td valign="top">some definition in the lower half would be nice. unless you cut most of that out, then the silhouette would work beautifully. as it is, it''s too distracting from the sky, and too void in comparison, and is distracting from the sky, which i assume by the title you mean to be the focus. if you resized it a bit bigger, and cropped down to 640x427 so that the ground took up a third or preferably less of the shot, and the tower was just a little further to the right it would be an absolutely amazing shot.</td>', 'some definition in the lower half would be nice. unless you cut most of that out, then the silhouette would work beautifully. as it is, it''s too distracting from the sky, and too void in comparison, and is distracting from the sky, which i assume by the title you mean to be the focus. if you resized it a bit bigger, and cropped down to 640x427 so that the ground took up a third or preferably less of the shot, and the tower was just a little further to the right it would be an absolutely amazing shot.', '2002-12-03 00:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(162350, 8913, 4510, '<td valign="top">Nice sky the foregrounds a bit dark for me !!</td>', 'Nice sky the foregrounds a bit dark for me !!', '2002-12-03 07:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(162351, 8913, 4162, '<td valign="top">I love the silhoutte effect here.  I think it would be better if you had cropped off the bottom dark area and concentrated on the minoret and the sky.</td>', 'I love the silhoutte effect here.  I think it would be better if you had cropped off the bottom dark area and concentrated on the minoret and the sky.', '2002-12-03 21:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(162352, 8916, 806, '<td valign="top">ooohhh. please rotate your photo before submission when you have a vertical shot.<br/>in an attempt to view it sideways, I can also see that the horizon is slanted... that could be fixed easily too. the perspective on the boat is average.. perhaps next time shoot from a bit lower angle. love the worn area of the boat.. this would''ve been interesting to frame in a shot by itself excluding the rest of the clutter of the shot including the contents of the boat, and may have made a nice abstract... This is the first thing my eye lands on, so I would say it is the best aspect of the subject, and thus should get more attention. :0)</td>', 'ooohhh. please rotate your photo before submission when you have a vertical shot.in an attempt to view it sideways, I can also see that the horizon is slanted... that could be fixed easily too. the perspective on the boat is average.. perhaps next time shoot from a bit lower angle. love the worn area of the boat.. this would''ve been interesting to frame in a shot by itself excluding the rest of the clutter of the shot including the contents of the boat, and may have made a nice abstract... This is the first thing my eye lands on, so I would say it is the best aspect of the subject, and thus should get more attention. :0)', '2002-12-02 00:30:00.000000', NULL, 1);
