(162356, 8916, 4625, '<td valign="top">I don''t like the rotation of the canvas on this picture. it looks too weird.</td>', 'I don''t like the rotation of the canvas on this picture. it looks too weird.', '2002-12-02 02:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
