(162381, 8919, 4967, '<td valign="top">Cute... but where''s the baby... also the fact that you have a mostly pink card in the bottom right hand corner doesn''t help your cause.  Good try though, and I''m giving you extra points for an original idea!  Good luck...</td>', 'Cute... but where''s the baby... also the fact that you have a mostly pink card in the bottom right hand corner doesn''t help your cause.  Good try though, and I''m giving you extra points for an original idea!  Good luck...', '2002-12-02 00:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
