(162383, 8919, 4388, '<td valign="top">would have been cuter with a baby or someone younger.  there''s not much innocence in a 42 year old, no offense, i''m older than that.  The lighting on the cards is a little dim, could be the histogram or gamma, i don''t know for sure.  i give you credit for trying but just doesn''t work for me.</td>', 'would have been cuter with a baby or someone younger.  there''s not much innocence in a 42 year old, no offense, i''m older than that.  The lighting on the cards is a little dim, could be the histogram or gamma, i don''t know for sure.  i give you credit for trying but just doesn''t work for me.', '2002-12-02 21:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(162384, 8919, 5086, '<td valign="top">Good idea...  something completely different!</td>', 'Good idea...  something completely different!', '2002-12-03 19:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
