(162513, 8960, 4186, '<td valign="top">so that''s what the amish use their phone lines for. the off center diagonal composition works very well, and the dark blue and white of the quilt contrasted with the lighter blue of the sky is really pretty. good show. 8</td>', 'so that''s what the amish use their phone lines for. the off center diagonal composition works very well, and the dark blue and white of the quilt contrasted with the lighter blue of the sky is really pretty. good show. 8', '2002-12-03 20:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(162514, 8960, 3859, '<td valign="top">Like a breath of fresh air!  Great compostion.  Beautiful sky.  A+ on originality.</td>', 'Like a breath of fresh air!  Great compostion.  Beautiful sky.  A+ on originality.', '2002-12-03 23:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(162515, 8960, 1143, '<td valign="top">I love the color of the sky and the gradation (is that a word) in it. The lighting on the quilt seems a bit harsh - which is common in outdoor shots. Was it afternoon?  The white is just a little too bright maybe. I like the idea. I thought of something similar using little children''s clothes, but it''s just TOO cold outside. Not sure about the angle. Seems maybe a little too slanted tho I wouldn''t shoot it straight on of course. Overall, it fits the challenge and is well done technically. Nothing jumps out as being bad. The subject is just a bit too unemotional maybe when you have to look at SOoooooo many pictures. I''m sure it doesn''t get enough attention from the average voter. I love quilts  :o)   ~indi</td>', 'I love the color of the sky and the gradation (is that a word) in it. The lighting on the quilt seems a bit harsh - which is common in outdoor shots. Was it afternoon?  The white is just a little too bright maybe. I like the idea. I thought of something similar using little children''s clothes, but it''s just TOO cold outside. Not sure about the angle. Seems maybe a little too slanted tho I wouldn''t shoot it straight on of course. Overall, it fits the challenge and is well done technically. Nothing jumps out as being bad. The subject is just a bit too unemotional maybe when you have to look at SOoooooo many pictures. I''m sure it doesn''t get enough attention from the average voter. I love quilts  :o)   ~indi', '2002-12-04 00:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(162516, 8961, 4625, '<td valign="top">Impressive, though a bit grainy. if the color was smooth it would look a lot better.</td>', 'Impressive, though a bit grainy. if the color was smooth it would look a lot better.', '2002-12-02 01:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(162517, 8961, 4267, '<td valign="top">looks like the shot was over exposed? maybe more apature so ya don''t have to leave the shutter open so long? or maybe thats how ya made it get blue? photoshop might have done better if that''s the case.. I am only guessing though.. otherwise cool idea and great shot of the moon<br/>~anachronite<br/>PS: 2nd time around and after seeing all the others I am raising your score.. :o) good work!</td>', 'looks like the shot was over exposed? maybe more apature so ya don''t have to leave the shutter open so long? or maybe thats how ya made it get blue? photoshop might have done better if that''s the case.. I am only guessing though.. otherwise cool idea and great shot of the moon~anachronitePS: 2nd time around and after seeing all the others I am raising your score.. :o) good work!', '2002-12-02 01:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(162518, 8961, 3380, '<td valign="top">incredible focus, and clarity. I''ve tried and tried, but I can nevr achieve such great results.</td>', 'incredible focus, and clarity. I''ve tried and tried, but I can nevr achieve such great results.', '2002-12-02 04:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(162519, 8961, 5158, '<td valign="top">Sad that it is so grainy!<br/>But still a good picture!</td>', 'Sad that it is so grainy!But still a good picture!', '2002-12-02 04:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(162520, 8961, 4514, '<td valign="top">Nice.  Very Nice.  better then nice.  Little Pixilated but Still a wonderful shot.</td>', 'Nice.  Very Nice.  better then nice.  Little Pixilated but Still a wonderful shot.', '2002-12-02 05:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(162522, 8961, 3735, '<td valign="top">Great photo</td>', 'Great photo', '2002-12-02 08:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(162523, 8961, 4529, '<td valign="top">Great Image. So clear.  Great job.</td>', 'Great Image. So clear.  Great job.', '2002-12-02 09:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(162524, 8961, 4967, '<td valign="top">WOW!  Not sure how you did this but very cool... looks almost like a painting... Love the variances in blues and the way they get lighter coming from the upper left hand corner.  Nice job, and good luck!</td>', 'WOW!  Not sure how you did this but very cool... looks almost like a painting... Love the variances in blues and the way they get lighter coming from the upper left hand corner.  Nice job, and good luck!', '2002-12-02 11:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(162525, 8961, 5344, '<td valign="top">NICE SHOT</td>', 'NICE SHOT', '2002-12-02 12:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(162526, 8961, 5044, '<td valign="top">Wow! 8</td>', 'Wow! 8', '2002-12-02 13:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(162527, 8961, 4518, '<td valign="top">nice shot, im curious as to how you took it</td>', 'nice shot, im curious as to how you took it', '2002-12-02 15:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(162528, 8961, 3112, '<td valign="top">Nifty moon.  You took this on the 25th, didn''t you?</td>', 'Nifty moon.  You took this on the 25th, didn''t you?', '2002-12-02 16:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(162529, 8961, 4811, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure if this is an actual picture of the moon or a photo of a photo. Light fall off in the top left corner is odd. All I know is that its difficult to get a shot of the moon like this with a digital camera, so if it is for real I''d be curious to know how a shot like this can be taken...</td>', 'I''m not sure if this is an actual picture of the moon or a photo of a photo. Light fall off in the top left corner is odd. All I know is that its difficult to get a shot of the moon like this with a digital camera, so if it is for real I''d be curious to know how a shot like this can be taken...', '2002-12-02 20:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(162530, 8961, 2716, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot.  Must have been shot in a telescope, because it looks inverted. I''m jealous of whatever lens/telescope you used.  Jacko.  9</td>', 'Very nice shot.  Must have been shot in a telescope, because it looks inverted. I''m jealous of whatever lens/telescope you used.  Jacko.  9', '2002-12-02 20:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(162531, 8961, 1143, '<td valign="top">I love this. I wish I could get a shot like that. It''s gorgeous. Nice work. 10  ~indigo997</td>', 'I love this. I wish I could get a shot like that. It''s gorgeous. Nice work. 10  ~indigo997', '2002-12-02 20:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(162532, 8961, 327, '<td valign="top">Pleaseeeeeeeee this is very nice....what is this lens? My gosh it''s outstanding!!<br/>WOW.</td>', 'Pleaseeeeeeeee this is very nice....what is this lens? My gosh it''s outstanding!!WOW.', '2002-12-02 21:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(162533, 8961, 4510, '<td valign="top">I''m a junky for moon shots how did you get this one? Mine always look crap!</td>', 'I''m a junky for moon shots how did you get this one? Mine always look crap!', '2002-12-03 08:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(162534, 8961, 3102, '<td valign="top">I''m envious of your lens!  :)  Great job bringing it in so close with such good detail of the craters.</td>', 'I''m envious of your lens!  :)  Great job bringing it in so close with such good detail of the craters.', '2002-12-03 13:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(162535, 8961, 3416, '<td valign="top">it magnifies image, I suppose that it will have used a telescope.</td>', 'it magnifies image, I suppose that it will have used a telescope.', '2002-12-03 17:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(162536, 8963, 4514, '<td valign="top">Now with a little Ice on this baby then I could see.  Not a bad Idea.  Colors are represented nicely.  Not a bad shot<br/></td>', 'Now with a little Ice on this baby then I could see.  Not a bad Idea.  Colors are represented nicely.  Not a bad shot', '2002-12-02 05:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(162537, 8963, 5044, '<td valign="top">Would have been great if it had more water drops.</td>', 'Would have been great if it had more water drops.', '2002-12-02 09:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(162538, 8963, 117, '<td valign="top">very good image--9bobgaither</td>', 'very good image--9bobgaither', '2002-12-02 12:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(162539, 8963, 4967, '<td valign="top">I like it a lot!  The waterdrops, or condensation really add to the photo, and good use of blank space in the back!  Very crisp, and clear focusing... you can see every detail which is lovely!  I would have wiped the drop off the white P but thats just bersonal preference.  An excellent macro, which is very blue!  Good job, Good Luck!</td>', 'I like it a lot!  The waterdrops, or condensation really add to the photo, and good use of blank space in the back!  Very crisp, and clear focusing... you can see every detail which is lovely!  I would have wiped the drop off the white P but thats just bersonal preference.  An excellent macro, which is very blue!  Good job, Good Luck!', '2002-12-02 15:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(162540, 8963, 1256, '<td valign="top">Nice picture.</td>', 'Nice picture.', '2002-12-02 16:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(162541, 8963, 2178, '<td valign="top">Nicely done, cool abstract version, nice colors.</td>', 'Nicely done, cool abstract version, nice colors.', '2002-12-03 16:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(162542, 8963, 4648, '<td valign="top">Why the one empty space on the top corner?  I''m serious.  I don''t understand.  It''s a very clear picture with beautiful colors.  Very clear and sharp.  I just don''t understand the crop.  PTL</td>', 'Why the one empty space on the top corner?  I''m serious.  I don''t understand.  It''s a very clear picture with beautiful colors.  Very clear and sharp.  I just don''t understand the crop.  PTL', '2002-12-03 18:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(162543, 8969, 4514, '<td valign="top">I will tell you what is wrong.  Your lighting flat out stinks.  I do not care if the label is not blue but diffuse that light.  It hurts my eyes.  Fix your white balance also if you can. <br/></td>', 'I will tell you what is wrong.  Your lighting flat out stinks.  I do not care if the label is not blue but diffuse that light.  It hurts my eyes.  Fix your white balance also if you can. ', '2002-12-02 05:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(162544, 8969, 2334, '<td valign="top">lack of interest. the title tries desperately to grab your attention but fails miserably because of the photo. eh...i''ll give a 4.</td>', 'lack of interest. the title tries desperately to grab your attention but fails miserably because of the photo. eh...i''ll give a 4.', '2002-12-02 08:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(162545, 8969, 4493, '<td valign="top">This is a decent shot. The framing of it has the bottom of the bottle cut out of the shot and the break of the white behind the bottle also tends to distract the eye from the overall crispness of the picture.</td>', 'This is a decent shot. The framing of it has the bottom of the bottle cut out of the shot and the break of the white behind the bottle also tends to distract the eye from the overall crispness of the picture.', '2002-12-02 09:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(162546, 8969, 5158, '<td valign="top">What''s wrong with it?! There is almost no blue!!<br/>You should have saved this nice idea for a better fitting challenge.</td>', 'What''s wrong with it?! There is almost no blue!!You should have saved this nice idea for a better fitting challenge.', '2002-12-02 10:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(162547, 8969, 205, '<td valign="top">you photoshopped it?</td>', 'you photoshopped it?', '2002-12-02 14:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(162548, 8969, 5478, '<td valign="top">esta muy padre la idea de contraponer a las dos marcas de refrescos de cola ,felicidades ,me encanto<br/></td>', 'esta muy padre la idea de contraponer a las dos marcas de refrescos de cola ,felicidades ,me encanto', '2002-12-02 14:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
