(162550, 8969, 3112, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure how the Coke/Pepsi amalgam evokes blue, but it is very clever.  Photo is underexposed otherwise.</td>', 'I''m not sure how the Coke/Pepsi amalgam evokes blue, but it is very clever.  Photo is underexposed otherwise.', '2002-12-02 16:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
