(162689, 8994, 4388, '<td valign="top">my first look told me not very interesting, but after looking at it a little longer i said to myself this would look good framed.  it''s good that it is not a total silouhette, gives it more depth that way.  nice composition and does look like natures'' fractals.</td>', 'my first look told me not very interesting, but after looking at it a little longer i said to myself this would look good framed.  it''s good that it is not a total silouhette, gives it more depth that way.  nice composition and does look like natures'' fractals.', '2002-12-02 21:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
