(162691, 8994, 4267, '<td valign="top">ahh the best one of it''s kind this week... almost as good as the outtake I didn''t submit.. :oP hehe  the crop is great... but the blue has a touch of purple in it.. or at least thats what I see... then again I might be a little color blind...<br/>~anachronite</td>', 'ahh the best one of it''s kind this week... almost as good as the outtake I didn''t submit.. :oP hehe  the crop is great... but the blue has a touch of purple in it.. or at least thats what I see... then again I might be a little color blind...~anachronite', '2002-12-04 01:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(162692, 8995, 4293, '<td valign="top">Nice photo. I like the composition and the motion...you''re going to wish you would have saved this for next week.  there''s something about all that white that''s really distracting but I don''t know how you would change that without affecting the composition of the rings.</td>', 'Nice photo. I like the composition and the motion...you''re going to wish you would have saved this for next week.  there''s something about all that white that''s really distracting but I don''t know how you would change that without affecting the composition of the rings.', '2002-12-02 01:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
