(162740, 9002, 4967, '<td valign="top">Silly Putty!  I love this stuff... boy, you certainly got a lot of blue in this picture...I think it would have been better if you would have gotten closer to the subject, and put it offcenter.  Also I think it was a little bit of overkill to put it on a blue rug.  Maybe you could have tried for a different angle, not just a straight on shot.  Keep trying!</td>', 'Silly Putty!  I love this stuff... boy, you certainly got a lot of blue in this picture...I think it would have been better if you would have gotten closer to the subject, and put it offcenter.  Also I think it was a little bit of overkill to put it on a blue rug.  Maybe you could have tried for a different angle, not just a straight on shot.  Keep trying!', '2002-12-02 19:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(162741, 9002, 3306, '<td valign="top">Great Blue!</td>', 'Great Blue!', '2002-12-02 20:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
