(162756, 9004, 3599, '<td valign="top">I think you should have tried to focus on the front edge of the bowl because it sticks out more, plus I''d rather see this in color.</td>', 'I think you should have tried to focus on the front edge of the bowl because it sticks out more, plus I''d rather see this in color.', '2002-12-02 11:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
