(162875, 9021, 1041, '<td valign="top">challenge -- met<br/>composition (content) -- the landscape format works well here with the tilted head.  the colors on the head are nice, the glasses are a great additional touch.<br/>background -- i''m not too thrilled about the background, mainly because the thingybobs (that''s the technical term ;) that keep the umbrella open are too close the the head.  maybe if you''d taken that photo from a little further to the left (assuming other extraneous stuff in the background allowed that) would have separated the two better).<br/>camera work (technical) -- nice colors, good job avoiding reflections on the glasses.<br/>digital processing (technical) -- looks fine to me.<br/>my opinion -- a nice shot, just a tad too busy overall for my personal liking.<br/>-- gr8photos.</td>', 'challenge -- metcomposition (content) -- the landscape format works well here with the tilted head.  the colors on the head are nice, the glasses are a great additional touch.background -- i''m not too thrilled about the background, mainly because the thingybobs (that''s the technical term ;) that keep the umbrella open are too close the the head.  maybe if you''d taken that photo from a little further to the left (assuming other extraneous stuff in the background allowed that) would have separated the two better).camera work (technical) -- nice colors, good job avoiding reflections on the glasses.digital processing (technical) -- looks fine to me.my opinion -- a nice shot, just a tad too busy overall for my personal liking.-- gr8photos.', '2002-12-03 12:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
