(162901, 9023, 4811, '<td valign="top">Definately an original take on digital infrared. Most digital infrared are in traditional black and white and I''m surprised that, in general, I haven''t seen more toned digital infrareds. I have been trying to shoot sharp digital infareds with great difficulty - maybe after challenge is over you can give me a tip or two.. I really like the composition, good leading lines from forground to background, very clean composition and tonal range!</td>', 'Definately an original take on digital infrared. Most digital infrared are in traditional black and white and I''m surprised that, in general, I haven''t seen more toned digital infrareds. I have been trying to shoot sharp digital infareds with great difficulty - maybe after challenge is over you can give me a tip or two.. I really like the composition, good leading lines from forground to background, very clean composition and tonal range!', '2002-12-03 09:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
