(162954, 9029, 3936, '<td valign="top">Great shot!  I especially like the milk coating the berry.  Very good depth of field.  Great lighting.  Nothing about this picture I don''t like.  A well deserved 10!</td>', 'Great shot!  I especially like the milk coating the berry.  Very good depth of field.  Great lighting.  Nothing about this picture I don''t like.  A well deserved 10!', '2002-12-04 01:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
