(162997, 9038, 4967, '<td valign="top">The great 3 million dollar Canberra flagpost?  BEAUTIFUL!  What happened to the flag though?  Wish the flag was flapping in the wind, it would have made the picture more interesting... I have a very similar picture.  Good luck!</td>', 'The great 3 million dollar Canberra flagpost?  BEAUTIFUL!  What happened to the flag though?  Wish the flag was flapping in the wind, it would have made the picture more interesting... I have a very similar picture.  Good luck!', '2002-12-02 00:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(162998, 9038, 4648, '<td valign="top">I hope you tell us what this is.  I sure can''t figure it out.  It''s nice and clear, good focus, don''t know how good the cropping is cause I don''t know how big it is or what it is.  What I see I like, would just like to see more .  PTL</td>', 'I hope you tell us what this is.  I sure can''t figure it out.  It''s nice and clear, good focus, don''t know how good the cropping is cause I don''t know how big it is or what it is.  What I see I like, would just like to see more .  PTL', '2002-12-02 16:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(162999, 9038, 4338, '<td valign="top">thats a neat object, what ever it is nice clear blue sky....</td>', 'thats a neat object, what ever it is nice clear blue sky....', '2002-12-02 19:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
