(163005, 9039, 4388, '<td valign="top">it looks like this might have been taken with an on camera flash.  using an on camera flash makes the picture look flat.  if you didn''t use the on camera flash then the lighting was similar to an on camera flash. try it with different lighting.</td>', 'it looks like this might have been taken with an on camera flash.  using an on camera flash makes the picture look flat.  if you didn''t use the on camera flash then the lighting was similar to an on camera flash. try it with different lighting.', '2002-12-02 21:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
