(163008, 9040, 5158, '<td valign="top">For me the nicest macro shot of this challenge! <br/>Thumb up!</td>', 'For me the nicest macro shot of this challenge! Thumb up!', '2002-12-02 10:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(163009, 9040, 3859, '<td valign="top">This is a great idea, however, leaving off the green and multi-colored thread would give it more of a blue feel/look.</td>', 'This is a great idea, however, leaving off the green and multi-colored thread would give it more of a blue feel/look.', '2002-12-02 11:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(163010, 9040, 4967, '<td valign="top">Nice... I like it a lot... good placing, nice blues... and very good lighting... I''m giving this a 9, because it doesn''t wow me as much as a few of the other picture.  Nice job though, and good luck!</td>', 'Nice... I like it a lot... good placing, nice blues... and very good lighting... I''m giving this a 9, because it doesn''t wow me as much as a few of the other picture.  Nice job though, and good luck!', '2002-12-02 16:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(163011, 9040, 327, '<td valign="top">Pretty. You must sew, I appreciate that fact since I can''t sew a button on. Okay I can, but it''ll fall off in a week!! Nice shot with good composition. Justine</td>', 'Pretty. You must sew, I appreciate that fact since I can''t sew a button on. Okay I can, but it''ll fall off in a week!! Nice shot with good composition. Justine', '2002-12-02 18:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(163012, 9041, 4625, '<td valign="top">Outstanding sunset. The colors are very smooth, which I like a great deal. The silhouette of hte tree is nice, though a lower angle might have made it even better, since part of the tree wouldn''t have been lost in the dark hilly background. I would have liked to see the hills lowered to the point where the color variance isn''t there (is that a lake?) and the tree raised so only part of base of the branches are visible in the silhouette. So, just a different angle would have been great I think. Still an oustanding shot though.</td>', 'Outstanding sunset. The colors are very smooth, which I like a great deal. The silhouette of hte tree is nice, though a lower angle might have made it even better, since part of the tree wouldn''t have been lost in the dark hilly background. I would have liked to see the hills lowered to the point where the color variance isn''t there (is that a lake?) and the tree raised so only part of base of the branches are visible in the silhouette. So, just a different angle would have been great I think. Still an oustanding shot though.', '2002-12-02 00:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
