(163251, 9088, 4967, '<td valign="top">Is this a lady bug!  I''ve only seen ones with red with black spots!  Very cool!  Great focus on this little "gal" and I like the blue she''s walking on.... very cool.  I would have gone for maybe a black background?  Also cleaning the ?cup? might have helped a bit.  Good picture overall, I like the crisp, nice colors... and great idea.  To make it slightly better I would have had the ladybug walking into the picture not out.  Nice job though, and good luck!</td>', 'Is this a lady bug!  I''ve only seen ones with red with black spots!  Very cool!  Great focus on this little "gal" and I like the blue she''s walking on.... very cool.  I would have gone for maybe a black background?  Also cleaning the ?cup? might have helped a bit.  Good picture overall, I like the crisp, nice colors... and great idea.  To make it slightly better I would have had the ladybug walking into the picture not out.  Nice job though, and good luck!', '2002-12-02 15:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
