(163287, 9093, 4186, '<td valign="top">a little more off center would have been better compositionally, i think. not sure. the off white in the lower left hand corner is too... distracting, i guess. the lines are beautiful, and the color distrubution fantastic. abstract things rule. it''s not perfect, but i like it enough to give it a ten anyways.</td>', 'a little more off center would have been better compositionally, i think. not sure. the off white in the lower left hand corner is too... distracting, i guess. the lines are beautiful, and the color distrubution fantastic. abstract things rule. it''s not perfect, but i like it enough to give it a ten anyways.', '2002-12-03 00:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
