(163289, 9093, 1041, '<td valign="top">challenge ~ met<br/>composition (content) ~ interesting swirls ... is it water with foodcoloring or something?  i would have placed the swirl exactly in the center, or used the rule of thirds ... you are somewhere in between. <br/>background ~ background and subject are kind of the same, so it''s hard to say.  a slightly tighter crop could''ve gotten rid of the bottom left corner which doesn''t fit in with the rest of the shot.<br/>camera work (technical) ~ fine.<br/>digital processing (technical) ~ good.  <br/>my opinion ~ it''s abstract, but not so abstract that i can''t even guess at what it may be (although my guess may be wrong, at least i can visualize something out of the photo).  i would''ve liked a little less white, and maybe some more sharp lines, but that may not have been possible, and that''s also just personal taste, especially for an abstract photo.  overall good shot.<br/>~~ gr8photos</td>', 'challenge ~ metcomposition (content) ~ interesting swirls ... is it water with foodcoloring or something?  i would have placed the swirl exactly in the center, or used the rule of thirds ... you are somewhere in between. background ~ background and subject are kind of the same, so it''s hard to say.  a slightly tighter crop could''ve gotten rid of the bottom left corner which doesn''t fit in with the rest of the shot.camera work (technical) ~ fine.digital processing (technical) ~ good.  my opinion ~ it''s abstract, but not so abstract that i can''t even guess at what it may be (although my guess may be wrong, at least i can visualize something out of the photo).  i would''ve liked a little less white, and maybe some more sharp lines, but that may not have been possible, and that''s also just personal taste, especially for an abstract photo.  overall good shot.~~ gr8photos', '2002-12-03 16:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
