(163371, 9111, 4388, '<td valign="top">something about the bright white at the bottom of the picture... maybe a different color or more of the denim or something not so glaring?  otherwise a great picture, good composition and focus.</td>', 'something about the bright white at the bottom of the picture... maybe a different color or more of the denim or something not so glaring?  otherwise a great picture, good composition and focus.', '2002-12-02 22:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(163372, 9111, 1005, '<td valign="top">Sooo cute!  Very nice macro.  I am going to -1 point, because the mouse is the subject, more than the pants (the blue part).  Still 9 is a very strong score!  Swash</td>', 'Sooo cute!  Very nice macro.  I am going to -1 point, because the mouse is the subject, more than the pants (the blue part).  Still 9 is a very strong score!  Swash', '2002-12-03 15:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(163373, 9114, 4514, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  I like it very much</td>', 'Nice shot.  I like it very much', '2002-12-02 00:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(163374, 9114, 4753, '<td valign="top">interesting lines... but try straightening it.</td>', 'interesting lines... but try straightening it.', '2002-12-02 00:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(163375, 9114, 4906, '<td valign="top">Shame about foreground shadow, may have worked better in landscape cropped closer to dispensers.</td>', 'Shame about foreground shadow, may have worked better in landscape cropped closer to dispensers.', '2002-12-02 04:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(163376, 9114, 5158, '<td valign="top">That''s a good one!</td>', 'That''s a good one!', '2002-12-02 05:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(163377, 9114, 714, '<td valign="top">This would have been a perfect photo if it you were to crop out the shadow.</td>', 'This would have been a perfect photo if it you were to crop out the shadow.', '2002-12-02 09:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(163378, 9114, 2302, '<td valign="top">The dark shadow in the street is a bit distracting but I like this set up and feel of this shot. If you could have placed the newstands further down in the picture and showed more wall it would have emphasized the blue a bit more - but I am not sure if that would have been possible here.</td>', 'The dark shadow in the street is a bit distracting but I like this set up and feel of this shot. If you could have placed the newstands further down in the picture and showed more wall it would have emphasized the blue a bit more - but I am not sure if that would have been possible here.', '2002-12-02 11:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(163379, 9114, 3859, '<td valign="top">At first I was really taken with this shot.  As I scrolled down and saw the large amount of black (shadow maybe?) I was a little disappointed.  Cropping off the dark and putting the paper stands in landscape mode would make this a "wow" shot, for sure!</td>', 'At first I was really taken with this shot.  As I scrolled down and saw the large amount of black (shadow maybe?) I was a little disappointed.  Cropping off the dark and putting the paper stands in landscape mode would make this a "wow" shot, for sure!', '2002-12-02 11:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(163380, 9114, 4967, '<td valign="top">Very nice and simple... I really like it!  Good choice of composition... very well done... Good luck!</td>', 'Very nice and simple... I really like it!  Good choice of composition... very well done... Good luck!', '2002-12-02 12:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(163381, 9114, 3102, '<td valign="top">Would have probably preferred this as a horizontal shot without the shadow at the bottom.  Great concept, though.</td>', 'Would have probably preferred this as a horizontal shot without the shadow at the bottom.  Great concept, though.', '2002-12-02 13:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(163382, 9114, 1327, '<td valign="top">They look like yelling anime characters.  Nice picture.</td>', 'They look like yelling anime characters.  Nice picture.', '2002-12-02 22:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(163383, 9114, 2125, '<td valign="top">great but I would crop above the shadow in front</td>', 'great but I would crop above the shadow in front', '2002-12-03 20:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(163385, 9115, 4529, '<td valign="top">Nice quilt.  Maybe a macro shot would have been better.</td>', 'Nice quilt.  Maybe a macro shot would have been better.', '2002-12-02 09:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(163386, 9115, 2302, '<td valign="top">The composition here is just too flat for my taste. Good lighting, good focus, but I don''t get much inspiration from the picture.</td>', 'The composition here is just too flat for my taste. Good lighting, good focus, but I don''t get much inspiration from the picture.', '2002-12-02 14:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(163387, 9115, 327, '<td valign="top">Darling spread. WOW. Did you make that? Very cool. The shot is cute too, great idea, but the jeans are a little lost......they match the background too well.  However I admire your effort, and the shot is clean, clear and well lit. Justine</td>', 'Darling spread. WOW. Did you make that? Very cool. The shot is cute too, great idea, but the jeans are a little lost......they match the background too well.  However I admire your effort, and the shot is clean, clear and well lit. Justine', '2002-12-02 19:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(163388, 9115, 4388, '<td valign="top">looks like this picture was taken with an on camera flash which makes the picture look flat.  also, too much of the same color and/or texture, not enough contrast.  color saturation would help.</td>', 'looks like this picture was taken with an on camera flash which makes the picture look flat.  also, too much of the same color and/or texture, not enough contrast.  color saturation would help.', '2002-12-02 22:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(163389, 9115, 4267, '<td valign="top">kinda boring</td>', 'kinda boring', '2002-12-04 01:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(163390, 9116, 4267, '<td valign="top">not sure how the title fits... but great use of contrasting colors...<br/>~anachronite</td>', 'not sure how the title fits... but great use of contrasting colors...~anachronite', '2002-12-02 02:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(163391, 9116, 4625, '<td valign="top">I like how bright the blue is in this one. Normally I wouldn''t but in this shot it works well. Nice picture.</td>', 'I like how bright the blue is in this one. Normally I wouldn''t but in this shot it works well. Nice picture.', '2002-12-02 02:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(163392, 9116, 4529, '<td valign="top">Very emotive.  Interesting use and great idea.  Shoes seem blurry, maybe illusion but still a great shot and a great idea.</td>', 'Very emotive.  Interesting use and great idea.  Shoes seem blurry, maybe illusion but still a great shot and a great idea.', '2002-12-02 09:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(163393, 9116, 4967, '<td valign="top">I like the contrasts here... the shoes could have been a little clearer, look slightly blurry, and the sand looks burnt out in a few places.  Nice idea though... and very striking blue!  Lucky you... much warmer then where I am &amp;lt;GRIN&amp;gt;.  Good luck!</td>', 'I like the contrasts here... the shoes could have been a little clearer, look slightly blurry, and the sand looks burnt out in a few places.  Nice idea though... and very striking blue!  Lucky you... much warmer then where I am &lt;GRIN&gt;.  Good luck!', '2002-12-02 16:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(163394, 9116, 327, '<td valign="top">This is a very eye catching shot. I loved it as I skimmed the thumbnails also. Nice shot....stunning! It would make a good travel poster. Bravo!!!! Justine.</td>', 'This is a very eye catching shot. I loved it as I skimmed the thumbnails also. Nice shot....stunning! It would make a good travel poster. Bravo!!!! Justine.', '2002-12-02 18:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(163395, 9116, 3018, '<td valign="top">Good composition, blues are great.</td>', 'Good composition, blues are great.', '2002-12-02 19:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(163396, 9116, 4388, '<td valign="top">i like the color but maybe another angle showing more of the beach or even some of the water might make this photo look better.</td>', 'i like the color but maybe another angle showing more of the beach or even some of the water might make this photo look better.', '2002-12-03 03:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(163397, 9116, 2295, '<td valign="top">Definately blue.  Focus and lighting are great.  Really meets the challenge.  8 tomlw</td>', 'Definately blue.  Focus and lighting are great.  Really meets the challenge.  8 tomlw', '2002-12-03 08:37:00.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(163398, 9116, 3859, '<td valign="top">This is wonderful!  An excellent choice of blue.  You''ll do well, I''m sure.</td>', 'This is wonderful!  An excellent choice of blue.  You''ll do well, I''m sure.', '2002-12-03 23:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(163399, 9116, 3273, '<td valign="top">Can''t see what it has to do with Christmas (except for the hot weather bit) but it''s a great shot!</td>', 'Can''t see what it has to do with Christmas (except for the hot weather bit) but it''s a great shot!', '2002-12-04 02:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(163400, 9117, 4625, '<td valign="top">Excellent use of the background. The white against the blue sky is superb. An angle that showed the cross at the top of hte steeple would have improved the shot slightly, but the mutliple tears of the roof are composed well from this angle, which I like. Also, a good time of day, the shadows in the pic are very limitted, too many shadows would have taken away from the contrast with the background.</td>', 'Excellent use of the background. The white against the blue sky is superb. An angle that showed the cross at the top of hte steeple would have improved the shot slightly, but the mutliple tears of the roof are composed well from this angle, which I like. Also, a good time of day, the shadows in the pic are very limitted, too many shadows would have taken away from the contrast with the background.', '2002-12-02 00:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(163401, 9117, 4753, '<td valign="top">simple and elegant... not sure what is blue besides the sky... but ok</td>', 'simple and elegant... not sure what is blue besides the sky... but ok', '2002-12-02 00:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(163402, 9117, 4967, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, the thing that could have made this better would be to have the rim around the shutters painted blue... hehehe... very nice.  I like this very simple picture quite a bit, and the blue of the sky is beautiful.  NIce job and good luck!</td>', 'Beautiful, the thing that could have made this better would be to have the rim around the shutters painted blue... hehehe... very nice.  I like this very simple picture quite a bit, and the blue of the sky is beautiful.  NIce job and good luck!', '2002-12-02 01:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(163403, 9117, 3032, '<td valign="top">Try this shot, but stand back and zoom in, you''ll get a less distorted view.<br/>Very clean, good sky</td>', 'Try this shot, but stand back and zoom in, you''ll get a less distorted view.Very clean, good sky', '2002-12-02 08:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(163404, 9117, 5344, '<td valign="top">GREAT PHOTO</td>', 'GREAT PHOTO', '2002-12-02 12:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(163406, 9117, 4494, '<td valign="top">I like the contrast in this one.</td>', 'I like the contrast in this one.', '2002-12-02 16:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(163407, 9117, 327, '<td valign="top">Your on the top of the heap!!! THIS is a good good shot. O'' love it. Clean, clear, crisp, blue shot! I like this. Justine</td>', 'Your on the top of the heap!!! THIS is a good good shot. O'' love it. Clean, clear, crisp, blue shot! I like this. Justine', '2002-12-02 19:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(163408, 9117, 4388, '<td valign="top">great comp., but the whole picture looks like you could apply fade correction to it to liven it up or brighten it up. very nice.</td>', 'great comp., but the whole picture looks like you could apply fade correction to it to liven it up or brighten it up. very nice.', '2002-12-03 03:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(163409, 9117, 4267, '<td valign="top">the white steeple is much more powerful in this pic than the blue sky and detracts from the theme of blue needed for the challenge<br/>~anachronite</td>', 'the white steeple is much more powerful in this pic than the blue sky and detracts from the theme of blue needed for the challenge~anachronite', '2002-12-04 00:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(163410, 9117, 2567, '<td valign="top">Great angles.</td>', 'Great angles.', '2002-12-04 01:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(163411, 9118, 4967, '<td valign="top">I would have tried some different lighting.  I like the way you put this on the marble somewhat reflecting surface, as the shine of blue it gives off is very nice... this is cute, but maybe next time try not putting them all in almost a line... one of the origami''s diagonal might have been nice?  Good job, and good luck!</td>', 'I would have tried some different lighting.  I like the way you put this on the marble somewhat reflecting surface, as the shine of blue it gives off is very nice... this is cute, but maybe next time try not putting them all in almost a line... one of the origami''s diagonal might have been nice?  Good job, and good luck!', '2002-12-02 01:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(163412, 9118, 4267, '<td valign="top">lol I almost went to an origami show... good thing I didn''t or we woulda been two with the same original plan! :o) I like how the light refracts through the globe... but overall the pic looks like it could be a bit less bright<br/>~anachronite</td>', 'lol I almost went to an origami show... good thing I didn''t or we woulda been two with the same original plan! :o) I like how the light refracts through the globe... but overall the pic looks like it could be a bit less bright~anachronite', '2002-12-02 02:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(163413, 9118, 4210, '<td valign="top">I''m wondering if you tried any close up shots of the dragon(?) on the right. Could be interesting to try.</td>', 'I''m wondering if you tried any close up shots of the dragon(?) on the right. Could be interesting to try.', '2002-12-02 10:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(163414, 9118, 4388, '<td valign="top">the lighting is very good.  the composition could be improved, there is nothing in the foreground and the edge of the surface shows at the bottom left.</td>', 'the lighting is very good.  the composition could be improved, there is nothing in the foreground and the edge of the surface shows at the bottom left.', '2002-12-02 23:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(163415, 9118, 4494, '<td valign="top">Nice.</td>', 'Nice.', '2002-12-03 00:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(163416, 9119, 4753, '<td valign="top">I like it... but what makes it blue besides paint?</td>', 'I like it... but what makes it blue besides paint?', '2002-12-02 01:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(163417, 9119, 4906, '<td valign="top">Picture seems a little dark.</td>', 'Picture seems a little dark.', '2002-12-02 04:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(163418, 9119, 4793, '<td valign="top">This photo would be very nice if you  had made it light to read the sign on the door.</td>', 'This photo would be very nice if you  had made it light to read the sign on the door.', '2002-12-02 10:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(163419, 9119, 4648, '<td valign="top">It''s a beautiful picture.  I just wish I could read the sign on the door better - "Burrey Lanes?"  It''s a really good photo.  PTL</td>', 'It''s a beautiful picture.  I just wish I could read the sign on the door better - "Burrey Lanes?"  It''s a really good photo.  PTL', '2002-12-02 15:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(163420, 9119, 5486, '<td valign="top">this should be a postcard :)...makes me wonder what behind the door.</td>', 'this should be a postcard :)...makes me wonder what behind the door.', '2002-12-02 17:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(163421, 9119, 327, '<td valign="top">Eeewwie I like this shot very much. I would of liked the top of the door a bit lighter and you can still do that with levels. The bottom also needs to be trimmed just a hair! WOW this is cool.....The secret garden...Pretty shot. Love it very much.  Where ever this is I hope you can go here and shoot more .....!!! Justine</td>', 'Eeewwie I like this shot very much. I would of liked the top of the door a bit lighter and you can still do that with levels. The bottom also needs to be trimmed just a hair! WOW this is cool.....The secret garden...Pretty shot. Love it very much.  Where ever this is I hope you can go here and shoot more .....!!! Justine', '2002-12-02 19:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(163422, 9119, 4049, '<td valign="top">The secret garden was one of my favorite books as a child.</td>', 'The secret garden was one of my favorite books as a child.', '2002-12-02 19:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(163423, 9119, 4585, '<td valign="top">Too bad it was probably overcast when you took this shot.....Lighting would have enriched (especially at sunset) the blue here...Love the subject though.....Good luck!</td>', 'Too bad it was probably overcast when you took this shot.....Lighting would have enriched (especially at sunset) the blue here...Love the subject though.....Good luck!', '2002-12-02 20:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(163424, 9119, 1041, '<td valign="top">challenge ~ met<br/>composition (content) ~ nice framing by the growth over the wall at the top, and good placement of door to the side.  colors are a little more muted than i personally prefer.  good detail throughout though.  i would''ve cropped the bottom just a little more, maybe just to the bottom of the blue panels, so that the sidewalk is not visible.<br/>background ~ nice and simple, complements w/out distracting.<br/>camera work (technical) ~ ok<br/>digital processing (technical) ~ photo could be a little sharper through use of unsharpen mask.  other than that, the photo is fine, no visible pixelation or anything like that.<br/>my opinion ~ i have a thing for open doors, they suggest mystery and make you wonder what''s behind.  you enhanced this further by making just a little bit of what''s behind the door visible.  i don''t care much for the signs on the door or the doorbell on the right, they take away a little from the oldfashioned kind of feel of the shot, but i understand you didn''t have control over those and couldn''t very well remove them  ;)<br/>~~ gr8photos</td>', 'challenge ~ metcomposition (content) ~ nice framing by the growth over the wall at the top, and good placement of door to the side.  colors are a little more muted than i personally prefer.  good detail throughout though.  i would''ve cropped the bottom just a little more, maybe just to the bottom of the blue panels, so that the sidewalk is not visible.background ~ nice and simple, complements w/out distracting.camera work (technical) ~ okdigital processing (technical) ~ photo could be a little sharper through use of unsharpen mask.  other than that, the photo is fine, no visible pixelation or anything like that.my opinion ~ i have a thing for open doors, they suggest mystery and make you wonder what''s behind.  you enhanced this further by making just a little bit of what''s behind the door visible.  i don''t care much for the signs on the door or the doorbell on the right, they take away a little from the oldfashioned kind of feel of the shot, but i understand you didn''t have control over those and couldn''t very well remove them  ;)~~ gr8photos', '2002-12-03 13:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(163425, 9119, 2125, '<td valign="top">i like this idea, 2 things I would try maybe a fill flash to get the door evenly lit and open the door wider to show what is behind it...okay 3 things I would try cropping out the lower floor to just start the pic at the white... 7 rll07</td>', 'i like this idea, 2 things I would try maybe a fill flash to get the door evenly lit and open the door wider to show what is behind it...okay 3 things I would try cropping out the lower floor to just start the pic at the white... 7 rll07', '2002-12-03 20:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(163426, 9119, 4267, '<td valign="top">lol someone did some checking into the red contest it appears.. I have seen this image before.. but I won''t count off for that... if anything an extra point for doing your homework! nice pic<br/>~anachronite</td>', 'lol someone did some checking into the red contest it appears.. I have seen this image before.. but I won''t count off for that... if anything an extra point for doing your homework! nice pic~anachronite', '2002-12-04 00:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(163427, 9122, 3032, '<td valign="top">Oversharpened? The sky looks so unnatural grainy.</td>', 'Oversharpened? The sky looks so unnatural grainy.', '2002-12-02 08:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(163428, 9122, 4529, '<td valign="top">I''m seeing a lot of sky but this is good color.</td>', 'I''m seeing a lot of sky but this is good color.', '2002-12-02 09:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(163429, 9122, 4494, '<td valign="top">Very boring picture.  No offense, just not much subject matter. :(</td>', 'Very boring picture.  No offense, just not much subject matter. :(', '2002-12-02 16:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(163430, 9122, 1143, '<td valign="top">YUP. That''s blue  :o)   The lighting on the tree seems a bit harsh maybe. There might also be just a little too much empty space. The would probably work better if the tree were in fog or had some snow or something to make it a little more interesting.  OH! Orange or yellow leaves would work, but it''s too late for those now.  There were quite a few tree/sky shots so it''s gonna be tough competing.  Good luck! ~indi</td>', 'YUP. That''s blue  :o)   The lighting on the tree seems a bit harsh maybe. There might also be just a little too much empty space. The would probably work better if the tree were in fog or had some snow or something to make it a little more interesting.  OH! Orange or yellow leaves would work, but it''s too late for those now.  There were quite a few tree/sky shots so it''s gonna be tough competing.  Good luck! ~indi', '2002-12-02 21:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(163431, 9123, 3859, '<td valign="top">Beautiful eyes, but out of focus.</td>', 'Beautiful eyes, but out of focus.', '2002-12-02 01:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(163432, 9123, 5250, '<td valign="top">If the eyes were in focus, you would have scored much heigher.</td>', 'If the eyes were in focus, you would have scored much heigher.', '2002-12-02 01:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(163433, 9123, 4625, '<td valign="top">The focus is poor...</td>', 'The focus is poor...', '2002-12-02 02:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(163434, 9123, 3102, '<td valign="top">Perhaps at least one of you needs glasses...?  :)</td>', 'Perhaps at least one of you needs glasses...?  :)', '2002-12-02 09:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(163435, 9123, 5044, '<td valign="top">I''m sure she has nice eyes, but you can''t tell from this pic.1</td>', 'I''m sure she has nice eyes, but you can''t tell from this pic.1', '2002-12-02 09:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(163436, 9123, 5158, '<td valign="top">Sad that it is not in focus! Otherwise it would be the best "blue-eye"-shot of this challenge</td>', 'Sad that it is not in focus! Otherwise it would be the best "blue-eye"-shot of this challenge', '2002-12-02 10:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(163437, 9123, 2295, '<td valign="top">Hmmm, seems really out of focus to me.  Meets the challenge though.  5 tomlw</td>', 'Hmmm, seems really out of focus to me.  Meets the challenge though.  5 tomlw', '2002-12-02 12:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(163438, 9123, 5344, '<td valign="top">PRETTY EYES</td>', 'PRETTY EYES', '2002-12-02 12:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(163439, 9123, 3127, '<td valign="top">Photo is too blurry.</td>', 'Photo is too blurry.', '2002-12-02 12:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(163440, 9123, 327, '<td valign="top">Okay but they are really out of focus. Your lighting was good. Justine</td>', 'Okay but they are really out of focus. Your lighting was good. Justine', '2002-12-02 19:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(163441, 9123, 472, '<td valign="top">focus lets this down</td>', 'focus lets this down', '2002-12-02 20:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(163442, 9123, 772, '<td valign="top">Greetings from the Critique Club :)<br/><br/>I believe I understand your intentions with this photo.  The blue eyes are the subject....  What I find particularly disturbing with this photo is the lack of focus.  If you did this intentionally, I don''t see where it adds impact to the image.  I think that this image could also create more visual impact if you tilted the camera just a bit to add a more bizarre approach to the composition.  <br/><br/>I feel fairly confident that your comments this week will be centered around the focus moreso than anything else.  <br/><br/>John Setzler</td>', 'Greetings from the Critique Club :)I believe I understand your intentions with this photo.  The blue eyes are the subject....  What I find particularly disturbing with this photo is the lack of focus.  If you did this intentionally, I don''t see where it adds impact to the image.  I think that this image could also create more visual impact if you tilted the camera just a bit to add a more bizarre approach to the composition.  I feel fairly confident that your comments this week will be centered around the focus moreso than anything else.  John Setzler', '2002-12-02 23:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(163443, 9123, 4494, '<td valign="top">Your "partner''s" blue eyes are blurry.  Whooops.</td>', 'Your "partner''s" blue eyes are blurry.  Whooops.', '2002-12-03 01:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(163444, 9123, 3380, '<td valign="top">Subject matter is good, but the clarity is off. Cropping is also good.</td>', 'Subject matter is good, but the clarity is off. Cropping is also good.', '2002-12-03 04:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
