(163538, 9138, 4186, '<td valign="top">cropped differently, this could be a fantastic shot. the bright part of the water in the upper center needs to touch the edges. it''s too disjoint otherwise. i would have cropped it vertically, in the 427x640 format, and hoped the enlarging did not mess up the quality.</td>', 'cropped differently, this could be a fantastic shot. the bright part of the water in the upper center needs to touch the edges. it''s too disjoint otherwise. i would have cropped it vertically, in the 427x640 format, and hoped the enlarging did not mess up the quality.', '2002-12-02 01:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(163539, 9138, 4753, '<td valign="top">green works... blueness is deeper than color... sorry for the pun on your title...</td>', 'green works... blueness is deeper than color... sorry for the pun on your title...', '2002-12-02 02:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(163540, 9138, 4625, '<td valign="top">This would have looked better if the lightsource wasn''t visible. And if the hue was changed to be bluer.</td>', 'This would have looked better if the lightsource wasn''t visible. And if the hue was changed to be bluer.', '2002-12-02 02:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
