(163546, 9138, 5486, '<td valign="top">wish the photo were more blue...less green. i also wonder what that little light is that is off to the left.  there is no real focus here, however i like the concept.</td>', 'wish the photo were more blue...less green. i also wonder what that little light is that is off to the left.  there is no real focus here, however i like the concept.', '2002-12-02 17:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
