(163554, 9141, 4906, '<td valign="top">I don''t think the yellow bits in the water add anything to the picture. Lots of reflections of person taking photo too.</td>', 'I don''t think the yellow bits in the water add anything to the picture. Lots of reflections of person taking photo too.', '2002-12-02 04:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(163555, 9141, 4967, '<td valign="top">A different angle might have been more effective for this.  Good stop action, and I love the ripples and the interspersed blue and white... What are the yellow things?  Leaves?  Nice job, good luck!</td>', 'A different angle might have been more effective for this.  Good stop action, and I love the ripples and the interspersed blue and white... What are the yellow things?  Leaves?  Nice job, good luck!', '2002-12-02 11:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(163556, 9141, 4648, '<td valign="top">To modern artsy for me.  So I see a person in there?  I won''t punish you for my tastes.  I just don''t like modern art.  A 5 won''t hurt your score, and in some cases might even help.  PTL</td>', 'To modern artsy for me.  So I see a person in there?  I won''t punish you for my tastes.  I just don''t like modern art.  A 5 won''t hurt your score, and in some cases might even help.  PTL', '2002-12-03 18:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
