(163571, 9149, 4967, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure what this is, but it makes me feel green more then blue.  I like the variance in blues though.. but the side white is fairly distracting.  Good luck!</td>', 'I''m not sure what this is, but it makes me feel green more then blue.  I like the variance in blues though.. but the side white is fairly distracting.  Good luck!', '2002-12-02 01:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
