(163578, 9150, 4186, '<td valign="top">nice shot. the lines create a very nice alliteration with the form (basically, good subject matter choice), and the form has an interesting relationship with the edges. the (slightly muted?) red of the lips offsets the blue overtones very nicely. i like how the mask doesn''t look so much sad as it does downwardly contemplative and absent. but hollowness comes with being a mask i suppose. 9.</td>', 'nice shot. the lines create a very nice alliteration with the form (basically, good subject matter choice), and the form has an interesting relationship with the edges. the (slightly muted?) red of the lips offsets the blue overtones very nicely. i like how the mask doesn''t look so much sad as it does downwardly contemplative and absent. but hollowness comes with being a mask i suppose. 9.', '2002-12-02 01:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(163579, 9150, 3273, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure what the things in the bottom left are (perhaps some ties) but they don''t seem to belong in the shot.   Nice tones and clarity in the remainder of the photo.</td>', 'I''m not sure what the things in the bottom left are (perhaps some ties) but they don''t seem to belong in the shot.   Nice tones and clarity in the remainder of the photo.', '2002-12-02 01:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(163580, 9150, 51167, '<td valign="top">Great shot.  I like this shot a lot.  I would have liked to see it cropped a little less tight to get the other eye all the way in the shot.  8- Jubei</td>', 'Great shot.  I like this shot a lot.  I would have liked to see it cropped a little less tight to get the other eye all the way in the shot.  8- Jubei', '2002-12-02 04:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(163581, 9150, 4906, '<td valign="top">Woudl have been better with plain blue to the left of the mask. Nicely lit. 7</td>', 'Woudl have been better with plain blue to the left of the mask. Nicely lit. 7', '2002-12-02 05:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(163582, 9150, 5340, '<td valign="top">Very "graphical" . Excellent composition. Nice lights.</td>', 'Very "graphical" . Excellent composition. Nice lights.', '2002-12-02 08:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(163583, 9150, 4967, '<td valign="top">This is really pretty... I like the blues that you have and the tint even to the white, I think the lighting is nice... and the whole picture has a cool sense around it.  I''m giving this a 9, good job!</td>', 'This is really pretty... I like the blues that you have and the tint even to the white, I think the lighting is nice... and the whole picture has a cool sense around it.  I''m giving this a 9, good job!', '2002-12-02 15:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
