(163585, 9150, 3380, '<td valign="top">Beautiful color lines. It almost looks 3D. It probably couldn''t be avoided, but the items at the bottom left corner are a bit of a distraction. nonetheless this amongst my fav''s this week.</td>', 'Beautiful color lines. It almost looks 3D. It probably couldn''t be avoided, but the items at the bottom left corner are a bit of a distraction. nonetheless this amongst my fav''s this week.', '2002-12-03 04:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
