(163633, 9155, 4648, '<td valign="top">Good focus but cluttered around your subject.  The teddy bear to the left should have been moved out of the way and then zoomed out just a little so he doesn''t look so crowded.  Maybe angle in so you can read the box and see a little more of the hamster.  He''s obviously the subject, not his box.  It''s only there to tell who he is.  Or that''s how I see it.  Just my thoughts.  But is good focus and subject.  PTL</td>', 'Good focus but cluttered around your subject.  The teddy bear to the left should have been moved out of the way and then zoomed out just a little so he doesn''t look so crowded.  Maybe angle in so you can read the box and see a little more of the hamster.  He''s obviously the subject, not his box.  It''s only there to tell who he is.  Or that''s how I see it.  Just my thoughts.  But is good focus and subject.  PTL', '2002-12-03 18:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
