(163941, 9219, 4388, '<td valign="top">nice composition.  the light glares a little on the shiney surface of the leaves washing out the color on them.  it appears to be a single light source.  could have put some kind of reflector on the right side to help balance the light.  looks like you metered on the blue bottle and that caused the rest of the picture to be overexposed.  tough subject with a dark bottle like that, maybe try again metering on the leaves and see what you get.</td>', 'nice composition.  the light glares a little on the shiney surface of the leaves washing out the color on them.  it appears to be a single light source.  could have put some kind of reflector on the right side to help balance the light.  looks like you metered on the blue bottle and that caused the rest of the picture to be overexposed.  tough subject with a dark bottle like that, maybe try again metering on the leaves and see what you get.', '2002-12-02 21:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
