(163969, 9221, 4388, '<td valign="top">i like the blinds and reflection of the blinds, it makes the picture very interesting.</td>', 'i like the blinds and reflection of the blinds, it makes the picture very interesting.', '2002-12-03 20:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(163970, 9221, 4267, '<td valign="top">give us blue...</td>', 'give us blue...', '2002-12-04 00:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(163971, 9221, 5250, '<td valign="top">The reflection on the window is a major problem with this image. It draws attention away from the chess game and to the window. But, I like the reflections of the game pieces in the board.</td>', 'The reflection on the window is a major problem with this image. It draws attention away from the chess game and to the window. But, I like the reflections of the game pieces in the board.', '2002-12-04 02:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(163979, 9223, 3380, '<td valign="top">ooooh ahhhhh. excellent photo. I''m curious as to your camera settings. great job.</td>', 'ooooh ahhhhh. excellent photo. I''m curious as to your camera settings. great job.', '2002-12-02 04:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(163980, 9223, 4967, '<td valign="top">Do you do fireworks for thanksgiving!?  Overall a fairly nice fireworks picture... good stopping of action... and I like the blue.  I would have tried to not have it quite so centered when I cropped, and due to the name, I would have liked to have seen part of the river or something.  Good luck!</td>', 'Do you do fireworks for thanksgiving!?  Overall a fairly nice fireworks picture... good stopping of action... and I like the blue.  I would have tried to not have it quite so centered when I cropped, and due to the name, I would have liked to have seen part of the river or something.  Good luck!', '2002-12-02 15:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(163981, 9223, 4585, '<td valign="top">Wonderful image.  Way to shoot at night and fireworks at that!  Good luck!</td>', 'Wonderful image.  Way to shoot at night and fireworks at that!  Good luck!', '2002-12-02 20:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(163982, 9223, 2716, '<td valign="top">Congratulations.  I haven''t had a chance to try my luck at photographing fire works.  Nice job.  Jacko.  8</td>', 'Congratulations.  I haven''t had a chance to try my luck at photographing fire works.  Nice job.  Jacko.  8', '2002-12-02 20:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(163983, 9223, 3540, '<td valign="top">My first impression is that this should not have been cropped so tightly.  Other than that, exemplary fireworks shot, the kind I''d love to take - Inspzil</td>', 'My first impression is that this should not have been cropped so tightly.  Other than that, exemplary fireworks shot, the kind I''d love to take - Inspzil', '2002-12-03 13:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(163984, 9223, 1005, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot!  My only concern is the marks in the upper right corner.  I don''t know what they are, but it takes a bit away from the shot.  I now see other spots where this is occuring, sorry, don''t know what to suggest.  Still, it''s a great shot, so I''m going for a 9 anyway.  Swash</td>', 'Beautiful shot!  My only concern is the marks in the upper right corner.  I don''t know what they are, but it takes a bit away from the shot.  I now see other spots where this is occuring, sorry, don''t know what to suggest.  Still, it''s a great shot, so I''m going for a 9 anyway.  Swash', '2002-12-03 15:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(163986, 9224, 1143, '<td valign="top">YAY! I really like this. Great use of vibrant colors. Strong composition. Focus on the antlers seems a tad soft, but it may just be the material making it look that way. It''s a very nice christmas shot. ~indi</td>', 'YAY! I really like this. Great use of vibrant colors. Strong composition. Focus on the antlers seems a tad soft, but it may just be the material making it look that way. It''s a very nice christmas shot. ~indi', '2002-12-02 00:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(163987, 9224, 4625, '<td valign="top">very seasonal. It fits blue because of the color, though the color doesn''t fit the picture so great. lighter blues would have felt better for me... and more silvers maybe. Maybe a slightly larger crop as well, so to include the top of the antlers and maybe the rest of the left section too.</td>', 'very seasonal. It fits blue because of the color, though the color doesn''t fit the picture so great. lighter blues would have felt better for me... and more silvers maybe. Maybe a slightly larger crop as well, so to include the top of the antlers and maybe the rest of the left section too.', '2002-12-02 01:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(163988, 9224, 4906, '<td valign="top">Focus could be a little sharper but a nice pic - 8</td>', 'Focus could be a little sharper but a nice pic - 8', '2002-12-02 05:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(163989, 9224, 5455, '<td valign="top">nice curves this one grabbed me</td>', 'nice curves this one grabbed me', '2002-12-02 08:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(163990, 9224, 5212, '<td valign="top">Beautiful! Gave it a nine.</td>', 'Beautiful! Gave it a nine.', '2002-12-02 08:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(163991, 9224, 3127, '<td valign="top">The color contrasts are spectacular. The tiny blur in the front is only a little distracting. This is really a great photo.</td>', 'The color contrasts are spectacular. The tiny blur in the front is only a little distracting. This is really a great photo.', '2002-12-02 11:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(163992, 9224, 2700, '<td valign="top">great setup and croping...</td>', 'great setup and croping...', '2002-12-02 13:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(163993, 9224, 4494, '<td valign="top">Great!!</td>', 'Great!!', '2002-12-03 01:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(163994, 9224, 4536, '<td valign="top">nice composition and color. too bad about the jagged edges on his legs.</td>', 'nice composition and color. too bad about the jagged edges on his legs.', '2002-12-03 18:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(163995, 9224, 5436, '<td valign="top">very nice</td>', 'very nice', '2002-12-04 01:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(163996, 9225, 3127, '<td valign="top">Great detail and shadowing. The odd suspension is nice. Very good photo.</td>', 'Great detail and shadowing. The odd suspension is nice. Very good photo.', '2002-12-02 14:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
