(163998, 9225, 4388, '<td valign="top">interesting composition whith the blurred reflection.  a little off center is slightly distracting.  nice exposure and silvery blue color.</td>', 'interesting composition whith the blurred reflection.  a little off center is slightly distracting.  nice exposure and silvery blue color.', '2002-12-02 21:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
