(164049, 9233, 4267, '<td valign="top">ahh yes lots of blue... the flower however seems to be pretty dominant as well, however using the white background definately helps reduced the flowers power.. no pun intended<br/>~anachronite</td>', 'ahh yes lots of blue... the flower however seems to be pretty dominant as well, however using the white background definately helps reduced the flowers power.. no pun intended~anachronite', '2002-12-02 00:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
