(164051, 9233, 4906, '<td valign="top">Would have preferred the bottom of the bottle to be lighter, but then the top would be too bright. Nice picture though.</td>', 'Would have preferred the bottom of the bottle to be lighter, but then the top would be too bright. Nice picture though.', '2002-12-02 04:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
