(164168, 9256, 3859, '<td valign="top">This is my favorite so far.  And will probably be after I finish voting. Beautifully done.<br/>The lighting is excellent.  I love the shadows on her face. Only thing I would change is to be able to see the very tip end of the instrument. Still, a 10 from me.</td>', 'This is my favorite so far.  And will probably be after I finish voting. Beautifully done.The lighting is excellent.  I love the shadows on her face. Only thing I would change is to be able to see the very tip end of the instrument. Still, a 10 from me.', '2002-12-02 11:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(164169, 9256, 2302, '<td valign="top">just the smalles shift to the right so that the end of the instrument was not cut off would make this perfect.</td>', 'just the smalles shift to the right so that the end of the instrument was not cut off would make this perfect.', '2002-12-02 15:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(164170, 9256, 4811, '<td valign="top">This is a really beautiful image. This reminds me of photos I saw in my camera course that were cross-processed. Subject is very well lighted, and the emotional impact of the picture is strong - I feel sad as well now :) Good luck!</td>', 'This is a really beautiful image. This reminds me of photos I saw in my camera course that were cross-processed. Subject is very well lighted, and the emotional impact of the picture is strong - I feel sad as well now :) Good luck!', '2002-12-02 16:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(164171, 9256, 4967, '<td valign="top">This is a very nice picture... though she looks really cold from the lighting!  Brrrr... I definely would suggest moving her over a little, to get in the whole mandolin, and maybe softer lighting because the shadow is distracting.  Cute picture though.  Good luck with it!  -Ridergal</td>', 'This is a very nice picture... though she looks really cold from the lighting!  Brrrr... I definely would suggest moving her over a little, to get in the whole mandolin, and maybe softer lighting because the shadow is distracting.  Cute picture though.  Good luck with it!  -Ridergal', '2002-12-03 00:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(164172, 9256, 2780, '<td valign="top">Really nice photo. The blue hues throughout fit the sombre mood perfectly, as does her expression and body language. Great :) Konador</td>', 'Really nice photo. The blue hues throughout fit the sombre mood perfectly, as does her expression and body language. Great :) Konador', '2002-12-03 02:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(164173, 9256, 4510, '<td valign="top">great shot, album cover material if I''ve ever seen it</td>', 'great shot, album cover material if I''ve ever seen it', '2002-12-03 08:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(164174, 9256, 2295, '<td valign="top">This is a great photo.  I wish I had the imagination and artistic ability to come up with photos like this.  9 tomlw.</td>', 'This is a great photo.  I wish I had the imagination and artistic ability to come up with photos like this.  9 tomlw.', '2002-12-03 13:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(164175, 9256, 1005, '<td valign="top">I love this shot!  Too bad about the hot pixels!  (doen''t effect your score), if anything, this seems a little too set up, but very well executed.  9 Swash</td>', 'I love this shot!  Too bad about the hot pixels!  (doen''t effect your score), if anything, this seems a little too set up, but very well executed.  9 Swash', '2002-12-03 15:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(164176, 9256, 554, '<td valign="top">Excellent work---in my top three</td>', 'Excellent work---in my top three', '2002-12-03 21:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(164177, 9256, 656, '<td valign="top">Love the lighting, very well done - only small thing is the guitar shadow on the backdrop which spoils it a touch.  The wings are very subtly shown but the lighting has made her legs look slightly deformed because of the position and how the shadows fall on the right shin, looks very twisted as a result.<br/><br/>Almost tempted to suggest cropping at about mid-thigh level, as the box/ seat is quite visible too - this could make an excellent square cropped picture ?<br/><br/>The halo effect is very softly done and works well with the blue theme/ colouring.  Her right hand seems out of focus or blurred though, and her hair seems to have gone green in the light.<br/><br/>A very good entry - interesting in ways most submissions here just don''t achieve.</td>', 'Love the lighting, very well done - only small thing is the guitar shadow on the backdrop which spoils it a touch.  The wings are very subtly shown but the lighting has made her legs look slightly deformed because of the position and how the shadows fall on the right shin, looks very twisted as a result.Almost tempted to suggest cropping at about mid-thigh level, as the box/ seat is quite visible too - this could make an excellent square cropped picture ?The halo effect is very softly done and works well with the blue theme/ colouring.  Her right hand seems out of focus or blurred though, and her hair seems to have gone green in the light.A very good entry - interesting in ways most submissions here just don''t achieve.', '2002-12-03 21:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(164178, 9256, 3002, '<td valign="top">I probably would have given this a ten if you hadn''t lopped off the top of the mandolin.  A very cool shot though!</td>', 'I probably would have given this a ten if you hadn''t lopped off the top of the mandolin.  A very cool shot though!', '2002-12-03 23:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
