(164271, 9045, 3080, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  A little bit of a hot spot to the right, however, still a great emotional piece.  Nothing distracting in the background, and the subject is great. Focus and clarity are also good.  Nice shot. Good luck in the challenge. ~Hbunch7187~</td>', 'Very nice.  A little bit of a hot spot to the right, however, still a great emotional piece.  Nothing distracting in the background, and the subject is great. Focus and clarity are also good.  Nice shot. Good luck in the challenge. ~Hbunch7187~', '2002-12-04 17:26:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(164279, 9219, 472, '<td valign="top">great focus. light''s a little harsh but i like it</td>', 'great focus. light''s a little harsh but i like it', '2002-12-04 17:34:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(164281, 9200, 472, '<td valign="top">great colors. like the idea. let down by focus issues.</td>', 'great colors. like the idea. let down by focus issues.', '2002-12-04 17:35:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(164290, 9080, 327, '<td valign="top">Of course your dog is a cutie....never met or saw a dog I didn''t like. This one has a sweet look. <br/>The problem I see with this photo is the feet on the left. That and the large white area of floor in the lower right. Cropping would of helped some, and I would suggest getting down even lower to the dogs level. Not terrible at all.</td>', 'Of course your dog is a cutie....never met or saw a dog I didn''t like. This one has a sweet look. The problem I see with this photo is the feet on the left. That and the large white area of floor in the lower right. Cropping would of helped some, and I would suggest getting down even lower to the dogs level. Not terrible at all.', '2002-12-04 17:44:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(164294, 8997, 327, '<td valign="top">I''m back to your shot to add a little comment. I really like this and gave it an 8 and at second looks still believe I''m on target. The soft blue tint here is so nice to my eye.<br/>I also like the foreground out of focus. This is not popular with a lot of the voters here.......to me it''s awesome. These are pretty eyes, interesting shot, clear, clean, in focus and on topic!! Good work. Justine</td>', 'I''m back to your shot to add a little comment. I really like this and gave it an 8 and at second looks still believe I''m on target. The soft blue tint here is so nice to my eye.I also like the foreground out of focus. This is not popular with a lot of the voters here.......to me it''s awesome. These are pretty eyes, interesting shot, clear, clean, in focus and on topic!! Good work. Justine', '2002-12-04 17:48:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(164333, 9257, 5495, '<td valign="top">Could''ve been a 9 1/2 with a little better shadow detail....</td>', 'Could''ve been a 9 1/2 with a little better shadow detail....', '2002-12-04 18:20:04.000000', NULL, 1),
