(164371, 9001, 1005, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot.  Suggestion:  crop the lower 1/10, I think the bottom could have easily been the edge of the lake.  Sky seems a tad grainy, was that on purpose?  The trees seem very sharp.  I''ll bet this was gorgeous in person.  7 Swash</td>', 'Interesting shot.  Suggestion:  crop the lower 1/10, I think the bottom could have easily been the edge of the lake.  Sky seems a tad grainy, was that on purpose?  The trees seem very sharp.  I''ll bet this was gorgeous in person.  7 Swash', '2002-12-04 19:17:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(164372, 9029, 2553, '<td valign="top">What an incredible shot!  I love it, and it gets a 10 from me.  lhall</td>', 'What an incredible shot!  I love it, and it gets a 10 from me.  lhall', '2002-12-04 19:17:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(164373, 9255, 1005, '<td valign="top">Great idea!  It comes off pretty good. 8 Swash</td>', 'Great idea!  It comes off pretty good. 8 Swash', '2002-12-01 23:56:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(164375, 8994, 2553, '<td valign="top">One of my 10''s this week, I think this photo is beautiful.  I love the composition, and the balance of light and dark.   lhall</td>', 'One of my 10''s this week, I think this photo is beautiful.  I love the composition, and the balance of light and dark.   lhall', '2002-12-04 19:19:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(164376, 8869, 2553, '<td valign="top">My husband and I have been debating whether this is the Severn River in Maryland, where we are from.  A fabulous shot, I would hang this on my wall in a heartbeat!  A 10 for me.  lhall</td>', 'My husband and I have been debating whether this is the Severn River in Maryland, where we are from.  A fabulous shot, I would hang this on my wall in a heartbeat!  A 10 for me.  lhall', '2002-12-04 19:21:09.000000', NULL, 1),
