(164537, 9104, 1041, '<td valign="top">challenge -- met&lt;br&gt;technical -- i very much like the colors, and the little reflections on the drops add to the pic.&lt;br&gt;composition -- i like that you used the ''other'' rule of three, to use three objects.  it works well, and the pepsi label adds both that necessary touch of color, as well as an indication of the object.  very nicely done.&lt;br&gt;-- gr8photos</td>', 'challenge -- met<br>technical -- i very much like the colors, and the little reflections on the drops add to the pic.<br>composition -- i like that you used the ''other'' rule of three, to use three objects.  it works well, and the pepsi label adds both that necessary touch of color, as well as an indication of the object.  very nicely done.<br>-- gr8photos', '2002-12-01 12:59:27.000000', NULL, 1),
