(164560, 8954, 139, '<td valign="top">Excellent use of negative space.  The camera angle is a bit odd.  The horizontal angle is great -- you''re just the right amount below the dog -- but I would have rather the lens was parallel to the nose.</td>', 'Excellent use of negative space.  The camera angle is a bit odd.  The horizontal angle is great -- you''re just the right amount below the dog -- but I would have rather the lens was parallel to the nose.', '2002-12-04 23:46:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(164562, 9150, 3080, '<td valign="top">Excelent shot!  I''m not usually a huge fan of blown out highlights, however I think it works very nicely here.  I really like the color, and the little touch of red is perfect.  A beautiful subject.  I''m not sure what the little objects down in the lower left hand corner are, but they don''t seem to go with the rest of the shot.  I love the placement of the subject within the frame, and the focus and clarity are awesome.  Great shot. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Excelent shot!  I''m not usually a huge fan of blown out highlights, however I think it works very nicely here.  I really like the color, and the little touch of red is perfect.  A beautiful subject.  I''m not sure what the little objects down in the lower left hand corner are, but they don''t seem to go with the rest of the shot.  I love the placement of the subject within the frame, and the focus and clarity are awesome.  Great shot. Good luck in the challenge.', '2002-12-04 23:47:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(164563, 9045, 4510, '<td valign="top">You have really captured a mood and for me its definitely blue, great shot</td>', 'You have really captured a mood and for me its definitely blue, great shot', '2002-12-04 23:49:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(164564, 9098, 3080, '<td valign="top">This is a post card if I''ve ever seen one.  Colors are great!  Very nice blues.  The cloud is a bit bright, but that doesn''t take away from the shot at all, in fact I think that it helps the sign stand out quite a bit from the background.  Nothing distracting, focus and clarity are great, and the angle and framing/cropping are good as well.  Maybe would like to see just a bit more room to the bottom of the word california, but maybe sizing and cropping restrictions kept you from that.  Great shot. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'This is a post card if I''ve ever seen one.  Colors are great!  Very nice blues.  The cloud is a bit bright, but that doesn''t take away from the shot at all, in fact I think that it helps the sign stand out quite a bit from the background.  Nothing distracting, focus and clarity are great, and the angle and framing/cropping are good as well.  Maybe would like to see just a bit more room to the bottom of the word california, but maybe sizing and cropping restrictions kept you from that.  Great shot. Good luck in the challenge.', '2002-12-04 23:50:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(164565, 8872, 139, '<td valign="top">I assume the startburst was on purpose, but I find it rather distracting.   Similarly with the corner of the building in the foreground on the upper right.   Otherwise the composition is great.  The brightness could have been turned up a little.</td>', 'I assume the startburst was on purpose, but I find it rather distracting.   Similarly with the corner of the building in the foreground on the upper right.   Otherwise the composition is great.  The brightness could have been turned up a little.', '2002-12-04 23:51:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(164568, 9170, 139, '<td valign="top">I would have rather if she was off center to the right instead of to the left, as she is looking left.  Maybe she is supposed to be looking at something you can''t see since she''s longing for something that''s gone, but I think the negative space could have produced the same effect.</td>', 'I would have rather if she was off center to the right instead of to the left, as she is looking left.  Maybe she is supposed to be looking at something you can''t see since she''s longing for something that''s gone, but I think the negative space could have produced the same effect.', '2002-12-04 23:55:09.000000', NULL, 1),
