(164606, 9223, 3080, '<td valign="top">a very nice shot of fireworks.  Kind of hard to get to look good.  I like the blues, and the angle and framing/cropping you have are nice as well.  There are a couple smudgy marks to the upper right that I''m not sure what they are, but they are kind of distracting.  otherwise a great ''blue'' shot. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'a very nice shot of fireworks.  Kind of hard to get to look good.  I like the blues, and the angle and framing/cropping you have are nice as well.  There are a couple smudgy marks to the upper right that I''m not sure what they are, but they are kind of distracting.  otherwise a great ''blue'' shot. Good luck in the challenge.', '2002-12-05 00:33:34.000000', NULL, 1),
