(164612, 9224, 4793, '<td valign="top">I love this shot the colors are so nice, composition is pleasing.</td>', 'I love this shot the colors are so nice, composition is pleasing.', '2002-12-05 00:48:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(164614, 9041, 3936, '<td valign="top">I really like this image.  The sunset is beautiful.  While the reds might steal the attention from the blues a bit, the image would be much less without them.  9</td>', 'I really like this image.  The sunset is beautiful.  While the reds might steal the attention from the blues a bit, the image would be much less without them.  9', '2002-12-05 00:51:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(164625, 9213, 3532, '<td valign="top">I like the composition but it looks like the exposure settings were measured for the ice not the bottles of water, resulting in the bottles being rather underexposed.  I think it would be better to have the bottles a little lighter.</td>', 'I like the composition but it looks like the exposure settings were measured for the ice not the bottles of water, resulting in the bottles being rather underexposed.  I think it would be better to have the bottles a little lighter.', '2002-12-05 01:02:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(164634, 9239, 3532, '<td valign="top">This has a wonderful abstract quality to it.  Very nice composition.</td>', 'This has a wonderful abstract quality to it.  Very nice composition.', '2002-12-05 01:23:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(164639, 9220, 4967, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful photo!  I love your lighting, and the pureness of the blue!  Great job!  Very abstract looking and modern!  It''s really wonderful!  Good luck with it, I give it a 9!</td>', 'This is a beautiful photo!  I love your lighting, and the pureness of the blue!  Great job!  Very abstract looking and modern!  It''s really wonderful!  Good luck with it, I give it a 9!', '2002-12-05 01:29:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(164643, 8997, 3532, '<td valign="top">I like the idea and the use of the hands to frame the eyes.  The top hand though is a little too blurry for me.  It''s hard to even tell it''s a hand, so I think a slightly larger depth of field would have helped.</td>', 'I like the idea and the use of the hands to frame the eyes.  The top hand though is a little too blurry for me.  It''s hard to even tell it''s a hand, so I think a slightly larger depth of field would have helped.', '2002-12-05 01:32:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(164645, 9104, 51167, '<td valign="top">I''m glad they fixed this.  At first I was really interested in seeing this whole thing cause the thumbnail looked awesome.  Then the photo was all green and screwed up.  This is my favorite shot of the week.  I love how clear it is, hope that green didn''t affect your score at first cause this should be up at the top.  Congrats on this awesome shot.</td>', 'I''m glad they fixed this.  At first I was really interested in seeing this whole thing cause the thumbnail looked awesome.  Then the photo was all green and screwed up.  This is my favorite shot of the week.  I love how clear it is, hope that green didn''t affect your score at first cause this should be up at the top.  Congrats on this awesome shot.', '2002-12-05 01:44:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(164667, 9014, 1019, '<td valign="top">This is a great architectural shot--well composed with good colour contrasts-the orange emphasises the blue--good shot  andrewm</td>', 'This is a great architectural shot--well composed with good colour contrasts-the orange emphasises the blue--good shot  andrewm', '2002-12-05 02:21:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(164669, 8902, 1019, '<td valign="top">This photo has a strange fascination--almost surreal  andrewm</td>', 'This photo has a strange fascination--almost surreal  andrewm', '2002-12-05 02:22:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(164670, 9050, 2780, '<td valign="top">I like it. The pale blues go well with the black background, but I think it would be better if you had dipped the pear in paint, rather than painting it, so we couldn''t see the stroke marks. Just my opinion. 8</td>', 'I like it. The pale blues go well with the black background, but I think it would be better if you had dipped the pear in paint, rather than painting it, so we couldn''t see the stroke marks. Just my opinion. 8', '2002-11-30 19:54:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(164672, 9214, 2780, '<td valign="top">This is really.... weird! What is it? I like the mic of blue and green, it works well, and the uncentred composition is good. Its so easy to fall into the trap on centering a single object. One gripe I have with this is that it isnt completly in focus.</td>', 'This is really.... weird! What is it? I like the mic of blue and green, it works well, and the uncentred composition is good. Its so easy to fall into the trap on centering a single object. One gripe I have with this is that it isnt completly in focus.', '2002-12-01 22:28:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(164674, 9183, 2780, '<td valign="top">Really good mix of blue and purple colours, which look great against the black background. 7</td>', 'Really good mix of blue and purple colours, which look great against the black background. 7', '2002-12-01 21:08:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(164677, 9063, 1143, '<td valign="top">Very interesting use of dof. I think I''d prefer more, but I understand that it is your artistic decision. The white spot on the left side is a little distracting b/c it is so bright. Better than most.</td>', 'Very interesting use of dof. I think I''d prefer more, but I understand that it is your artistic decision. The white spot on the left side is a little distracting b/c it is so bright. Better than most.', '2002-12-05 02:39:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(164679, 8984, 1143, '<td valign="top">Probably the best of the gas shots. I like the composition/placement and the high flames. Nice work.</td>', 'Probably the best of the gas shots. I like the composition/placement and the high flames. Nice work.', '2002-11-29 17:49:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(164680, 8948, 1143, '<td valign="top">Ewe! Reminds me of fingerpaints. Definitely a color/texture photo. Seems a tad dark maybe, but I like the little light reflections.</td>', 'Ewe! Reminds me of fingerpaints. Definitely a color/texture photo. Seems a tad dark maybe, but I like the little light reflections.', '2002-11-28 11:01:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(164681, 9015, 1143, '<td valign="top">Nice composition. Interesting lines. Lighting on the white is a tad bright.</td>', 'Nice composition. Interesting lines. Lighting on the white is a tad bright.', '2002-11-30 07:10:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(164682, 9111, 1143, '<td valign="top">This is a very cute little guy. Nice idea. Maybe you could try one with him peeking out of the picket. Better than most. Good job.</td>', 'This is a very cute little guy. Nice idea. Maybe you could try one with him peeking out of the picket. Better than most. Good job.', '2002-12-01 14:00:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(164683, 9124, 1143, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. I like the view and your decision on the shutter speed. The building on the right seems a little too dark and heavy for the rest of the image maybe.</td>', 'Nice shot. I like the view and your decision on the shutter speed. The building on the right seems a little too dark and heavy for the rest of the image maybe.', '2002-12-01 15:49:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(164684, 9173, 1143, '<td valign="top">Nice capture. Extra point for stopping the motion so well. Good composition tho I think I''d prefer this without the fog as it makes the whole shot rather grey instead of blue. I just have a preference for strong colors.</td>', 'Nice capture. Extra point for stopping the motion so well. Good composition tho I think I''d prefer this without the fog as it makes the whole shot rather grey instead of blue. I just have a preference for strong colors.', '2002-12-01 20:45:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(164685, 9117, 1143, '<td valign="top">Great sky color. Lighting on the church is a tad too bright, but you did a pretty good job exposing it anyway. Nice composition and lines.</td>', 'Great sky color. Lighting on the church is a tad too bright, but you did a pretty good job exposing it anyway. Nice composition and lines.', '2002-12-01 14:50:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(164686, 9114, 1143, '<td valign="top">This is cute. I''m not sure that I agree with your decision not to make this a landscape. I do like the layers created by the 3 vertical areas, but I think that you could show it just as well without so much empty space. It''s also a tad off center with more space on the right. If you''re going to make a symmetrical shot then you probably want to watch that.</td>', 'This is cute. I''m not sure that I agree with your decision not to make this a landscape. I do like the layers created by the 3 vertical areas, but I think that you could show it just as well without so much empty space. It''s also a tad off center with more space on the right. If you''re going to make a symmetrical shot then you probably want to watch that.', '2002-12-01 14:40:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(164688, 8880, 1143, '<td valign="top">Very good idea. Points for originality and humor. Very good technically. I''m afraid that the subject, no matter how well done, just isn''t going to make a pretty picture which is what seems to get points around here.</td>', 'Very good idea. Points for originality and humor. Very good technically. I''m afraid that the subject, no matter how well done, just isn''t going to make a pretty picture which is what seems to get points around here.', '2002-11-26 05:21:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(164689, 9201, 1143, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition. I like the lines/angle. The wing blends in a little too well with the sky.</td>', 'Very nice composition. I like the lines/angle. The wing blends in a little too well with the sky.', '2002-12-01 21:45:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(164691, 9085, 1143, '<td valign="top">This reminds me of my macro shot. I love the color. It seems too dark tho, and doesn''t really have a "subject" so my eye keeps searching around with nowhere to land.</td>', 'This reminds me of my macro shot. I love the color. It seems too dark tho, and doesn''t really have a "subject" so my eye keeps searching around with nowhere to land.', '2002-12-01 09:23:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(164693, 9031, 4798, '<td valign="top">Your concept is nice. However, it lacks a spark somewhere. I would have prefered that the "eye brush" were also vertical but leaning slightly away from the other brushes, then vertically crop the shot for more eye impact.  Your background distracts the viewer completely.  Try a complete white or black background in order to isolate the subject that you intend to show. 6</td>', 'Your concept is nice. However, it lacks a spark somewhere. I would have prefered that the "eye brush" were also vertical but leaning slightly away from the other brushes, then vertically crop the shot for more eye impact.  Your background distracts the viewer completely.  Try a complete white or black background in order to isolate the subject that you intend to show. 6', '2002-12-05 02:57:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(164694, 9188, 1143, '<td valign="top">The snow looks overexposed which gives the illusion that the photo just has a white border along the bottom. I think a foreground subject would help - something just left of the middle maybe. A snowman, footprints, a sled....I dunno.</td>', 'The snow looks overexposed which gives the illusion that the photo just has a white border along the bottom. I think a foreground subject would help - something just left of the middle maybe. A snowman, footprints, a sled....I dunno.', '2002-12-01 21:20:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(164695, 8994, 1143, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous purple/blue color. This didn''t turn out to be an original idea, but I like your execution the best. Very pretty.</td>', 'Gorgeous purple/blue color. This didn''t turn out to be an original idea, but I like your execution the best. Very pretty.', '2002-11-29 20:26:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(164696, 8881, 1143, '<td valign="top">Unlike a lot of ppl, I tend to like technical shots more than emotional ones. This is very nice. I like the idea and the execution. It''s grown on me since the first time I viewed it.</td>', 'Unlike a lot of ppl, I tend to like technical shots more than emotional ones. This is very nice. I like the idea and the execution. It''s grown on me since the first time I viewed it.', '2002-11-26 13:12:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(164697, 9196, 4798, '<td valign="top">A nice study of depth and symetry.  I like the words on the wall which you''ve included in this shot which reminds the viewer of a unrequited love, and how we sometimes find ourselves depressed and "tunnelled in". However, the shot has been slightly let down by the oversaturation of blue, which I think you played around with the blue level.  IMO, you could have left the shot completely in color (depending how high the contrast was), while evoking the "blueness" in the viewer''s mind. 7</td>', 'A nice study of depth and symetry.  I like the words on the wall which you''ve included in this shot which reminds the viewer of a unrequited love, and how we sometimes find ourselves depressed and "tunnelled in". However, the shot has been slightly let down by the oversaturation of blue, which I think you played around with the blue level.  IMO, you could have left the shot completely in color (depending how high the contrast was), while evoking the "blueness" in the viewer''s mind. 7', '2002-12-05 03:03:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(164701, 9033, 4798, '<td valign="top">This is almost a documentary shot. However, it doesn''t document nor tell a story strong enough to let the viewer share this gentleman''s "blueness". He doesn''t seem to look sad or down. To my eyes, he looks tired. Also, you have included the tree in the background which covers almost 50% of your shot.  Several suggestion: 1. A close-up shot on the gentleman''s face.  The gentleman''s looks and expression can tell a thousand stories.  2. If the person is sitting down, include his feet. By the look of his attire, his shoes would also tell a different story.  3. If you follow n° 2, vertical crop the shot and disregard (or blur) the background.  Nonetheless, you have a good eye in spotting the moment and your subject, only let down by a few technicalities.  5.</td>', 'This is almost a documentary shot. However, it doesn''t document nor tell a story strong enough to let the viewer share this gentleman''s "blueness". He doesn''t seem to look sad or down. To my eyes, he looks tired. Also, you have included the tree in the background which covers almost 50% of your shot.  Several suggestion: 1. A close-up shot on the gentleman''s face.  The gentleman''s looks and expression can tell a thousand stories.  2. If the person is sitting down, include his feet. By the look of his attire, his shoes would also tell a different story.  3. If you follow n° 2, vertical crop the shot and disregard (or blur) the background.  Nonetheless, you have a good eye in spotting the moment and your subject, only let down by a few technicalities.  5.', '2002-12-05 03:14:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(164702, 9098, 4510, '<td valign="top">Great visual impact, I like it</td>', 'Great visual impact, I like it', '2002-12-05 03:15:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(164704, 9203, 5086, '<td valign="top">Great idea!  Good luck with the challenge...</td>', 'Great idea!  Good luck with the challenge...', '2002-12-05 03:21:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(164706, 9207, 4798, '<td valign="top">While you have a good idea and well executed capture, the shot lacks the flare to keep the viewer''s attention.  The single light source comes from the top and fails to define a clear contour of the glass itself. Instead it blends in with the background and renders the sparkling bubbles uninteresting.  The green reflection of light at the neck of the glass is annoying as it keeps drawing the viewer''s eyes away from the cherries and the bubbles, which I think was your intention of showing the most. Suggestion: Macro shot of the cherries, off-centred, while including some of the bubbles fizzing up, would have made this a more interesting capture.  6</td>', 'While you have a good idea and well executed capture, the shot lacks the flare to keep the viewer''s attention.  The single light source comes from the top and fails to define a clear contour of the glass itself. Instead it blends in with the background and renders the sparkling bubbles uninteresting.  The green reflection of light at the neck of the glass is annoying as it keeps drawing the viewer''s eyes away from the cherries and the bubbles, which I think was your intention of showing the most. Suggestion: Macro shot of the cherries, off-centred, while including some of the bubbles fizzing up, would have made this a more interesting capture.  6', '2002-12-05 03:26:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(164707, 9008, 4510, '<td valign="top">Great shot, one of the best in this challenge, good luck</td>', 'Great shot, one of the best in this challenge, good luck', '2002-12-05 03:30:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(164708, 8863, 4798, '<td valign="top">A very good effort in taking a shot that does not follow the theme completely but yet tries to invoke the viewer mind that theme lies in the shot somewhere.  And we clearly see that in the title bars of these monopoly cards.  It''s been years since I''ve played that game, so I cannot give you a judgement on the concept of shot, but in terms of technicality and composition, it is very good. The DOF is only a fraction off, but the viewer can still read the prints. However, shouldn''t all the blue cards be present in this shot if we were to monopolize the game?  Overall 8.</td>', 'A very good effort in taking a shot that does not follow the theme completely but yet tries to invoke the viewer mind that theme lies in the shot somewhere.  And we clearly see that in the title bars of these monopoly cards.  It''s been years since I''ve played that game, so I cannot give you a judgement on the concept of shot, but in terms of technicality and composition, it is very good. The DOF is only a fraction off, but the viewer can still read the prints. However, shouldn''t all the blue cards be present in this shot if we were to monopolize the game?  Overall 8.', '2002-12-05 03:34:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(164709, 9125, 4798, '<td valign="top">I trust that you are a star (or sky?) watcher.  And I trust you that the little white glow is planet Venus.  Unfortunately, the shot doesn''t hold the viewer''s attention at all.  We just take your word for it.  However, in terms of technicality, your shot is a decent capture.  There is no blurring and I don''t see a major distortion anywhere, so I guess you were either very still in capturing this shot or you used a tripod.  And since it''s dawn, try to capture that crimsony light too with a touch of the horizon somewhere at the bottom of the frame so that the viewer can relate to the objects and depth of the shot. Overall.  5.</td>', 'I trust that you are a star (or sky?) watcher.  And I trust you that the little white glow is planet Venus.  Unfortunately, the shot doesn''t hold the viewer''s attention at all.  We just take your word for it.  However, in terms of technicality, your shot is a decent capture.  There is no blurring and I don''t see a major distortion anywhere, so I guess you were either very still in capturing this shot or you used a tripod.  And since it''s dawn, try to capture that crimsony light too with a touch of the horizon somewhere at the bottom of the frame so that the viewer can relate to the objects and depth of the shot. Overall.  5.', '2002-12-05 03:41:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(164710, 9194, 2337, '<td valign="top">This shot had great potential but suffered from the overly soft focus.  At least for me...</td>', 'This shot had great potential but suffered from the overly soft focus.  At least for me...', '2002-12-05 03:43:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(164711, 9233, 4798, '<td valign="top">A wonderful macro shot.  Good lighting. I would love to see the same pic but 1 stop underexposed to compare.  You have decided to go for shallow depth of field and you have chosen well.  The blue bottle and plate complements the detail of the flower and it shouldn''t distract it.  And this is what you have achieved here.  Overall 8.  (Might come back for a 9).</td>', 'A wonderful macro shot.  Good lighting. I would love to see the same pic but 1 stop underexposed to compare.  You have decided to go for shallow depth of field and you have chosen well.  The blue bottle and plate complements the detail of the flower and it shouldn''t distract it.  And this is what you have achieved here.  Overall 8.  (Might come back for a 9).', '2002-12-05 03:43:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(164713, 9129, 4798, '<td valign="top">A documentary shot.  So what''s story then?  What are these gentlemen waiting for?  You''ve included the metal door on the right which suggest that these workmen maybe waiting for it to open, but yet, they are all huddled on the left of the shot.  The element you have not included in shot is the theme itself, pretty daring, I might say. Composition wise, the gentleman on the left can be left out completely and the same goes for the metal door; I don''t believe these men are waiting for it to open.  If it''s "waiting" that you want to show, close up on the 2 gentlemen including the man in the doorway, so that the viewer can relate to what you want to show.  Overall. 6.</td>', 'A documentary shot.  So what''s story then?  What are these gentlemen waiting for?  You''ve included the metal door on the right which suggest that these workmen maybe waiting for it to open, but yet, they are all huddled on the left of the shot.  The element you have not included in shot is the theme itself, pretty daring, I might say. Composition wise, the gentleman on the left can be left out completely and the same goes for the metal door; I don''t believe these men are waiting for it to open.  If it''s "waiting" that you want to show, close up on the 2 gentlemen including the man in the doorway, so that the viewer can relate to what you want to show.  Overall. 6.', '2002-12-05 03:50:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(164717, 9034, 4798, '<td valign="top">I know how difficult this shot must have been. Macro outdoors. You probably used a tripod.  Somehow the focus seems slightly off, but only by a fraction and not really noticable at first glance. Good composition but a further vertical crop on the left would isolat the foreground even more.  Overal 7.</td>', 'I know how difficult this shot must have been. Macro outdoors. You probably used a tripod.  Somehow the focus seems slightly off, but only by a fraction and not really noticable at first glance. Good composition but a further vertical crop on the left would isolat the foreground even more.  Overal 7.', '2002-12-05 04:02:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(164719, 9088, 4798, '<td valign="top">A very good macro shot. However, the details on the glass is sharper than the little beettle.  Suggestion: Focus on the beetle first, lock the exposure, than recompose your shot. Overall 7.</td>', 'A very good macro shot. However, the details on the glass is sharper than the little beettle.  Suggestion: Focus on the beetle first, lock the exposure, than recompose your shot. Overall 7.', '2002-12-05 04:05:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(164720, 9025, 4798, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot. The viewer almost wants to reach out and touch this little teddy bear to reaussure its existence. And very daring indeed to turn this shot into B&amp;W. However, a horizontal shot which may include other objects on the shelf would have a better and deeper impact on your forgotten teddy bear.  Overall 8.</td>', 'Excellent shot. The viewer almost wants to reach out and touch this little teddy bear to reaussure its existence. And very daring indeed to turn this shot into B&W. However, a horizontal shot which may include other objects on the shelf would have a better and deeper impact on your forgotten teddy bear.  Overall 8.', '2002-12-05 04:11:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(164723, 9098, 4798, '<td valign="top">Great details, and amazingly sharp. You have decided just to show the color blue on the neon sign. The downfall of this picture is the white cloud behind which does not complement the shot at all.  Overall 7.</td>', 'Great details, and amazingly sharp. You have decided just to show the color blue on the neon sign. The downfall of this picture is the white cloud behind which does not complement the shot at all.  Overall 7.', '2002-12-05 04:14:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(164724, 8885, 4798, '<td valign="top">A good macro shot. You have captured the details well enough. Yet the tiled background does not only disctract the viewer but also does not complement to your subject.  Overall 6.</td>', 'A good macro shot. You have captured the details well enough. Yet the tiled background does not only disctract the viewer but also does not complement to your subject.  Overall 6.', '2002-12-05 04:18:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(164726, 9107, 4798, '<td valign="top">There are 2 weak points in this interesting shot. Firstly, your angle of the shot is slightly off. If you had the heart shape bang in the middle, this would have made an intentional interesting symmetrical shot while also portraying the opposite in the shadows on the white wall. Secondly, a further crop on the top till the edge of the heart shape would have finished the composition, creating a deeper impact.  Overall 7.</td>', 'There are 2 weak points in this interesting shot. Firstly, your angle of the shot is slightly off. If you had the heart shape bang in the middle, this would have made an intentional interesting symmetrical shot while also portraying the opposite in the shadows on the white wall. Secondly, a further crop on the top till the edge of the heart shape would have finished the composition, creating a deeper impact.  Overall 7.', '2002-12-05 04:28:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(164729, 9170, 4798, '<td valign="top">Honestly, this is really a very interesting and brilliant shot. The expression is so well captured, even her nose has a slight tint of pink, giving the hint that she''s been crying before.  The lighting on the left is slightly too harsh or too direct and it seems that the shot has a slight yellow cast over it.  Overall 8.</td>', 'Honestly, this is really a very interesting and brilliant shot. The expression is so well captured, even her nose has a slight tint of pink, giving the hint that she''s been crying before.  The lighting on the left is slightly too harsh or too direct and it seems that the shot has a slight yellow cast over it.  Overall 8.', '2002-12-05 04:33:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(164731, 8979, 4798, '<td valign="top">Shapes like these are fun and interesting when taking a shot of them. You have chosen the symmetrical way of portraying these squares. And it paid off. The lighting is good enough to keep the shadow to a bare minimum and your composition is near perfect.  (Wild) suggestion: If you had turn this shot upside down, would it still be interesting to keep the viewer''s attention?  Overall 8.</td>', 'Shapes like these are fun and interesting when taking a shot of them. You have chosen the symmetrical way of portraying these squares. And it paid off. The lighting is good enough to keep the shadow to a bare minimum and your composition is near perfect.  (Wild) suggestion: If you had turn this shot upside down, would it still be interesting to keep the viewer''s attention?  Overall 8.', '2002-12-05 04:39:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(164737, 9154, 4798, '<td valign="top">Aah, I''ve seen your other works on PhotoSIG. And they are exceptionally good as this one.  It''s very hard to find a comment and/or critique for you, and I''m sure you want one. Your concept is well executed, and your idea in this shot is fresh and bold which are essential to hold the viewer''s attention. (No doubt, the tutorial on 2 Tone Tonic will appear soon.) What I would like to see more, is maybe some addition of waterdrops running down on the side of the glass and have a few sparkle of bubbles rising from the bottom of the glass (it is a tonic, right?).  This shot is a straight still life study.  IMO, to enable to viewer to absorb completely into your shot, elements like I mentioned above, would create a deeper impact.  Overall 9. (Might come back for that 10.)</td>', 'Aah, I''ve seen your other works on PhotoSIG. And they are exceptionally good as this one.  It''s very hard to find a comment and/or critique for you, and I''m sure you want one. Your concept is well executed, and your idea in this shot is fresh and bold which are essential to hold the viewer''s attention. (No doubt, the tutorial on 2 Tone Tonic will appear soon.) What I would like to see more, is maybe some addition of waterdrops running down on the side of the glass and have a few sparkle of bubbles rising from the bottom of the glass (it is a tonic, right?).  This shot is a straight still life study.  IMO, to enable to viewer to absorb completely into your shot, elements like I mentioned above, would create a deeper impact.  Overall 9. (Might come back for that 10.)', '2002-12-05 04:58:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(164740, 9171, 2716, '<td valign="top">Nice close-up.  jacko 7.</td>', 'Nice close-up.  jacko 7.', '2002-12-05 05:32:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(164741, 9225, 2716, '<td valign="top">Real nice effect.  I like it Jacko.</td>', 'Real nice effect.  I like it Jacko.', '2002-12-05 05:33:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(164742, 8979, 2716, '<td valign="top">Very nice angles/textured effect.  Jacko.</td>', 'Very nice angles/textured effect.  Jacko.', '2002-12-05 05:34:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(164743, 9090, 2716, '<td valign="top">Great angle and tones.  Jacko.</td>', 'Great angle and tones.  Jacko.', '2002-12-05 05:34:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(164746, 9063, 3532, '<td valign="top">Good control of depth of field.  Some people will probably complain about the lack of focus, but I like that most of it is blurry except a couple of the pentagon clusters..</td>', 'Good control of depth of field.  Some people will probably complain about the lack of focus, but I like that most of it is blurry except a couple of the pentagon clusters..', '2002-12-05 06:02:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(164748, 9016, 3532, '<td valign="top">I think the lighting could have been better.  It would give the photo more impact if there were some highlights somewhere on her skin.</td>', 'I think the lighting could have been better.  It would give the photo more impact if there were some highlights somewhere on her skin.', '2002-12-05 06:08:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(164750, 9190, 3532, '<td valign="top">This isn''t a bad idea and the lighting is decent, but it would be a lot more successful if you had taken the time to clear everything that is not important to the picture like the towels and such off the table so that they don''t distract from your main subject</td>', 'This isn''t a bad idea and the lighting is decent, but it would be a lot more successful if you had taken the time to clear everything that is not important to the picture like the towels and such off the table so that they don''t distract from your main subject', '2002-12-05 06:12:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(164751, 8979, 3585, '<td valign="top">Good subject, nice tones of blue, solid composition. But a  little too solid to my taste, a liitle more fantasy in the composition would be welomed and more a challenging task for you. One vertical half on this picture would make a nice panoramic image, the other half is redundant.</td>', 'Good subject, nice tones of blue, solid composition. But a  little too solid to my taste, a liitle more fantasy in the composition would be welomed and more a challenging task for you. One vertical half on this picture would make a nice panoramic image, the other half is redundant.', '2002-12-05 06:47:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(164752, 9070, 3585, '<td valign="top">Good composition, to bad for the very poor focusing this image requires.</td>', 'Good composition, to bad for the very poor focusing this image requires.', '2002-12-05 06:49:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(164753, 8969, 3585, '<td valign="top">tastes good?</td>', 'tastes good?', '2002-12-05 06:51:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(164754, 9086, 3585, '<td valign="top">Nice tones and plenty of mystery. hope your title won''t influence mischievous voters...</td>', 'Nice tones and plenty of mystery. hope your title won''t influence mischievous voters...', '2002-12-05 07:00:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(164755, 8961, 3532, '<td valign="top">Good job.  That''s a lot of detail on the moon.  I''d be curious to know how you took this photo.</td>', 'Good job.  That''s a lot of detail on the moon.  I''d be curious to know how you took this photo.', '2002-12-05 07:07:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(164756, 9233, 3532, '<td valign="top">I like the gradation in tones from the pale blue shadows on the petals to the dark blue base.  Very good control of lighting and exposure. 9</td>', 'I like the gradation in tones from the pale blue shadows on the petals to the dark blue base.  Very good control of lighting and exposure. 9', '2002-12-05 07:09:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(164759, 8879, 3532, '<td valign="top">Love the lighting on the foam.  The razor merges into the background too much.  It would be better if there was a little light along the top edge of the razor to outline it.  As it is, without the title, I would have a very hard time figuring out it''s a razor.</td>', 'Love the lighting on the foam.  The razor merges into the background too much.  It would be better if there was a little light along the top edge of the razor to outline it.  As it is, without the title, I would have a very hard time figuring out it''s a razor.', '2002-12-05 07:17:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(164761, 9212, 3532, '<td valign="top">Awesome macro.  Good choice for the surface (is that a paper towel?).  The round patterns work well with the marble without  detracting attention from the focus.  I really like that the pattern is reflected in the marble.  It might be just a touch over sharpened.</td>', 'Awesome macro.  Good choice for the surface (is that a paper towel?).  The round patterns work well with the marble without  detracting attention from the focus.  I really like that the pattern is reflected in the marble.  It might be just a touch over sharpened.', '2002-12-05 07:23:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(164763, 9115, 4936, '<td valign="top">This photo is very special...as it has a warm history.  The person who entered this is disabled...and has been for many many years.  In his day (baby boomer), he WAS forever in blue jeans.  He was a cool dude.  A few years ago, his daughter made him this quilt...out of blue jeans.  It was her way of telling him she knew of his love for blue jeans...and now he\''d have them...even as he slept.  It took her months to do this...and it was done so that he\''d be able to \"keep the magic of his memories\".  I know this tale...because this person is my brother...AND, BY THE WAY....HE''S STILL A COOL DUDE.</td>', 'This photo is very special...as it has a warm history.  The person who entered this is disabled...and has been for many many years.  In his day (baby boomer), he WAS forever in blue jeans.  He was a cool dude.  A few years ago, his daughter made him this quilt...out of blue jeans.  It was her way of telling him she knew of his love for blue jeans...and now he\''d have them...even as he slept.  It took her months to do this...and it was done so that he\''d be able to \"keep the magic of his memories\".  I know this tale...because this person is my brother...AND, BY THE WAY....HE''S STILL A COOL DUDE.', '2002-12-05 07:26:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(164770, 9023, 1024, '<td valign="top">I love this!  Sorry that I can not add any constructive critisism, there is nothing I would change.  BAMartin</td>', 'I love this!  Sorry that I can not add any constructive critisism, there is nothing I would change.  BAMartin', '2002-11-30 11:55:24.000000', NULL, 1),
