(164815, 8948, 4162, '<td valign="top">I love the way you have made all those little stars, is that with a filter on the lens? Great picture!</td>', 'I love the way you have made all those little stars, is that with a filter on the lens? Great picture!', '2002-11-28 11:01:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(164816, 8907, 4648, '<td valign="top">I happen to like children shots and this one is no exception.  A very good close up with beautiful soft focus.  The texture of the skin comes through beautifuly.  My main sugggestion would be to crop out the out of focus white on the right side, even if you had to hve more of the face.  If you were only going to show one eye I feel you should have shown none of the other.  Or all of both.  Just my opinion though.  Otherwise great shot.  Beautiful subject.  PTL</td>', 'I happen to like children shots and this one is no exception.  A very good close up with beautiful soft focus.  The texture of the skin comes through beautifuly.  My main sugggestion would be to crop out the out of focus white on the right side, even if you had to hve more of the face.  If you were only going to show one eye I feel you should have shown none of the other.  Or all of both.  Just my opinion though.  Otherwise great shot.  Beautiful subject.  PTL', '2002-12-05 09:39:54.000000', NULL, 1),
