(165071, 9224, 4539, '<td valign="top">I love the photo.  I wanted to give it a 10 but the ribbon in front that is slightly blurred kept taking my eye away from rest of the picture when I looked toward the bottom.  Still an excellent effort.  Solid 9+.</td>', 'I love the photo.  I wanted to give it a 10 but the ribbon in front that is slightly blurred kept taking my eye away from rest of the picture when I looked toward the bottom.  Still an excellent effort.  Solid 9+.', '2002-12-05 17:12:34.000000', NULL, 1),
