(165148, 9076, 4648, '<td valign="top">I love insect pictures.  If this dude is real it is a winner and I''m giving you a 10.  If he is not real, which I''m going on the net and look it up, I''m coming back and cut your score by at least half.  Better fess up before I find out.  PTL  It ain''t real but you are and it is still the only 10 I''ve given so far. 12/5/02</td>', 'I love insect pictures.  If this dude is real it is a winner and I''m giving you a 10.  If he is not real, which I''m going on the net and look it up, I''m coming back and cut your score by at least half.  Better fess up before I find out.  PTL  It ain''t real but you are and it is still the only 10 I''ve given so far. 12/5/02', '2002-12-05 20:14:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(165149, 9045, 4648, '<td valign="top">Great photo.  So much emotion expressed.  Says a 1000 words.  I love it.  PTL The emotion is so great as is the photo 10 is all I can give.  Congratulations.</td>', 'Great photo.  So much emotion expressed.  Says a 1000 words.  I love it.  PTL The emotion is so great as is the photo 10 is all I can give.  Congratulations.', '2002-12-05 20:16:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(165151, 9111, 4648, '<td valign="top">I love it.  This really is one of my top 10.  It is perfect in everyway photographically and after all that is what we are voting on - quality of photography.  Also within the challenge of "blue" and you got that.  Good, no, great job.  PTL  If it''s top 10 it deserves a 10.</td>', 'I love it.  This really is one of my top 10.  It is perfect in everyway photographically and after all that is what we are voting on - quality of photography.  Also within the challenge of "blue" and you got that.  Good, no, great job.  PTL  If it''s top 10 it deserves a 10.', '2002-12-05 20:18:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(165152, 9104, 4648, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.  Great job.  One of the best.  PTL  I''m such a patriot and sucker for red, whit, and blue, and this photo it deserves a 10</td>', 'Beautiful.  Great job.  One of the best.  PTL  I''m such a patriot and sucker for red, whit, and blue, and this photo it deserves a 10', '2002-12-05 20:19:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(165153, 8885, 4648, '<td valign="top">Now this is very unique idea.  One in a million.  Great cmposition and fantastic execution.  Gutsy to do it on the squares.  But, in my opinion, that''s just part of the whole unique idea.  Very good job.  Wish there was no shadow but we can''t have everything exactly as we want it.  Great job.  One of the tops.  PTL  Like it so much I''m upping it to a 9.</td>', 'Now this is very unique idea.  One in a million.  Great cmposition and fantastic execution.  Gutsy to do it on the squares.  But, in my opinion, that''s just part of the whole unique idea.  Very good job.  Wish there was no shadow but we can''t have everything exactly as we want it.  Great job.  One of the tops.  PTL  Like it so much I''m upping it to a 9.', '2002-12-05 20:22:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(165155, 9184, 4648, '<td valign="top">Beautiful sunset.  I especially like how the clouds come to a point to point out the sun.  Was that intentional or did you even see it.  There''s not much one can say when a photo is good - except good job.  PTL  And up it to a 9</td>', 'Beautiful sunset.  I especially like how the clouds come to a point to point out the sun.  Was that intentional or did you even see it.  There''s not much one can say when a photo is good - except good job.  PTL  And up it to a 9', '2002-12-05 20:24:41.000000', NULL, 1),
