(165199, 9244, 2170, '<td valign="top">A nice, simple photo against a great-colored sky.  There is a lot of jpeg artifacting around the edges of the branches, which makes them lose a little of their sharpness.  If this could be sharper, this would be an excellent image.  Probably very effective in b/w too, even though that''s not the point of the challenge.  muckpond</td>', 'A nice, simple photo against a great-colored sky.  There is a lot of jpeg artifacting around the edges of the branches, which makes them lose a little of their sharpness.  If this could be sharper, this would be an excellent image.  Probably very effective in b/w too, even though that''s not the point of the challenge.  muckpond', '2002-12-05 21:21:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(165200, 8924, 4648, '<td valign="top">At first I thought this was the sky with stars, then up comes the twig and now it looks like snow, but what are the white spots.  It pretty but I don''t know what I''m looking at.  A lot of empty space and a twig.  I''ve got to think about this.  PTL</td>', 'At first I thought this was the sky with stars, then up comes the twig and now it looks like snow, but what are the white spots.  It pretty but I don''t know what I''m looking at.  A lot of empty space and a twig.  I''ve got to think about this.  PTL', '2002-12-05 21:21:09.000000', NULL, 1),
