(165204, 8888, 2170, '<td valign="top">The mountains are slightly blurry.  Don''t know if that is from the camera being out of focus or motion of the photog or compression issues.  Still, great angle.  Love the way it''s poking out from behind the rock.  muckpond</td>', 'The mountains are slightly blurry.  Don''t know if that is from the camera being out of focus or motion of the photog or compression issues.  Still, great angle.  Love the way it''s poking out from behind the rock.  muckpond', '2002-12-05 21:22:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(165205, 9070, 2170, '<td valign="top">Nice idea.  The lack of focus is unfortunate.  Great angle and repetition, though.  muckpond</td>', 'Nice idea.  The lack of focus is unfortunate.  Great angle and repetition, though.  muckpond', '2002-12-05 21:23:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(165207, 8903, 2170, '<td valign="top">Nice still life.  The plastic berries are a bit distracting and don''t really provide enough of a contrasting color to the beautiful blue in the glass.  Positioning this further from the background would help in two ways:  the shadows would not wrap up vertically, and the background detail would disappear and become more of a solid white.  Good shot.  muckpond</td>', 'Nice still life.  The plastic berries are a bit distracting and don''t really provide enough of a contrasting color to the beautiful blue in the glass.  Positioning this further from the background would help in two ways:  the shadows would not wrap up vertically, and the background detail would disappear and become more of a solid white.  Good shot.  muckpond', '2002-12-05 21:24:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(165209, 8871, 4648, '<td valign="top">Beautiful sky, good shot of the sky.  But - is it landing, taking off, a military plane, or a passenger plane.  Calm before the storm was a last week shot.  It appears to be landing with the wings, etc.  Pretty picture.  PTL</td>', 'Beautiful sky, good shot of the sky.  But - is it landing, taking off, a military plane, or a passenger plane.  Calm before the storm was a last week shot.  It appears to be landing with the wings, etc.  Pretty picture.  PTL', '2002-12-05 21:25:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(165210, 8960, 2170, '<td valign="top">Simple, clean, crisp -- beautiful, and great for the challenge.  You must have pulled that clothesline incredibly taut to be that straight -- great job.  8)  muckpond</td>', 'Simple, clean, crisp -- beautiful, and great for the challenge.  You must have pulled that clothesline incredibly taut to be that straight -- great job.  8)  muckpond', '2002-12-05 21:25:20.000000', NULL, 1),
