(165212, 9159, 2170, '<td valign="top">LOL.  Nice idea.  The reflection from the flash is a bit harsh.  This might have been more effective, since you were pouring, if we could see a splash of the cola at the bottom as well.  You can see bits of it in the photo, but it would make more of an impact to see it all.  muckpond</td>', 'LOL.  Nice idea.  The reflection from the flash is a bit harsh.  This might have been more effective, since you were pouring, if we could see a splash of the cola at the bottom as well.  You can see bits of it in the photo, but it would make more of an impact to see it all.  muckpond', '2002-12-05 21:27:05.000000', NULL, 1),
