(165247, 9079, 4648, '<td valign="top">I collect sea shells and not of mine of this kind are blue.  I don''t particularly like colorization.  I think nature did a good job on its own.  Just a personal thing.  The photo is two busy, too many shells fighting for attention.  Up close ones out of focus.  Poor execution.  PTL. 4</td>', 'I collect sea shells and not of mine of this kind are blue.  I don''t particularly like colorization.  I think nature did a good job on its own.  Just a personal thing.  The photo is two busy, too many shells fighting for attention.  Up close ones out of focus.  Poor execution.  PTL. 4', '2002-12-05 22:11:04.000000', NULL, 1),
