(165256, 8961, 4648, '<td valign="top">What zoom do you have?  Have you fooled me?  This is almost to good to be a photo taken by someone other than at a plantetarium.  I have to know how you did this.  This is awesome.  PTL 10</td>', 'What zoom do you have?  Have you fooled me?  This is almost to good to be a photo taken by someone other than at a plantetarium.  I have to know how you did this.  This is awesome.  PTL 10', '2002-12-05 22:20:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(165257, 8888, 4648, '<td valign="top">This is beautiful.  The "Blue Moon" photo submitted looks like it was cut out of this shot.  I would have cropped off some of the bottom and top to bring the moon more into the line of the eyes.  It would be a larger part of the photo therefore easier to spot at a glance, and as your subject that''s where you want the eyes to go immediately.  Otherwise great shot.  PTL 8</td>', 'This is beautiful.  The "Blue Moon" photo submitted looks like it was cut out of this shot.  I would have cropped off some of the bottom and top to bring the moon more into the line of the eyes.  It would be a larger part of the photo therefore easier to spot at a glance, and as your subject that''s where you want the eyes to go immediately.  Otherwise great shot.  PTL 8', '2002-12-05 22:24:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(165258, 8869, 3532, '<td valign="top">I like the quiet misty feeling of this photo and the composition is good.  But somehow I feel it lacks a little something that would give it more impact or make it more interesting.  Having something, maybe the tops of the trees? in focus would probably achieve this, but it might ruin the mistiness.  It would have been great if you could have gotten a small redish rowboat or even maybe just a couple dead leaves floating on the water in the foreground.  Or, maybe just a little higher contrast between the trees and the hills in the background. 8</td>', 'I like the quiet misty feeling of this photo and the composition is good.  But somehow I feel it lacks a little something that would give it more impact or make it more interesting.  Having something, maybe the tops of the trees? in focus would probably achieve this, but it might ruin the mistiness.  It would have been great if you could have gotten a small redish rowboat or even maybe just a couple dead leaves floating on the water in the foreground.  Or, maybe just a little higher contrast between the trees and the hills in the background. 8', '2002-12-05 22:26:54.000000', NULL, 1),
