(165460, 9084, 2170, '<td valign="top">Cute!  Interesting idea!  muckpond</td>', 'Cute!  Interesting idea!  muckpond', '2002-12-06 08:20:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(165471, 9104, 3087, '<td valign="top">A lovely strong image with great colour saturation and wonderful composition. I like the diagonal angle of the can, which is balanced by the more horizontal curves of the logo. I also like the arrangement of those three droplets and the way they magnify detail. <br/>I find it just a touch too dark in the lower right corner.<br/>Great image!<br/>9, Kavey</td>', 'A lovely strong image with great colour saturation and wonderful composition. I like the diagonal angle of the can, which is balanced by the more horizontal curves of the logo. I also like the arrangement of those three droplets and the way they magnify detail. I find it just a touch too dark in the lower right corner.Great image!9, Kavey', '2002-12-06 09:33:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(165473, 8888, 3087, '<td valign="top">A strong image - the kind I''d expect to see in a good travel guide book or in a magazine.<br/>I like the way the shadows cause the snow to appear blue - echoeing the rich blue sky. <br/>Beautiful composition.<br/>9, Kavey</td>', 'A strong image - the kind I''d expect to see in a good travel guide book or in a magazine.I like the way the shadows cause the snow to appear blue - echoeing the rich blue sky. Beautiful composition.9, Kavey', '2002-12-06 09:36:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(165474, 8984, 3087, '<td valign="top">Perfect composition, great capture of colour and nice clean background. <br/>Either resolution is a little low (I don''t know your camera limitation) or the image is just noisy. If it''s the latter I''d recommend investing in neatimage which works wonders for some of my stuff.<br/>9, Kavey</td>', 'Perfect composition, great capture of colour and nice clean background. Either resolution is a little low (I don''t know your camera limitation) or the image is just noisy. If it''s the latter I''d recommend investing in neatimage which works wonders for some of my stuff.9, Kavey', '2002-12-06 09:37:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(165475, 8995, 3087, '<td valign="top">I can imagine how many comments you''re getting about combining this week''s challenge with the next one!<br/>I do like this very much - the diagonal, the saturated blue and the motion are all very appealing.<br/>My only criticisms would be the greyness to the background at the top left corner and that I think the hoop-things could be just a touch higher and to the left - not much so as I don''t mean centred at all - I like the off-balance composition - but just a touch.<br/>Great capture!<br/>9, Kavey</td>', 'I can imagine how many comments you''re getting about combining this week''s challenge with the next one!I do like this very much - the diagonal, the saturated blue and the motion are all very appealing.My only criticisms would be the greyness to the background at the top left corner and that I think the hoop-things could be just a touch higher and to the left - not much so as I don''t mean centred at all - I like the off-balance composition - but just a touch.Great capture!9, Kavey', '2002-12-06 09:39:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(165476, 9111, 3087, '<td valign="top">What a wonderful image!<br/>I love the texture of the denim next to the softer fur of your little critter.<br/>The harsh white lighting really makes me think of coming out of a blue funk and into the light again, as it were. As you can see, for me this photo is about more than what is initially there. It isn''t just a photo of a mouse under your trousers!!<br/>I suspect a number of commenters will tell you the lighting is a little <i>too</i> harsh in the way it bounces onto his underside, but I like it that way.<br/>Congrats on this wonderful entry and best of luck!<br/>10, Kavey</td>', 'What a wonderful image!I love the texture of the denim next to the softer fur of your little critter.The harsh white lighting really makes me think of coming out of a blue funk and into the light again, as it were. As you can see, for me this photo is about more than what is initially there. It isn''t just a photo of a mouse under your trousers!!I suspect a number of commenters will tell you the lighting is a little too harsh in the way it bounces onto his underside, but I like it that way.Congrats on this wonderful entry and best of luck!10, Kavey', '2002-12-06 09:40:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(165477, 9175, 3087, '<td valign="top">This is a great image - wonderful composition - great angles - great colour and lighting and I like the long exposure light trails.<br/>9, Kavey</td>', 'This is a great image - wonderful composition - great angles - great colour and lighting and I like the long exposure light trails.9, Kavey', '2002-12-06 09:41:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(165479, 8979, 3087, '<td valign="top">As I''ve been voting and refining voting this image has definitely moved up through the ratings - starting from 7 it''s now a firm 9.<br/>I find it strangely compelling - so symmetrical and only slightly broken up by those strange white things.<br/>I assume it''s a ceiling somewhere but really I don''t care - it''s the abstract forms and the play of colour, light and shadow that I like here.<br/>Good luck!<br/>9, Kavey</td>', 'As I''ve been voting and refining voting this image has definitely moved up through the ratings - starting from 7 it''s now a firm 9.I find it strangely compelling - so symmetrical and only slightly broken up by those strange white things.I assume it''s a ceiling somewhere but really I don''t care - it''s the abstract forms and the play of colour, light and shadow that I like here.Good luck!9, Kavey', '2002-12-06 09:42:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(165480, 9188, 3087, '<td valign="top">I guess the white must be snow on a hill but each time I look at this it just appears to me that the bottom of the picture hasn''t loaded properly.<br/>Because of the way in which it cuts off the bottoms of the trees in the shot it just doesn''t seem right. It seems to be blocking my natural view rather than adding to the shot.<br/>The sky is nicely captured.</td>', 'I guess the white must be snow on a hill but each time I look at this it just appears to me that the bottom of the picture hasn''t loaded properly.Because of the way in which it cuts off the bottoms of the trees in the shot it just doesn''t seem right. It seems to be blocking my natural view rather than adding to the shot.The sky is nicely captured.', '2002-12-06 09:44:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(165481, 9123, 3087, '<td valign="top">Way too out of focus. It seems your camera is not capable of focusing at this close a range. Either stick to shots that the camera is capable of or take the shot from a distance and crop down to what you want (losing resolution, of course).<br/>Also the light isn''t complimenting her any - it''s highlighting a shiny forehead and the bags beneath the eyes. This could be solved by softer lighting and/ or foundation powder!<br/>:)<br/>Pretty eyes she has though!</td>', 'Way too out of focus. It seems your camera is not capable of focusing at this close a range. Either stick to shots that the camera is capable of or take the shot from a distance and crop down to what you want (losing resolution, of course).Also the light isn''t complimenting her any - it''s highlighting a shiny forehead and the bags beneath the eyes. This could be solved by softer lighting and/ or foundation powder!:)Pretty eyes she has though!', '2002-12-06 09:46:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(165482, 9018, 3087, '<td valign="top">Would score higher if there wasn''t something blocking the entire lower right corner. This may be the player but we can''t see that so it adds nothing to the shot but detracts from the pac man screen.</td>', 'Would score higher if there wasn''t something blocking the entire lower right corner. This may be the player but we can''t see that so it adds nothing to the shot but detracts from the pac man screen.', '2002-12-06 09:47:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(165483, 9078, 3087, '<td valign="top">Too little of the structure and land included = weak composition.<br/>Nice capture in fog - makes me think of silence.</td>', 'Too little of the structure and land included = weak composition.Nice capture in fog - makes me think of silence.', '2002-12-06 09:48:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(165485, 9099, 4514, '<td valign="top">Check your white balance.  Something is missing from this shot.</td>', 'Check your white balance.  Something is missing from this shot.', '2002-12-06 09:51:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(165486, 8928, 3087, '<td valign="top">I don''t wish to offend - but this is not at all attractive to look at. I had to make myself look again to score and to comment because I thought it only fair to comment when giving a low score.<br/>This shot highlights very oily skin (needs dabbing with a tissue or something), blood vessels in the eye whites, and what seems to be pretty greasy hair.<br/>I doubt the model comes across that way in real life but with such a close we can see more than we might notice in RL.<br/>I have tried to state my thoughts politely but since what I am saying has the potential to offend, please feel welcome to write and ask me to delete the comment before the voting finishes if you so wish.<br/></td>', 'I don''t wish to offend - but this is not at all attractive to look at. I had to make myself look again to score and to comment because I thought it only fair to comment when giving a low score.This shot highlights very oily skin (needs dabbing with a tissue or something), blood vessels in the eye whites, and what seems to be pretty greasy hair.I doubt the model comes across that way in real life but with such a close we can see more than we might notice in RL.I have tried to state my thoughts politely but since what I am saying has the potential to offend, please feel welcome to write and ask me to delete the comment before the voting finishes if you so wish.', '2002-12-06 09:51:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(165487, 9254, 4514, '<td valign="top">Intresting.  Not a bad shot.</td>', 'Intresting.  Not a bad shot.', '2002-12-06 09:52:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(165488, 9086, 4514, '<td valign="top">Its a bird, its a plane, Its an automatic Ice maker????  :-)<br/>LOL  intresting shot.</td>', 'Its a bird, its a plane, Its an automatic Ice maker????  :-)LOL  intresting shot.', '2002-12-06 09:52:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(165489, 9194, 3087, '<td valign="top">Way too out of focus. It seems your camera is not capable of focusing at this close a range. Either stick to shots that the camera is capable of or take the shot from a distance and crop down to what you want (losing resolution, of course).<br/>Colour saturation seems good, it''s a nice strong blue.<br/>The shape of the light reflection in their eyes is also nicely round.</td>', 'Way too out of focus. It seems your camera is not capable of focusing at this close a range. Either stick to shots that the camera is capable of or take the shot from a distance and crop down to what you want (losing resolution, of course).Colour saturation seems good, it''s a nice strong blue.The shape of the light reflection in their eyes is also nicely round.', '2002-12-06 09:53:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(165490, 9187, 4514, '<td valign="top">Too bad it is dead.  Good depth of field.  Great job blurring the busy background, but I do think there was a better speciman somewhere else.</td>', 'Too bad it is dead.  Good depth of field.  Great job blurring the busy background, but I do think there was a better speciman somewhere else.', '2002-12-06 09:53:46.000000', NULL, 1);
