(165491, 8886, 4514, '<td valign="top">Ring of Blue.  I would say yes.   Focus is slightly out.  I think there are other things you could do.  <br/></td>', 'Ring of Blue.  I would say yes.   Focus is slightly out.  I think there are other things you could do.  ', '2002-12-06 09:54:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(165492, 8973, 4514, '<td valign="top">I am lost, But that is not hard to do with me.</td>', 'I am lost, But that is not hard to do with me.', '2002-12-06 09:55:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(165493, 9122, 4514, '<td valign="top">I think that this is a bit too plain.</td>', 'I think that this is a bit too plain.', '2002-12-06 09:55:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(165495, 9029, 3087, '<td valign="top">Great idea and great capture!<br/>Compositionally it feels too low in the frame - I appreciate it''s probably cropped that way to include the droplets/ corona but it just feels a little too tightly cropped at the bottom to me.<br/>Some of the whites seem a little blown out, though that could be my monitor which doesn''t have a high enough gamut to see the very whitest and very blackest ranges.</td>', 'Great idea and great capture!Compositionally it feels too low in the frame - I appreciate it''s probably cropped that way to include the droplets/ corona but it just feels a little too tightly cropped at the bottom to me.Some of the whites seem a little blown out, though that could be my monitor which doesn''t have a high enough gamut to see the very whitest and very blackest ranges.', '2002-12-06 09:55:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(165496, 9242, 4514, '<td valign="top">This is good.  I like the Tungsten affect you added here.</td>', 'This is good.  I like the Tungsten affect you added here.', '2002-12-06 09:56:07.000000', NULL, 1),
