(165499, 8882, 4514, '<td valign="top">Too busy a background.</td>', 'Too busy a background.', '2002-12-06 09:57:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(165500, 9180, 3087, '<td valign="top">I was gonna do this shot, using my hub as the model - but time and circumstances didn''t allow it... <br/>I am glad I didn''t as I am pretty sure your capture would be better.<br/>I''d actually prefer this if the skin was not desaturated. Makes the model look a bit, well, zombie-like!<br/>Nice composition - it, ahem, certainly leads your eyes/ mind to what is about to be revealed! LOL</td>', 'I was gonna do this shot, using my hub as the model - but time and circumstances didn''t allow it... I am glad I didn''t as I am pretty sure your capture would be better.I''d actually prefer this if the skin was not desaturated. Makes the model look a bit, well, zombie-like!Nice composition - it, ahem, certainly leads your eyes/ mind to what is about to be revealed! LOL', '2002-12-06 09:57:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(165501, 9223, 3087, '<td valign="top">Great capture!<br/>I think I''d prefer this in portrait orientation with the two black side areas cropped right out. The two white flares from the bottom would also look better in a portrait image I think.</td>', 'Great capture!I think I''d prefer this in portrait orientation with the two black side areas cropped right out. The two white flares from the bottom would also look better in a portrait image I think.', '2002-12-06 09:59:06.000000', NULL, 1),
