(165557, 8880, 2490, '<td valign="top">This is absolutely hilarious, and I''m voting it a 10 because it is entirely too creative.  Excellent take on color blindness - although most CAN see blue - and the use of black and white.  Good luck!</td>', 'This is absolutely hilarious, and I''m voting it a 10 because it is entirely too creative.  Excellent take on color blindness - although most CAN see blue - and the use of black and white.  Good luck!', '2002-11-26 05:21:56.000000', NULL, 1),
