(165560, 8881, 2490, '<td valign="top">Really impressed here by the combination of red, white, and blue.  Nice work.  I don''t know how to explain the composition, because it''s weighted a little to the right, but it works and gives a good feeling of depth. 10</td>', 'Really impressed here by the combination of red, white, and blue.  Nice work.  I don''t know how to explain the composition, because it''s weighted a little to the right, but it works and gives a good feeling of depth. 10', '2002-11-26 13:12:06.000000', NULL, 1),
