(165623, 9252, 4648, '<td valign="top">Over sharpened.  The yellow blob in the top right corner is distracting.  Why not have put the yellow handle over the blue material and let green show through.  This appears to be over colored enhanced.  Good idea, poor execution.  PTL 3</td>', 'Over sharpened.  The yellow blob in the top right corner is distracting.  Why not have put the yellow handle over the blue material and let green show through.  This appears to be over colored enhanced.  Good idea, poor execution.  PTL 3', '2002-12-06 14:13:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(165624, 9014, 4648, '<td valign="top">Good clear focus.  Cropped poorly.  Shadows on right side of building are distracting becuase the ones on the left side are very dark and almost like shadows.  Just not enough of the picture to see what it is.  Would be more interesting seeing more.  What there is is decent.  PTL 4</td>', 'Good clear focus.  Cropped poorly.  Shadows on right side of building are distracting becuase the ones on the left side are very dark and almost like shadows.  Just not enough of the picture to see what it is.  Would be more interesting seeing more.  What there is is decent.  PTL 4', '2002-12-06 14:16:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(165625, 9227, 4648, '<td valign="top">Not realling exciting but wonderful depth to this shot.  And all so clear.  Great job.  Is it blue like this naturally or did you colorize it?  Nice job.  PTL 8</td>', 'Not realling exciting but wonderful depth to this shot.  And all so clear.  Great job.  Is it blue like this naturally or did you colorize it?  Nice job.  PTL 8', '2002-12-06 14:20:20.000000', NULL, 1),
