(165627, 9001, 4648, '<td valign="top">Looks like a storm is brewing.  Would like it to have been a little lighter so the water would show up.  The water would have added to this.  Otherwise, great shot.  PTL 9</td>', 'Looks like a storm is brewing.  Would like it to have been a little lighter so the water would show up.  The water would have added to this.  Otherwise, great shot.  PTL 9', '2002-12-06 14:25:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(165629, 9206, 4648, '<td valign="top">Not even a good motion shot.  In that everything except the motion is to be in focus.  Here there is nothing in focus.  Which I do realize you know and intended.  But it''s just not appealing at all to the average person though, especially to me.  Sorry.  PTL 1</td>', 'Not even a good motion shot.  In that everything except the motion is to be in focus.  Here there is nothing in focus.  Which I do realize you know and intended.  But it''s just not appealing at all to the average person though, especially to me.  Sorry.  PTL 1', '2002-12-06 14:29:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(165631, 9237, 4648, '<td valign="top">Strange - all green and one blue.  Great depth.  Beautiful  contrast between the tall buildings and the sand.  Good focus.  One problem with the cropping - just above the last white building on the right is something brown sticking into the photo.  Details - should have cropped it out or shown all of it, whatever it is.  I know that is nit picking, but you want our opinions.  And that is a very small flaw.  Keeps it from getting a 10 .  PTL 9</td>', 'Strange - all green and one blue.  Great depth.  Beautiful  contrast between the tall buildings and the sand.  Good focus.  One problem with the cropping - just above the last white building on the right is something brown sticking into the photo.  Details - should have cropped it out or shown all of it, whatever it is.  I know that is nit picking, but you want our opinions.  And that is a very small flaw.  Keeps it from getting a 10 .  PTL 9', '2002-12-06 14:35:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(165633, 8956, 4648, '<td valign="top">What is fragil?  What is it?  I feel the photo should answer those questions.  It''s beautiful looking.  Poor cropping - took the top off, and maybe the bottom.  It''s georgeous blue, whatever it is.  I just want to see what it is.  This picture has a frustrating effect on me.  And that takes away from it.  PTL 7</td>', 'What is fragil?  What is it?  I feel the photo should answer those questions.  It''s beautiful looking.  Poor cropping - took the top off, and maybe the bottom.  It''s georgeous blue, whatever it is.  I just want to see what it is.  This picture has a frustrating effect on me.  And that takes away from it.  PTL 7', '2002-12-06 14:39:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(165634, 9254, 4648, '<td valign="top">I especially like the level this was taken from.  And I like the effect the sun hs on the weeds in the center of the photo.  Good focus, good cropping,  a real good composition with real good execution.  Took time for details.  Great job.  PTL 9</td>', 'I especially like the level this was taken from.  And I like the effect the sun hs on the weeds in the center of the photo.  Good focus, good cropping,  a real good composition with real good execution.  Took time for details.  Great job.  PTL 9', '2002-12-06 14:42:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(165637, 8975, 4648, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful flower, but is appears to be almost violet or lavendar.  The unopened one on the right definitely is.  Yes, I can see the blue.  When I clicked on the thumbnail it definitely was lavendar.  Cropped a little to tightly.  Good dof on this.    Nice job.  PTL 7</td>', 'This is a beautiful flower, but is appears to be almost violet or lavendar.  The unopened one on the right definitely is.  Yes, I can see the blue.  When I clicked on the thumbnail it definitely was lavendar.  Cropped a little to tightly.  Good dof on this.    Nice job.  PTL 7', '2002-12-06 14:47:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(165641, 8880, 4648, '<td valign="top">Technically good photo....BUT..you would at least expect the pills to be colored.  What a poor time to do B &amp; W.  I know they said it didn''t have to be blue, but just give a hint of blue.  This is too far fetched of a hint, even for the most imaginative mind.  I know you expected comments like this, and you got it.  This has to be for a joke.  At least give a yellow pills, green pills, and blue pills.  I''m giving it a 3 because it is such a clear photo, otherwise it would be a 1.  I really can''t believe you did this.  And yes I''ll sign this.  PTL 3  It is nice hand writing.</td>', 'Technically good photo....BUT..you would at least expect the pills to be colored.  What a poor time to do B & W.  I know they said it didn''t have to be blue, but just give a hint of blue.  This is too far fetched of a hint, even for the most imaginative mind.  I know you expected comments like this, and you got it.  This has to be for a joke.  At least give a yellow pills, green pills, and blue pills.  I''m giving it a 3 because it is such a clear photo, otherwise it would be a 1.  I really can''t believe you did this.  And yes I''ll sign this.  PTL 3  It is nice hand writing.', '2002-12-06 14:55:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(165642, 9134, 4648, '<td valign="top">The ball has great reflective properties, but you didn''t get all of it and what you got is out of focus.  Details.  PTL 3</td>', 'The ball has great reflective properties, but you didn''t get all of it and what you got is out of focus.  Details.  PTL 3', '2002-12-06 14:57:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(165643, 9250, 4648, '<td valign="top">From the thumb nail I was ready to give it a 10.  But at full size it''s ruined by over sharpening it.  The flag by itself, just as it is will hold its own.  PTL 3</td>', 'From the thumb nail I was ready to give it a 10.  But at full size it''s ruined by over sharpening it.  The flag by itself, just as it is will hold its own.  PTL 3', '2002-12-06 14:59:47.000000', NULL, 1),
