(165645, 9253, 4648, '<td valign="top">These betas are so beautiful.  Why did you ruin him.  His color doesn''t come through at all.  It is over sharpened.  The colors are terrible.  The focus is way out.  He actually looks dead.  I''m sorry but this is what I see.  PTL1</td>', 'These betas are so beautiful.  Why did you ruin him.  His color doesn''t come through at all.  It is over sharpened.  The colors are terrible.  The focus is way out.  He actually looks dead.  I''m sorry but this is what I see.  PTL1', '2002-12-06 15:05:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(165646, 9211, 4648, '<td valign="top">You couldn''t clap your hands and shew him away?  I love the angle to this shot.  Don''t particularly like how it is offset.  It''s not enough to appear to be for a reason.  The focus is fantastic and the sky is beautiful.  Other than the offset, and ole yes the sea gull, it is a beautiful photo.  PTL 8</td>', 'You couldn''t clap your hands and shew him away?  I love the angle to this shot.  Don''t particularly like how it is offset.  It''s not enough to appear to be for a reason.  The focus is fantastic and the sky is beautiful.  Other than the offset, and ole yes the sea gull, it is a beautiful photo.  PTL 8', '2002-12-06 15:08:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(165647, 8903, 4648, '<td valign="top">In my opinion the two things on either side of the glass are nothing but distraction.  They are crowding the glass and fighting it for the attention.  One is actually touching it.  And you cropped part of each off, as if to say they don''t matter.  If they don''t matter, don''t put them in.  Left out and the glass more centered, this would be a beautiful shot of a beautiful piece of fostoria.  PTL. 5</td>', 'In my opinion the two things on either side of the glass are nothing but distraction.  They are crowding the glass and fighting it for the attention.  One is actually touching it.  And you cropped part of each off, as if to say they don''t matter.  If they don''t matter, don''t put them in.  Left out and the glass more centered, this would be a beautiful shot of a beautiful piece of fostoria.  PTL. 5', '2002-12-06 15:12:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(165651, 9041, 4648, '<td valign="top">I realize this is sunset but the picture is too dark.  If lightened the sun colors would still come through, as would the sky.  It is a beautiful composition and would make a beautiful painting over a couch if it were lighter.  PTL 8</td>', 'I realize this is sunset but the picture is too dark.  If lightened the sun colors would still come through, as would the sky.  It is a beautiful composition and would make a beautiful painting over a couch if it were lighter.  PTL 8', '2002-12-06 15:15:31.000000', NULL, 1),
