(166159, 8953, 5351, '<td valign="top">Nice shot - I like the sharp edges of the Paper? and how they contrast with the soft edges of the shadows behind it.</td>', 'Nice shot - I like the sharp edges of the Paper? and how they contrast with the soft edges of the shadows behind it.', '2002-12-07 19:03:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(166160, 9162, 4648, '<td valign="top">Too much too out of focus for me.  The streaks on the tv are distracting.  The light blue smudge on the top middle of the tv, and the mixture of colors in the bottom right corner and the top right corner are all distracting.  Your title is "on television and not half of your pic is television.  The top left corner over to the center is also too distracting.  Good concept but very poor execution.  PTL 3</td>', 'Too much too out of focus for me.  The streaks on the tv are distracting.  The light blue smudge on the top middle of the tv, and the mixture of colors in the bottom right corner and the top right corner are all distracting.  Your title is "on television and not half of your pic is television.  The top left corner over to the center is also too distracting.  Good concept but very poor execution.  PTL 3', '2002-12-07 19:04:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(166161, 9151, 5351, '<td valign="top">Cool photo - I like the concept.  Different!</td>', 'Cool photo - I like the concept.  Different!', '2002-12-07 19:04:22.000000', NULL, 1),
