(166165, 9245, 4648, '<td valign="top">No they''re not and it''s a shame to have made this one blue.  Too bright, too out of focus, messy background.  Whole picture too busy.  Should never have tried to colorize it in any way.  PTL 1</td>', 'No they''re not and it''s a shame to have made this one blue.  Too bright, too out of focus, messy background.  Whole picture too busy.  Should never have tried to colorize it in any way.  PTL 1', '2002-12-07 19:06:33.000000', NULL, 1),
