(166175, 9053, 4648, '<td valign="top">I don''t see the 3rd generation''s blue but they are having so much fun it doesn''t really matter to me..  Good composition.  Interesting.  Hate you had to crop off her hands, but understand; but still hate it.  Appears you enjoyed taking this photo, and to me that''s the biggest part of photography - if you enjoy doing and like your results, whether anyone else does or not.  Good job.  PTL 8</td>', 'I don''t see the 3rd generation''s blue but they are having so much fun it doesn''t really matter to me..  Good composition.  Interesting.  Hate you had to crop off her hands, but understand; but still hate it.  Appears you enjoyed taking this photo, and to me that''s the biggest part of photography - if you enjoy doing and like your results, whether anyone else does or not.  Good job.  PTL 8', '2002-12-07 19:15:46.000000', NULL, 1),
