(166185, 9137, 4648, '<td valign="top">Good shot.  I really like this one.  Night shots can be so pretty.  This one is good.  Way to go.  PTL 8</td>', 'Good shot.  I really like this one.  Night shots can be so pretty.  This one is good.  Way to go.  PTL 8', '2002-12-07 20:16:13.000000', NULL, 1),
