(166187, 9031, 4648, '<td valign="top">Good focus, good composition, good crop.  Background needs to be smooth.  B &amp; W worked against you here in my opinion.  It takes away from what otherwise was a good shot.  PTL.  6</td>', 'Good focus, good composition, good crop.  Background needs to be smooth.  B & W worked against you here in my opinion.  It takes away from what otherwise was a good shot.  PTL.  6', '2002-12-07 20:22:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(166189, 9133, 4648, '<td valign="top">This flower looks lavender or purple.  If I really stretch my imagination I might, I said might, be able to see blue.  AND blue is my favorite color - all shades of blue.  This is not a shade of blue I''m familiar with.  As for the photo it is a really good photo - nice focus, nice composition, nice cropping, a couple of dead or dying ones on it on the right hand bottom side, but not too bad.  Having trouble seeing it meet the challenge of blue.  I''ll compromise and give you a 6.  PTL</td>', 'This flower looks lavender or purple.  If I really stretch my imagination I might, I said might, be able to see blue.  AND blue is my favorite color - all shades of blue.  This is not a shade of blue I''m familiar with.  As for the photo it is a really good photo - nice focus, nice composition, nice cropping, a couple of dead or dying ones on it on the right hand bottom side, but not too bad.  Having trouble seeing it meet the challenge of blue.  I''ll compromise and give you a 6.  PTL', '2002-12-07 20:26:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(166191, 9080, 4288, '<td valign="top">The human foot is distracting and takes away from the "cuteness" of the picture. Would have been better if you could have cropped in a little.</td>', 'The human foot is distracting and takes away from the "cuteness" of the picture. Would have been better if you could have cropped in a little.', '2002-12-07 20:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(166192, 8994, 4648, '<td valign="top">Show you my stupidity right off the bat - I don''t know what a "fractal" is, so I don''t understand your title.  But I do know what I like and I like this photo.  Only thing is I wish you had pulled back and shifted a little to have gotten more of the tree in on the right side and maybe some of the trunk, even if you had to lay down on the ground to get it.  What are the white things on the limbs? They are a little distracting.  I love the clouds above the tree, adds to it.  Good job.  PTL 7</td>', 'Show you my stupidity right off the bat - I don''t know what a "fractal" is, so I don''t understand your title.  But I do know what I like and I like this photo.  Only thing is I wish you had pulled back and shifted a little to have gotten more of the tree in on the right side and maybe some of the trunk, even if you had to lay down on the ground to get it.  What are the white things on the limbs? They are a little distracting.  I love the clouds above the tree, adds to it.  Good job.  PTL 7', '2002-12-07 20:31:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(166194, 9218, 4648, '<td valign="top">Good set up.  Overly sharpened or colorized, which ever.  the blue fades off the ribbon onto the background.  Jumps out at you well.  Nice job.  PTL 7</td>', 'Good set up.  Overly sharpened or colorized, which ever.  the blue fades off the ribbon onto the background.  Jumps out at you well.  Nice job.  PTL 7', '2002-12-07 20:35:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(166195, 9123, 4648, '<td valign="top">Needs focus!!  Good subject and good cropping but needs focus.  PTL 3</td>', 'Needs focus!!  Good subject and good cropping but needs focus.  PTL 3', '2002-12-07 20:42:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(166197, 9185, 4648, '<td valign="top">Old railroad station or old factory?  Which ever, it''s a good photo.  I live the soft focus on this one.  Adds to the "blue" feeling.  Did you try angling more and getting more of the building on the left, even if you had to go past the heap.  Just a thought.  Just wondering if would add to the destituion look.  I like the photo.  It meets the challenge by emitting a blue feeling from the observer.  Good job.  PTL 8</td>', 'Old railroad station or old factory?  Which ever, it''s a good photo.  I live the soft focus on this one.  Adds to the "blue" feeling.  Did you try angling more and getting more of the building on the left, even if you had to go past the heap.  Just a thought.  Just wondering if would add to the destituion look.  I like the photo.  It meets the challenge by emitting a blue feeling from the observer.  Good job.  PTL 8', '2002-12-07 20:48:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(166199, 8951, 4648, '<td valign="top">This is a good one.  I want to cry just looking at the sadness in his eyes.  This is what a photo is supposed to do in this challenge.  Cause me to feel something and this one does.  Technically everything is right on. Love the soft focus.  May be a little dark but not enough to really hurt it.  Just a thought.  Good job.  PTL 9</td>', 'This is a good one.  I want to cry just looking at the sadness in his eyes.  This is what a photo is supposed to do in this challenge.  Cause me to feel something and this one does.  Technically everything is right on. Love the soft focus.  May be a little dark but not enough to really hurt it.  Just a thought.  Good job.  PTL 9', '2002-12-07 20:51:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(166200, 8913, 4648, '<td valign="top">Way too much dark area at the bottom of the picture.  The sky is beautiful and the sillouette is nice.  Nice idea just bad execution.  PTL 4</td>', 'Way too much dark area at the bottom of the picture.  The sky is beautiful and the sillouette is nice.  Nice idea just bad execution.  PTL 4', '2002-12-07 20:54:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(166201, 8976, 4648, '<td valign="top">Lack of attention to details -  table needs cleaned off.  Neads a plain background, maybe a cloth of some sort hung behind it.  Maybe even a smooth cloth under it.  These details make the difference between a picture and a photo.  But it does have good focus on your subject.  PTL 5</td>', 'Lack of attention to details -  table needs cleaned off.  Neads a plain background, maybe a cloth of some sort hung behind it.  Maybe even a smooth cloth under it.  These details make the difference between a picture and a photo.  But it does have good focus on your subject.  PTL 5', '2002-12-07 21:15:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(166202, 9129, 4648, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  Good focus and depth.  A little dark in the back hall.  Would like to be able to see a that person a little better, since they are in the photo.  Nice job.  PTL 8</td>', 'Nice shot.  Good focus and depth.  A little dark in the back hall.  Would like to be able to see a that person a little better, since they are in the photo.  Nice job.  PTL 8', '2002-12-07 21:20:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(166203, 9246, 4648, '<td valign="top">Nice play on words.  Good picture, nice focus,  Nice crop.  Meets challenge very well.  Question - did you try a photo or something behind the last glass?  You know, to be the days of your lives.  Just a thought.  It is good as is.  PTL 7</td>', 'Nice play on words.  Good picture, nice focus,  Nice crop.  Meets challenge very well.  Question - did you try a photo or something behind the last glass?  You know, to be the days of your lives.  Just a thought.  It is good as is.  PTL 7', '2002-12-07 21:24:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(166204, 9233, 4648, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition.  Nice execution.  Good soft focus.  Beautiful flower.  Nice job.  Good photo.  BUT what does "blue''m" mean?  PTL7</td>', 'Very nice composition.  Nice execution.  Good soft focus.  Beautiful flower.  Nice job.  Good photo.  BUT what does "blue''m" mean?  PTL7', '2002-12-07 21:27:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(166216, 8925, 4648, '<td valign="top">I really don''t know what to think of this.  I''ve got to know how you did this.  This is so unique and interesting.  The photo is technically good.  A great photo but whatever you did .....I''ve just never seen anything like this.  Great job.  PTl 9</td>', 'I really don''t know what to think of this.  I''ve got to know how you did this.  This is so unique and interesting.  The photo is technically good.  A great photo but whatever you did .....I''ve just never seen anything like this.  Great job.  PTl 9', '2002-12-07 23:41:43.000000', NULL, 1),
