(166349, 9197, 806, '<td valign="top">Nice macro. Love the water droplets on the blue bottle. Set up shows location and mood. Excellent details.</td>', 'Nice macro. Love the water droplets on the blue bottle. Set up shows location and mood. Excellent details.', '2002-12-08 08:58:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(166351, 9166, 806, '<td valign="top">Is Visions also the name of the contact lens company? Just curious if it was a double play on words.<br/>I like how the rest of the image is desaturated to bring the viewers eye directly to the .. well to the eye! :)<br/>The focus and composition are all excellent as well.</td>', 'Is Visions also the name of the contact lens company? Just curious if it was a double play on words.I like how the rest of the image is desaturated to bring the viewers eye directly to the .. well to the eye! :)The focus and composition are all excellent as well.', '2002-12-08 09:01:02.000000', NULL, 1),
