(166425, 8961, 3084, '<td valign="top">Wonderful image, great magnification.  The angle of view and the whole image seems to be different from where I live in the world, I wonder where you live?</td>', 'Wonderful image, great magnification.  The angle of view and the whole image seems to be different from where I live in the world, I wonder where you live?', '2002-12-08 11:57:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(166433, 9212, 772, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot... i love the lighting choice you have chosen here... I also like the texture and patterns on the surface... great shot :) - setzler</td>', 'Excellent shot... i love the lighting choice you have chosen here... I also like the texture and patterns on the surface... great shot :) - setzler', '2002-12-01 22:15:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(166440, 9108, 5511, '<td valign="top">I wood have been Blue LPL</td>', 'I wood have been Blue LPL', '2002-12-08 12:41:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(166444, 9219, 4514, '<td valign="top">First off not a bad idea.  Light is a bit too harsh and the shadow would be more impressive on a 45% angle.  This is not a human potrait but a portrait none the less.  I think This would have fared much better with a lighting such as that.  I would have used what is known in style as a Rembrandt Light Setup. which casts the shadow on a 45 degree angle.</td>', 'First off not a bad idea.  Light is a bit too harsh and the shadow would be more impressive on a 45% angle.  This is not a human potrait but a portrait none the less.  I think This would have fared much better with a lighting such as that.  I would have used what is known in style as a Rembrandt Light Setup. which casts the shadow on a 45 degree angle.', '2002-12-08 13:06:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(166445, 9086, 4967, '<td valign="top">I love the variances in blue in this picture.  Also it is a very interesting perspective, especially with the coil, which leads your eye very nicely.  Good job on not having the light too powerful.  This must have been a cold picture to take!  It looks a little dark to me, with little contrast, but thats understandable.  Overall nice job, and good luck!<br/></td>', 'I love the variances in blue in this picture.  Also it is a very interesting perspective, especially with the coil, which leads your eye very nicely.  Good job on not having the light too powerful.  This must have been a cold picture to take!  It looks a little dark to me, with little contrast, but thats understandable.  Overall nice job, and good luck!', '2002-12-08 13:07:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(166447, 8924, 4967, '<td valign="top">Great job of getting the patterns in the snow, with no hotspots.  Love the flashes of sparkles in this picture.  Did you use a blue filter or do that in photoshop.  Nice job, looks like the stars in the sky are reflecting on the snow... very pretty.  Would have liked to have seen maybe something a tiny bit more interesting... but it''s a nice job.  Good luck!</td>', 'Great job of getting the patterns in the snow, with no hotspots.  Love the flashes of sparkles in this picture.  Did you use a blue filter or do that in photoshop.  Nice job, looks like the stars in the sky are reflecting on the snow... very pretty.  Would have liked to have seen maybe something a tiny bit more interesting... but it''s a nice job.  Good luck!', '2002-12-08 13:15:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(166448, 9034, 885, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and subject.  I like the sparkles.  If I had a criticism, I think that the depth of field could be a little bit greater...to make that third prong of the central branch there a little sharper, while leaving the ones in the back (and the bg) softer.  I guess knowing what camera you have, I think I''d have expected this to be sharper/crisper, but that might be an unreasonable expectation.</td>', 'Nice composition and subject.  I like the sparkles.  If I had a criticism, I think that the depth of field could be a little bit greater...to make that third prong of the central branch there a little sharper, while leaving the ones in the back (and the bg) softer.  I guess knowing what camera you have, I think I''d have expected this to be sharper/crisper, but that might be an unreasonable expectation.', '2002-12-08 13:18:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(166449, 9175, 3080, '<td valign="top">I''m not usually a huge fan of tilted shots, but this one is very nicely done!  I like how it makes the shot a bit more dramatic.  The cars streak in the front is good, and The color is good.  I think that the brick road is interesting as well.  Great blue subject! Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I''m not usually a huge fan of tilted shots, but this one is very nicely done!  I like how it makes the shot a bit more dramatic.  The cars streak in the front is good, and The color is good.  I think that the brick road is interesting as well.  Great blue subject! Good luck in the challenge.', '2002-12-08 13:21:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(166450, 9246, 4967, '<td valign="top">The reflections in the glass are slightly annoying, but I love the reapeating glasses, and the blue colors you have here... also Like the background.  The lighting is quite bright at the top on the rim of the glass, but it''s not a bad photo.  Good focus, and very interesting the way you''ve done this.  Good LUCK!</td>', 'The reflections in the glass are slightly annoying, but I love the reapeating glasses, and the blue colors you have here... also Like the background.  The lighting is quite bright at the top on the rim of the glass, but it''s not a bad photo.  Good focus, and very interesting the way you''ve done this.  Good LUCK!', '2002-12-08 13:23:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(166454, 9232, 3080, '<td valign="top">Definately blue!  I like how we can see the inside part of the fire.  You did a nice job capturing flames, which I found out this week is quite difficult.    Nice angle and framing/cropping.  Focus is nice as well.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Definately blue!  I like how we can see the inside part of the fire.  You did a nice job capturing flames, which I found out this week is quite difficult.    Nice angle and framing/cropping.  Focus is nice as well.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2002-12-08 13:32:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(166458, 9217, 3080, '<td valign="top">Quite pretty!  Definately blue.  I wonder what it would look like backing up just a bit and moving the ornament a bit further to the right, so we have more negative space all around.  I like the angle you took this at, kind of head on.  Pretty subject, definately blue.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Quite pretty!  Definately blue.  I wonder what it would look like backing up just a bit and moving the ornament a bit further to the right, so we have more negative space all around.  I like the angle you took this at, kind of head on.  Pretty subject, definately blue.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2002-12-08 13:35:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(166461, 8881, 3080, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  I like the contrast of the blue stamp on the red stamp.  Your angle and framing/cropping are great, and focus is very nice as well.  Overall a very nice shot. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Very nice.  I like the contrast of the blue stamp on the red stamp.  Your angle and framing/cropping are great, and focus is very nice as well.  Overall a very nice shot. Good luck in the challenge.', '2002-12-08 13:36:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(166462, 9197, 3080, '<td valign="top">Looks like an ad! Very nice.  I think though that I wish that the blown out light to the far left could have been cut out, but that''s just personal opinion.  Too bright and white out for my taste.  However, the blue is very clear and nice, and the setup is quite appealing.  The focus and clarity are great, lighting on the subjects is nice, and angle is nice as well.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Looks like an ad! Very nice.  I think though that I wish that the blown out light to the far left could have been cut out, but that''s just personal opinion.  Too bright and white out for my taste.  However, the blue is very clear and nice, and the setup is quite appealing.  The focus and clarity are great, lighting on the subjects is nice, and angle is nice as well.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2002-12-08 13:38:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(166463, 9181, 4049, '<td valign="top">eww</td>', 'eww', '2002-12-08 13:39:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(166464, 9229, 3080, '<td valign="top">You have those horrible stucco walls like we have here.  Definately blue.  I think that the light gets a bit harsh on the wall as it nears the womans body, and on the left side of her towel.  I like the half shadow/half light feel.  I think it adds to the "longing" or sadness that could be feeling from longing.  Focus and clarity are nice, angle and framing/cropping are good as well.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'You have those horrible stucco walls like we have here.  Definately blue.  I think that the light gets a bit harsh on the wall as it nears the womans body, and on the left side of her towel.  I like the half shadow/half light feel.  I think it adds to the "longing" or sadness that could be feeling from longing.  Focus and clarity are nice, angle and framing/cropping are good as well.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2002-12-08 13:41:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(166465, 9154, 4852, '<td valign="top">This is too good, Without the Lime or Lemon(?) , this would have been boring. Like a Garth Brooks shirt. But You nailed it.</td>', 'This is too good, Without the Lime or Lemon(?) , this would have been boring. Like a Garth Brooks shirt. But You nailed it.', '2002-12-08 13:42:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(166466, 9151, 3080, '<td valign="top">Did a very nice job of displaying color on black and white.  Saturation levels, i assume.  the angle and framing/cropping are nice, i like how the ear ring lands on a third.  Your focus is very nice as well.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Did a very nice job of displaying color on black and white.  Saturation levels, i assume.  the angle and framing/cropping are nice, i like how the ear ring lands on a third.  Your focus is very nice as well.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2002-12-08 13:43:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(166467, 9086, 4852, '<td valign="top">This is a perfect example of the feeling  blue. It illustrates cold blue better than any similar  "cold" picture.   I also like that its a clever "what is it " picture. After a few minutes I reliazed that it was an icemaker. You made me think, and thats not easy for me!!</td>', 'This is a perfect example of the feeling  blue. It illustrates cold blue better than any similar  "cold" picture.   I also like that its a clever "what is it " picture. After a few minutes I reliazed that it was an icemaker. You made me think, and thats not easy for me!!', '2002-12-01 09:36:53.000000', NULL, 1),
