(166490, 9256, 4005, '<td valign="top">It''s a great pic and I''m absolutely sure, that it''ll be one of the first places! It''s a pitty that the violin is cut - but I guess you know... 9 - KAOS.</td>', 'It''s a great pic and I''m absolutely sure, that it''ll be one of the first places! It''s a pitty that the violin is cut - but I guess you know... 9 - KAOS.', '2002-12-08 15:06:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(166491, 9134, 4186, '<td valign="top">a blue christmas. the composition is fantastic, and the colors are very interesting, but the ball could use a little definition: something that sets it out from the background, like a difference of colors, some contrast modification, or something. it''s the only thing that hurts this otherwise great image. 8</td>', 'a blue christmas. the composition is fantastic, and the colors are very interesting, but the ball could use a little definition: something that sets it out from the background, like a difference of colors, some contrast modification, or something. it''s the only thing that hurts this otherwise great image. 8', '2002-12-08 15:27:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(166492, 9250, 4186, '<td valign="top">to be honest, i wasn''t impressed by the thumbnail of this image, but i am by the actual picture. the look and style is very interesting. very abstract, and interpretive. i''m going to give you a 9, and only because: the half and half composition doesn''t work too well (it''s ok, but it''d work better closer to thirds).</td>', 'to be honest, i wasn''t impressed by the thumbnail of this image, but i am by the actual picture. the look and style is very interesting. very abstract, and interpretive. i''m going to give you a 9, and only because: the half and half composition doesn''t work too well (it''s ok, but it''d work better closer to thirds).', '2002-12-08 15:30:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(166494, 9215, 4186, '<td valign="top">could use with being straightened a little. also, the composition (just set in the center of the frame) is rather untineresting. i would have tried shooting through or shooting the reflections in the subject, and/or placing it off one side of the frame.</td>', 'could use with being straightened a little. also, the composition (just set in the center of the frame) is rather untineresting. i would have tried shooting through or shooting the reflections in the subject, and/or placing it off one side of the frame.', '2002-12-08 15:32:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(166496, 9025, 4186, '<td valign="top">black and white and oh so blue. there''s nothing more blue than a sad teddy bear. no points for cuteness in my book, but technically, this is a fantastic photo. the lines shadows on the wall, and obscuring of the teddy bear on the bottom as the image delves into blackness really set the mood very well. the haze of to the right is a nice touch as well. great photo. 10</td>', 'black and white and oh so blue. there''s nothing more blue than a sad teddy bear. no points for cuteness in my book, but technically, this is a fantastic photo. the lines shadows on the wall, and obscuring of the teddy bear on the bottom as the image delves into blackness really set the mood very well. the haze of to the right is a nice touch as well. great photo. 10', '2002-12-08 15:35:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(166498, 8948, 2125, '<td valign="top">That is awesome! 10 - rll07</td>', 'That is awesome! 10 - rll07', '2002-12-08 15:36:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(166499, 9119, 4186, '<td valign="top">the line at the bottom of the image where the wall meets the ground is distracting. if the shot were lowered just a little, it would be much better. also i think it should be just a little bit brighter. not by much though. 7</td>', 'the line at the bottom of the image where the wall meets the ground is distracting. if the shot were lowered just a little, it would be much better. also i think it should be just a little bit brighter. not by much though. 7', '2002-12-08 15:37:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(166500, 9098, 2125, '<td valign="top">nice shot! very crisp</td>', 'nice shot! very crisp', '2002-12-08 15:37:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(166501, 9117, 4186, '<td valign="top">interesting shades of blue. the steeple puncuates the sky nicely, and the uneven roof line is interesting. 8</td>', 'interesting shades of blue. the steeple puncuates the sky nicely, and the uneven roof line is interesting. 8', '2002-12-08 15:38:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(166502, 9218, 2125, '<td valign="top">clever idea I like it 8</td>', 'clever idea I like it 8', '2002-12-08 15:39:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(166503, 8974, 4186, '<td valign="top">i don''t like the composition that much, but the contrasts of colors and the creative dof really save this picture. 8</td>', 'i don''t like the composition that much, but the contrasts of colors and the creative dof really save this picture. 8', '2002-12-08 15:40:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(166504, 9189, 4186, '<td valign="top">pretty, abstract, good composition, and interesting use of chromatic aberations. 9</td>', 'pretty, abstract, good composition, and interesting use of chromatic aberations. 9', '2002-12-08 15:41:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(166506, 9188, 4186, '<td valign="top">the snow''s a little on the harsh side for the darkness of the trees and sky. those could use a little lightening. composition is interesting. 7</td>', 'the snow''s a little on the harsh side for the darkness of the trees and sky. those could use a little lightening. composition is interesting. 7', '2002-12-08 15:43:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(166507, 8869, 2125, '<td valign="top">very nice 9</td>', 'very nice 9', '2002-12-08 15:43:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(166508, 9206, 2125, '<td valign="top">love the flag in this shot ..9</td>', 'love the flag in this shot ..9', '2002-12-08 15:43:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(166510, 9021, 2125, '<td valign="top">groovy baby</td>', 'groovy baby', '2002-12-08 15:44:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(166511, 9181, 2125, '<td valign="top">cute</td>', 'cute', '2002-12-08 15:46:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(166512, 8863, 2125, '<td valign="top">very clean shot!</td>', 'very clean shot!', '2002-12-08 15:48:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(166515, 9070, 4186, '<td valign="top">i hate to say this, but it does look a little blurry. hopefully a simple unsharp mask could fix this. composition is ok, colors are ok. generally, other than that its a pretty decent photo. 6</td>', 'i hate to say this, but it does look a little blurry. hopefully a simple unsharp mask could fix this. composition is ok, colors are ok. generally, other than that its a pretty decent photo. 6', '2002-12-08 15:51:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(166516, 9145, 4186, '<td valign="top">...and the sky may look blue. i bet no one else got that one, but now i have to listen to the wall and it''s all your fault. anyways. the near complimentary colors are beautiful. the almost-rule-of-thirds is good. not sure about the subject of a bug for the song, but the picture works with the title, so... ah what the hell. 10.</td>', '...and the sky may look blue. i bet no one else got that one, but now i have to listen to the wall and it''s all your fault. anyways. the near complimentary colors are beautiful. the almost-rule-of-thirds is good. not sure about the subject of a bug for the song, but the picture works with the title, so... ah what the hell. 10.', '2002-12-08 15:56:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(166517, 9226, 4049, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t matel get really upset if you photography barbie in any kind of sexual position since it disgraces the image of the doll?</td>', 'Doesn''t matel get really upset if you photography barbie in any kind of sexual position since it disgraces the image of the doll?', '2002-12-08 15:56:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(166518, 9187, 4186, '<td valign="top">the dof is interesting, but the angle is not. rule of thirds is clearly in play, but i still think the angle (or maybe the condition of the subject) is really hurting this picture. 7</td>', 'the dof is interesting, but the angle is not. rule of thirds is clearly in play, but i still think the angle (or maybe the condition of the subject) is really hurting this picture. 7', '2002-12-08 15:57:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(166519, 9256, 4186, '<td valign="top">the colors are great, the subject is interesting, pretty good composition. makes a very artful picture. love the texturing. 9</td>', 'the colors are great, the subject is interesting, pretty good composition. makes a very artful picture. love the texturing. 9', '2002-12-08 15:59:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(166520, 9212, 4049, '<td valign="top">sharpened a bit too much.</td>', 'sharpened a bit too much.', '2002-12-08 15:59:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(166521, 9004, 4186, '<td valign="top">too dark, not enough definition. composition is interesting. i would have shot at a slightly higher angle.</td>', 'too dark, not enough definition. composition is interesting. i would have shot at a slightly higher angle.', '2002-12-08 16:00:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(166523, 9129, 4186, '<td valign="top">great composition. colors could use just a little work, bring out the near compliments a little more. 7</td>', 'great composition. colors could use just a little work, bring out the near compliments a little more. 7', '2002-12-08 16:02:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(166524, 8951, 4049, '<td valign="top">What do you have to feel blue about, you''re married, you''ve concured the unconcorable obstacle to life''s happiness. If you''re so sad, go kiss your wife and tell her how lucky you are to have her and how much you love her.</td>', 'What do you have to feel blue about, you''re married, you''ve concured the unconcorable obstacle to life''s happiness. If you''re so sad, go kiss your wife and tell her how lucky you are to have her and how much you love her.', '2002-12-08 16:03:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(166525, 8999, 4186, '<td valign="top">a longer exposure would have helped this pisture alot. there''s too little definition as-is.</td>', 'a longer exposure would have helped this pisture alot. there''s too little definition as-is.', '2002-12-08 16:04:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(166526, 9244, 4186, '<td valign="top">not sure what to say. a great picture. good colors. lines are interesting. the choice to not include the entire tree was a good oone.  i like how it runs into each of the four edges. 8</td>', 'not sure what to say. a great picture. good colors. lines are interesting. the choice to not include the entire tree was a good oone.  i like how it runs into each of the four edges. 8', '2002-12-08 16:06:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(166527, 8884, 4186, '<td valign="top">interesting, but it doesn''t do much for me. the choice to include the red laser-light makes the picture feel more complete, but coming closer in to the subject might have worked better. i dunno. umm. 6.</td>', 'interesting, but it doesn''t do much for me. the choice to include the red laser-light makes the picture feel more complete, but coming closer in to the subject might have worked better. i dunno. umm. 6.', '2002-12-08 16:08:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(166528, 9020, 4186, '<td valign="top">wow. the greens of the greenhous offsets the blue and the bare trees very nicely. the lines and the composition and the colors all work beautifully. very artfully done. 10.</td>', 'wow. the greens of the greenhous offsets the blue and the bare trees very nicely. the lines and the composition and the colors all work beautifully. very artfully done. 10.', '2002-12-08 16:10:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(166529, 8879, 4049, '<td valign="top">The lighting could be better on the razor</td>', 'The lighting could be better on the razor', '2002-12-08 16:12:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(166530, 8995, 4186, '<td valign="top">lines and repition work. the blurring of the blue thingy in motion is neet. and the dirtiness around the edges is actually a nice touch, and a change from the sterility of a lot of mostly-white images you normally see here. 9</td>', 'lines and repition work. the blurring of the blue thingy in motion is neet. and the dirtiness around the edges is actually a nice touch, and a change from the sterility of a lot of mostly-white images you normally see here. 9', '2002-12-08 16:13:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(166531, 8960, 4049, '<td valign="top">I love quilts</td>', 'I love quilts', '2002-12-08 16:13:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(166533, 9122, 4186, '<td valign="top">they''re all giving you low votes, aren''t they? well, i like it. the choice of only having the tree in the bottom right quarter is a great one. and the snow of the artifacting suprisingly works. how about a 10 for creativity and daring?</td>', 'they''re all giving you low votes, aren''t they? well, i like it. the choice of only having the tree in the bottom right quarter is a great one. and the snow of the artifacting suprisingly works. how about a 10 for creativity and daring?', '2002-12-08 16:16:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(166534, 8907, 4186, '<td valign="top">interesting composition. the eye on the right is just a little distracting, but that might just be me. 9</td>', 'interesting composition. the eye on the right is just a little distracting, but that might just be me. 9', '2002-12-08 16:18:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(166535, 8863, 4186, '<td valign="top">haha. nice. looks a little overexposed, and it works. interesting diagonals in your composition. 9</td>', 'haha. nice. looks a little overexposed, and it works. interesting diagonals in your composition. 9', '2002-12-08 16:21:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(166537, 9086, 5399, '<td valign="top">i am not sure how this image was taken, but i like the feeling of going down deeper into an abyss! the rich blues attract my attention.</td>', 'i am not sure how this image was taken, but i like the feeling of going down deeper into an abyss! the rich blues attract my attention.', '2002-12-08 16:26:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(166538, 9220, 5399, '<td valign="top">the rich blues have a neon effect that catch my eye and want to keep looking!</td>', 'the rich blues have a neon effect that catch my eye and want to keep looking!', '2002-12-08 16:28:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(166539, 9104, 5399, '<td valign="top">vibrant and eye catching. i like the translucient circluar droppet objects!</td>', 'vibrant and eye catching. i like the translucient circluar droppet objects!', '2002-12-08 16:30:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(166540, 9181, 1379, '<td valign="top">The more I look at this photo, the more I like it.  It''s totally silly, and it makes me smile!</td>', 'The more I look at this photo, the more I like it.  It''s totally silly, and it makes me smile!', '2002-12-08 16:32:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(166541, 9183, 5399, '<td valign="top">great composition and lighting! the blue is electrifing!</td>', 'great composition and lighting! the blue is electrifing!', '2002-12-08 16:33:42.000000', NULL, 1),
