(166546, 8984, 1379, '<td valign="top">Of all the burner pics this week, this is my favorite!  I really like that you only included half of the ring, and the way the flames curve is really appealing.</td>', 'Of all the burner pics this week, this is my favorite!  I really like that you only included half of the ring, and the way the flames curve is really appealing.', '2002-12-08 16:42:37.000000', NULL, 1),
