(166615, 9236, 4275, '<td valign="top">Really cool photo but the ice actually isnt blue perhaps if you painted it. 5</td>', 'Really cool photo but the ice actually isnt blue perhaps if you painted it. 5', '2002-12-08 19:30:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(166625, 8881, 2221, '<td valign="top">Nice conecpt! You used the contrast of the colours very well. Unfortunately some parts of the stamp (e.g. upper right corner) are a bit out of foucs. Also the red stamp on the upper edge of the photo seems to have a lot of grain. However, I like the photo very much because of the way how you emphasised the blue colour by putting it on the red background.  -stephan</td>', 'Nice conecpt! You used the contrast of the colours very well. Unfortunately some parts of the stamp (e.g. upper right corner) are a bit out of foucs. Also the red stamp on the upper edge of the photo seems to have a lot of grain. However, I like the photo very much because of the way how you emphasised the blue colour by putting it on the red background.  -stephan', '2002-12-08 20:04:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(166626, 8888, 3080, '<td valign="top">what a great use of negative space.   i love the color of the sky, and that moon is stunning.  The focus and clarity is awesome and your angle and framing/cropping are great as well.  A very nice shot. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'what a great use of negative space.   i love the color of the sky, and that moon is stunning.  The focus and clarity is awesome and your angle and framing/cropping are great as well.  A very nice shot. Good luck in the challenge.', '2002-12-08 20:07:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(166627, 8997, 2221, '<td valign="top">Great use of selective focus! I think it''s a nice idea and very funny because it reminds me how I sometimes walk through the world testing how a certain scene would look through the viewfinder ;-) -stephan</td>', 'Great use of selective focus! I think it''s a nice idea and very funny because it reminds me how I sometimes walk through the world testing how a certain scene would look through the viewfinder ;-) -stephan', '2002-12-08 20:08:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(166629, 9191, 3080, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  The color AND the mood.  This photo screams blue.  I love the angle and framing/cropping you have chosen.  Your focus and clarity are great, and I like the photo a lot.  Overall this is one of the best this week.  Seriously.  Great shot. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Very nice.  The color AND the mood.  This photo screams blue.  I love the angle and framing/cropping you have chosen.  Your focus and clarity are great, and I like the photo a lot.  Overall this is one of the best this week.  Seriously.  Great shot. Good luck in the challenge.', '2002-12-08 20:11:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(166631, 9155, 3080, '<td valign="top">This is inspiring for holiday shoppers. I''ve seen these little guys and they rock. lol.  The shot is definately blue.  I think I would have rather seen the hamster than the box the hamster was in though.  The lighting is good, but gets a little bright on the round "try me" sign.  Focus and clarity are just fine.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'This is inspiring for holiday shoppers. I''ve seen these little guys and they rock. lol.  The shot is definately blue.  I think I would have rather seen the hamster than the box the hamster was in though.  The lighting is good, but gets a little bright on the round "try me" sign.  Focus and clarity are just fine.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2002-12-08 20:16:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(166633, 9012, 3080, '<td valign="top">Very pretty shot.  I love the flowers.  The problem for me comes with the background.  The bottom left corner is the obvious problem.  I with that the blue background were more uniform.  The focus and clarity of the flowers is great.  Lighting is also wonderful.  The angle and framing/cropping are good.  I also wish that the lint were removed from the upper half of the blue cloth, it''s a bit distracting.  Still a very nice blue shot. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Very pretty shot.  I love the flowers.  The problem for me comes with the background.  The bottom left corner is the obvious problem.  I with that the blue background were more uniform.  The focus and clarity of the flowers is great.  Lighting is also wonderful.  The angle and framing/cropping are good.  I also wish that the lint were removed from the upper half of the blue cloth, it''s a bit distracting.  Still a very nice blue shot. Good luck in the challenge.', '2002-12-08 20:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(166634, 8879, 2221, '<td valign="top">Cool lighting! I''ll check back after the challenge to see how you did this. I think it''s a bit dark because I can hardly make out the shaver but then again if it would be brighter then the shaving foam wouldn''t look so nice. -stephan</td>', 'Cool lighting! I''ll check back after the challenge to see how you did this. I think it''s a bit dark because I can hardly make out the shaver but then again if it would be brighter then the shaving foam wouldn''t look so nice. -stephan', '2002-12-08 20:19:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(166635, 8979, 3080, '<td valign="top">Love it!  Definately blue, definately symetrical.  I really like the photo as a whole.  Lighting is good, except for down towards the bottom of the photo, it gets a bit washed out, but other wise, great job.  Angle and framing/cropping are good, and the focus and clarity are great as well.  Good find. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Love it!  Definately blue, definately symetrical.  I really like the photo as a whole.  Lighting is good, except for down towards the bottom of the photo, it gets a bit washed out, but other wise, great job.  Angle and framing/cropping are good, and the focus and clarity are great as well.  Good find. Good luck in the challenge.', '2002-12-08 20:20:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(166636, 9253, 3080, '<td valign="top">Kind of looks like the pepsi sign in the back there.  It''s kind of a green color, but it passes for maybe greenish blue.  can''t really tell that the fish is a fish, there isn''t enough light on him for much detail. focus appears to be ok.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Kind of looks like the pepsi sign in the back there.  It''s kind of a green color, but it passes for maybe greenish blue.  can''t really tell that the fish is a fish, there isn''t enough light on him for much detail. focus appears to be ok.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2002-12-08 20:23:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(166637, 9085, 2221, '<td valign="top">I like this photo. Very nice how you captured the bubbles. It also fits the challenge very well because water is one of the things people associate with the colour blue first. In my opinion the focus could be a bit better, especially the lower half looks a bit soft. -stephan</td>', 'I like this photo. Very nice how you captured the bubbles. It also fits the challenge very well because water is one of the things people associate with the colour blue first. In my opinion the focus could be a bit better, especially the lower half looks a bit soft. -stephan', '2002-12-08 20:24:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(166638, 8924, 2009, '<td valign="top">wonderful. It hasn''t snowed here yet or it would have been my choice too.</td>', 'wonderful. It hasn''t snowed here yet or it would have been my choice too.', '2002-12-08 20:25:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(166639, 9111, 3080, '<td valign="top">Well isn''t he a cutie!!  My only nit pick is that the white sheet, and the white under his nose is a bit bright.  otherwise, I love the focus and clarity.  the angle and framing/cropping are great, and the lighting on the subject himself is good.  Definately blue.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Well isn''t he a cutie!!  My only nit pick is that the white sheet, and the white under his nose is a bit bright.  otherwise, I love the focus and clarity.  the angle and framing/cropping are great, and the lighting on the subject himself is good.  Definately blue.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2002-12-08 20:25:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(166644, 8884, 3080, '<td valign="top">Don''t have any clue what the title has to do with this shot, but I don''t really care.  It''s a great shot.  I love the bubbly vase thing, and the lazer light trick around it is good too.  if that''s what it is, if not, just tell me to hush.  a very nice shot.  focus and clarity are great, angle and framing/cropping good as well.  good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Don''t have any clue what the title has to do with this shot, but I don''t really care.  It''s a great shot.  I love the bubbly vase thing, and the lazer light trick around it is good too.  if that''s what it is, if not, just tell me to hush.  a very nice shot.  focus and clarity are great, angle and framing/cropping good as well.  good luck in the challenge.', '2002-12-08 20:34:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(166645, 9256, 2221, '<td valign="top">Wow! This looks very professional. The lighting is great. Somehow it looks to me as if you shot the photo underwater. The girl looks a bit out of this world with the wings. You fulfilled the challenge perfectly because the whole look of the photo seems to convey blue.  Some parts of the photo seem to be a bit out of focus (guess it''s motion blur because she moved a bit) but this does not harm the photo. Actually it adds to the "out of this world" (heavenly?) look. Only nitpick is the cropped end of the instrument (a mandolin?) but even with that this photo is one of my favourites this week. -stephan</td>', 'Wow! This looks very professional. The lighting is great. Somehow it looks to me as if you shot the photo underwater. The girl looks a bit out of this world with the wings. You fulfilled the challenge perfectly because the whole look of the photo seems to convey blue.  Some parts of the photo seem to be a bit out of focus (guess it''s motion blur because she moved a bit) but this does not harm the photo. Actually it adds to the "out of this world" (heavenly?) look. Only nitpick is the cropped end of the instrument (a mandolin?) but even with that this photo is one of my favourites this week. -stephan', '2002-12-08 20:38:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(166650, 9150, 2221, '<td valign="top">I like this photo! Very nice lighting. The thing in the lower right corner is a bit distracting though. Also I would have like it more when the upper part would be in focus,too. The DOF is a bit too narrow for my taste. -stephan</td>', 'I like this photo! Very nice lighting. The thing in the lower right corner is a bit distracting though. Also I would have like it more when the upper part would be in focus,too. The DOF is a bit too narrow for my taste. -stephan', '2002-12-08 20:43:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(166653, 9153, 2221, '<td valign="top">Very nice colour tones. The plant in the foreground is a bit boring (regarding it''s shape) but I like the silhouette and the way how it contrasts so sharply against the sky. -stephan</td>', 'Very nice colour tones. The plant in the foreground is a bit boring (regarding it''s shape) but I like the silhouette and the way how it contrasts so sharply against the sky. -stephan', '2002-12-08 20:49:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(166654, 9104, 2221, '<td valign="top">Great macro! If this really is F/32 then it must be super macro because the DOF is very narrow. I like the clarity in the water drops and the overall colour. However, I think the red part could have been placed a bit better, because it looks a bit crowded into the corner. -stephan</td>', 'Great macro! If this really is F/32 then it must be super macro because the DOF is very narrow. I like the clarity in the water drops and the overall colour. However, I think the red part could have been placed a bit better, because it looks a bit crowded into the corner. -stephan', '2002-12-08 20:53:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(166658, 9219, 4648, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful bright photo.  One question.  Where the shadow is is there a fold in the field it is sitting on.  It sure looks like it.  Wish you could have gooten this without any shadow.  Everything else is so crisp and clean with nothing else but what you have.  Understand?  My eyes keep going to that shadow and fold.  Bothers me.  But still beautiful picture.  PTL 9</td>', 'This is a beautiful bright photo.  One question.  Where the shadow is is there a fold in the field it is sitting on.  It sure looks like it.  Wish you could have gooten this without any shadow.  Everything else is so crisp and clean with nothing else but what you have.  Understand?  My eyes keep going to that shadow and fold.  Bothers me.  But still beautiful picture.  PTL 9', '2002-12-08 20:55:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(166659, 9114, 4648, '<td valign="top">Clean, unabstructed photo.  My big complaint - I have the third rule because too many people take it as an absolute that can''t be broken.  In my opinion, it should have been broken here.  Cut off over half of the bottom and over half of the top and you have a really nice photo.  Right now I struggle to see the paper boxes and they are your subject.  Crop at the end of the shadow on the bottom.  That would bring them in nicely.  Rules in photography are guidelines only.  PTL 6</td>', 'Clean, unabstructed photo.  My big complaint - I have the third rule because too many people take it as an absolute that can''t be broken.  In my opinion, it should have been broken here.  Cut off over half of the bottom and over half of the top and you have a really nice photo.  Right now I struggle to see the paper boxes and they are your subject.  Crop at the end of the shadow on the bottom.  That would bring them in nicely.  Rules in photography are guidelines only.  PTL 6', '2002-12-08 21:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(166660, 9214, 2221, '<td valign="top">That was one of the first things I had in mind for the blue challenge. But unfortunately I didn''t have the possibilities to fly into space and take a photo of the earth ;-) Your "thing" (don''t know what this could be) looks very interesting and I wonder how you did this. I''ll check back after the challenge to see if you put any description on it. The focus could be a better. The photo looks very blurry and while I like this sometimes I think in this case it''s not good. -stephan</td>', 'That was one of the first things I had in mind for the blue challenge. But unfortunately I didn''t have the possibilities to fly into space and take a photo of the earth ;-) Your "thing" (don''t know what this could be) looks very interesting and I wonder how you did this. I''ll check back after the challenge to see if you put any description on it. The focus could be a better. The photo looks very blurry and while I like this sometimes I think in this case it''s not good. -stephan', '2002-12-08 21:00:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(166662, 9115, 4648, '<td valign="top">Background too busy.  Takes away from the blue jeans.  I really like the folded pants leg, real neat creative addition.  It''s a beautiful quilt but not for behind your photo.  Maybe one of it alone would be good.  Otherwise good and crisp and cropped good.  PTL 6</td>', 'Background too busy.  Takes away from the blue jeans.  I really like the folded pants leg, real neat creative addition.  It''s a beautiful quilt but not for behind your photo.  Maybe one of it alone would be good.  Otherwise good and crisp and cropped good.  PTL 6', '2002-12-08 21:02:48.000000', NULL, 1),
