(166668, 9010, 4648, '<td valign="top">These look like grapes.  Are they a form of grape?  Do they taste as good?  Are these purple or blue.  They look purple here, but I''m assuming they must be blue for you to submit them for the blue challenge.  Good focus and good crop.  Background to busy.  Don''t know how to avoid that without picking the berries, maybe another angle from the ground up.  Just my opinion.  PTL 6</td>', 'These look like grapes.  Are they a form of grape?  Do they taste as good?  Are these purple or blue.  They look purple here, but I''m assuming they must be blue for you to submit them for the blue challenge.  Good focus and good crop.  Background to busy.  Don''t know how to avoid that without picking the berries, maybe another angle from the ground up.  Just my opinion.  PTL 6', '2002-12-08 21:06:23.000000', NULL, 1),
