(166828, 9033, 3859, '<td valign="top">Unless this man is on a hill, I think if you straightened the picture so that the bench was not slanted it would have a better effect.</td>', 'Unless this man is on a hill, I think if you straightened the picture so that the bench was not slanted it would have a better effect.', '2002-12-08 23:28:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(166829, 9244, 527, '<td valign="top">There''s definitely plenty of blue in this photo but to be honest I find it somewhat ordinary. The tree branches provide some interest but it just needs something more to it. Technically it is fine and in nice focus.</td>', 'There''s definitely plenty of blue in this photo but to be honest I find it somewhat ordinary. The tree branches provide some interest but it just needs something more to it. Technically it is fine and in nice focus.', '2002-12-08 23:28:54.000000', NULL, 1),
