(166832, 9108, 527, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure what the title means unless you meant bet instead of beat. Technically it looks pretty good but I think it needs something more. Maybe more dramatic or moody lighting. it is just too perfectly lit.</td>', 'I''m not sure what the title means unless you meant bet instead of beat. Technically it looks pretty good but I think it needs something more. Maybe more dramatic or moody lighting. it is just too perfectly lit.', '2002-12-08 23:31:53.000000', NULL, 1),
