(166837, 9045, 806, '<td valign="top">beautiful shot.. Initially I react to her face, then her hands. She is subtley expressive. The contrasts between the colors of her shawl and the wall make her stand right out, yet gives her placement in her surroundings. I feel sorry for her. She deserves better. <br/>The top right corner is a bit washed out, but not to the detriment of the photo as a whole.</td>', 'beautiful shot.. Initially I react to her face, then her hands. She is subtley expressive. The contrasts between the colors of her shawl and the wall make her stand right out, yet gives her placement in her surroundings. I feel sorry for her. She deserves better. The top right corner is a bit washed out, but not to the detriment of the photo as a whole.', '2002-12-08 23:33:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(166839, 8869, 4186, '<td valign="top">yeah. this one''s another 10. normally half-and-half composition doesn''t work, but it does here, and very well, i might add. and the colors are so.... i can''t find the word for it. but it''s a 10.</td>', 'yeah. this one''s another 10. normally half-and-half composition doesn''t work, but it does here, and very well, i might add. and the colors are so.... i can''t find the word for it. but it''s a 10.', '2002-12-08 23:34:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(166840, 9196, 3080, '<td valign="top">Definately blue!!  Something doesn''t look right about the floor. Was there some post processing that effected the look of the floor, or maybe I''m just going crazy. lol.  I like the shot a lot.  the depth is very nice.  angle and framing/cropping are good as well.  I think that the graffiti adds a lot to the shot. without it, it might be a bit boring.  good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Definately blue!!  Something doesn''t look right about the floor. Was there some post processing that effected the look of the floor, or maybe I''m just going crazy. lol.  I like the shot a lot.  the depth is very nice.  angle and framing/cropping are good as well.  I think that the graffiti adds a lot to the shot. without it, it might be a bit boring.  good luck in the challenge.', '2002-12-08 23:35:02.000000', NULL, 1),
