(166842, 8970, 3080, '<td valign="top">Very blue sky.  I really like the framing of this, with the rocks at the bottom and the tree to the left.  The tree looks a bit soft on the focus to me, but it might just be the types of leaves/needles.  Otherwise, focus and clarity are great.  good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Very blue sky.  I really like the framing of this, with the rocks at the bottom and the tree to the left.  The tree looks a bit soft on the focus to me, but it might just be the types of leaves/needles.  Otherwise, focus and clarity are great.  good luck in the challenge.', '2002-12-08 23:36:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(166843, 9200, 4186, '<td valign="top">nice use of composition. could be a little sharper. just a little. 6</td>', 'nice use of composition. could be a little sharper. just a little. 6', '2002-12-08 23:36:46.000000', NULL, 1),
