(166847, 9088, 527, '<td valign="top">The lady bug looks too perfect like it is cut out. This is a very clean and colorful image. I would prefer to see the lady bug walkinto the picture instead of out of it.</td>', 'The lady bug looks too perfect like it is cut out. This is a very clean and colorful image. I would prefer to see the lady bug walkinto the picture instead of out of it.', '2002-12-08 23:40:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(166848, 9160, 3080, '<td valign="top">I might like to see the entire boot in the shot here.  It was a bit confusing at first, and I thought it looked like a jock strap. I figured it out though and felt like a real butt. I like the colors.  Very nice.  The angle and framing/cropping could be better, like I said i''d like to see the whole boot.  lighting appears ok, a little hot on the whites, but no huge deal.  still a nice "blue" shot. good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I might like to see the entire boot in the shot here.  It was a bit confusing at first, and I thought it looked like a jock strap. I figured it out though and felt like a real butt. I like the colors.  Very nice.  The angle and framing/cropping could be better, like I said i''d like to see the whole boot.  lighting appears ok, a little hot on the whites, but no huge deal.  still a nice "blue" shot. good luck in the challenge.', '2002-12-08 23:40:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(166849, 8981, 4186, '<td valign="top">is he missing limbs?</td>', 'is he missing limbs?', '2002-12-08 23:41:35.000000', NULL, 1),
