(166852, 9141, 527, '<td valign="top">Wow. a very intersting photo. Whatever that yellow is in there is a little distracting. Cropping this at an angle was very effective. It is clean and sharp with very cool colors.</td>', 'Wow. a very intersting photo. Whatever that yellow is in there is a little distracting. Cropping this at an angle was very effective. It is clean and sharp with very cool colors.', '2002-12-08 23:43:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(166854, 9034, 3080, '<td valign="top">Icy cold AND blue. :)  a nice shot.  I like the clarity and focus on the ice cicle in front.  the DOF is nice.  nothing distracting in the shot.  a very nice clean "blue" shot.  angle and framing/cropping are all good as well.  good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Icy cold AND blue. :)  a nice shot.  I like the clarity and focus on the ice cicle in front.  the DOF is nice.  nothing distracting in the shot.  a very nice clean "blue" shot.  angle and framing/cropping are all good as well.  good luck in the challenge.', '2002-12-08 23:44:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(166855, 9242, 3080, '<td valign="top">I like this very much.  Very crisp and clear. focus is wonderful.  The blue tint even looks good on a cat strangely enough.  The pose is great, and angle and framing/cropping are also very nice.  The lighting is good, except for a small hot spot on the kitties foot.  otherwise a great job. good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I like this very much.  Very crisp and clear. focus is wonderful.  The blue tint even looks good on a cat strangely enough.  The pose is great, and angle and framing/cropping are also very nice.  The lighting is good, except for a small hot spot on the kitties foot.  otherwise a great job. good luck in the challenge.', '2002-12-08 23:45:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(166857, 8872, 4648, '<td valign="top">Beautiful blue building against a georgeous sky.  I love the glint on the window, almost like it''s winking at you, saying this one''s a winner.  And it is.  PTL 9</td>', 'Beautiful blue building against a georgeous sky.  I love the glint on the window, almost like it''s winking at you, saying this one''s a winner.  And it is.  PTL 9', '2002-11-25 14:36:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(166858, 9168, 527, '<td valign="top">It makes for a pretty interesting macro. I''m glad that you didn''t oversaturate this like so many people would have. Nice composition with the angle making it a more intersting shot.</td>', 'It makes for a pretty interesting macro. I''m glad that you didn''t oversaturate this like so many people would have. Nice composition with the angle making it a more intersting shot.', '2002-12-08 23:47:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(166859, 8868, 4648, '<td valign="top">I absolutely love cloud pictures.  And this is going in my favorite pictures.  This is beautiful, absolutely beautiful.  PTL 9</td>', 'I absolutely love cloud pictures.  And this is going in my favorite pictures.  This is beautiful, absolutely beautiful.  PTL 9', '2002-11-25 09:25:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(166860, 9076, 3080, '<td valign="top">This is one strange fella.  I wouldn''t want to meet him in a dark alley...or any alley for that matter.  I love the color.  Looks real good on the desaturated background.  my only nit pick is that I wish the focus were just a bit crisper.  otherwise, angle and framing/cropping are good, lighting is good, overall a nice shot. good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'This is one strange fella.  I wouldn''t want to meet him in a dark alley...or any alley for that matter.  I love the color.  Looks real good on the desaturated background.  my only nit pick is that I wish the focus were just a bit crisper.  otherwise, angle and framing/cropping are good, lighting is good, overall a nice shot. good luck in the challenge.', '2002-12-08 23:47:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(166861, 9129, 3080, '<td valign="top">They are all wearing blue, as if you asked them to stay there so you can take a pic of them. "oh, and by the way, can you all wear blue that day" lol.  I like the shot very much.  the blue looks great with the surrounding and the focus and clarity are good.  lighting is also good for the shot.  I wish maybe to have gotten the entire guy on the left in the shot, but this shot looks like a difficult one.  good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'They are all wearing blue, as if you asked them to stay there so you can take a pic of them. "oh, and by the way, can you all wear blue that day" lol.  I like the shot very much.  the blue looks great with the surrounding and the focus and clarity are good.  lighting is also good for the shot.  I wish maybe to have gotten the entire guy on the left in the shot, but this shot looks like a difficult one.  good luck in the challenge.', '2002-12-08 23:49:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(166862, 8987, 527, '<td valign="top">I find this to be a little creepy because the face looks so pasty. It is an interesting idea but it needs a lot of help in the execution. The straight on look is just too ordinary. Some interesting angle and more dramatic lighting would be much more effective.</td>', 'I find this to be a little creepy because the face looks so pasty. It is an interesting idea but it needs a lot of help in the execution. The straight on look is just too ordinary. Some interesting angle and more dramatic lighting would be much more effective.', '2002-12-08 23:50:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(166863, 9103, 4186, '<td valign="top">very artfully done. good composition. 8</td>', 'very artfully done. good composition. 8', '2002-12-08 23:50:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(166864, 9132, 4648, '<td valign="top">What I wouldn''t give to have a place like this to walk when on my blue days.  It is beautiful country. Without the title I wouldn''t get the idea of the challenge.  You sneaked in a really good picture.  And the picture is really good.  PTL She is wearing blue and that makes the 10</td>', 'What I wouldn''t give to have a place like this to walk when on my blue days.  It is beautiful country. Without the title I wouldn''t get the idea of the challenge.  You sneaked in a really good picture.  And the picture is really good.  PTL She is wearing blue and that makes the 10', '2002-12-01 16:42:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(166865, 9170, 3080, '<td valign="top">Feeling and color.  this shot screams blue.  very nice job.  the lighting, focus, angle and framing/cropping are all good.  The little fingertip protruding in from the bottom is a bit out of place, but otherwise a nice shot.  good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Feeling and color.  this shot screams blue.  very nice job.  the lighting, focus, angle and framing/cropping are all good.  The little fingertip protruding in from the bottom is a bit out of place, but otherwise a nice shot.  good luck in the challenge.', '2002-12-08 23:50:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(166866, 9116, 527, '<td valign="top">I like this quite a bit. However I don''t think you needed to saturate the blue as much as you did. It is clean and simple and the straight overhead angle works very well with this shot.</td>', 'I like this quite a bit. However I don''t think you needed to saturate the blue as much as you did. It is clean and simple and the straight overhead angle works very well with this shot.', '2002-12-08 23:52:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(166867, 9063, 3080, '<td valign="top">I like the DOF.  The color is very pretty.  Lighting and angle and framing/cropping are good.  I wonder how this would look off to one side or the other?  Nice job. good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I like the DOF.  The color is very pretty.  Lighting and angle and framing/cropping are good.  I wonder how this would look off to one side or the other?  Nice job. good luck in the challenge.', '2002-12-08 23:52:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(166868, 9181, 3080, '<td valign="top">well, not the most pleasing thing to look at at all.  no offense to your tongue, heck, I wouldn''t want to look at my OWN tongue either.  The lighting is a bit harsh on the skin tones and the glasses create some distracting shadows.  definately blue though. good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'well, not the most pleasing thing to look at at all.  no offense to your tongue, heck, I wouldn''t want to look at my OWN tongue either.  The lighting is a bit harsh on the skin tones and the glasses create some distracting shadows.  definately blue though. good luck in the challenge.', '2002-12-08 23:54:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(166869, 9057, 4648, '<td valign="top">Beautiful picture.  Great composition, good execution.  I know why you cropped it off to the side, for the shadow, but did you try a centered shot with another name.  That''s my only a suggestion.  I still like it.  PTL  Like it heck, I love it.  10<br/></td>', 'Beautiful picture.  Great composition, good execution.  I know why you cropped it off to the side, for the shadow, but did you try a centered shot with another name.  That''s my only a suggestion.  I still like it.  PTL  Like it heck, I love it.  10', '2002-11-30 21:44:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(166870, 9203, 3080, '<td valign="top">very nice focus and clarity.  I like the color, and I like the pattern that the burner thing sitting on the top creates.  The angle and framing/cropping are ok.  I like the black negative space.  good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'very nice focus and clarity.  I like the color, and I like the pattern that the burner thing sitting on the top creates.  The angle and framing/cropping are ok.  I like the black negative space.  good luck in the challenge.', '2002-12-08 23:55:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(166871, 9019, 527, '<td valign="top">A beatiful shot which I''m sure you are hearing a lot of. I''m a little undecided about the rock in the forground but I think it works well enough. I wish I had photographed our Mt Ranier instead of the stupid picture I submitted :  ) Your composition, colors and execution are very nice. Good job.</td>', 'A beatiful shot which I''m sure you are hearing a lot of. I''m a little undecided about the rock in the forground but I think it works well enough. I wish I had photographed our Mt Ranier instead of the stupid picture I submitted :  ) Your composition, colors and execution are very nice. Good job.', '2002-12-08 23:56:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(166872, 8981, 3080, '<td valign="top">I think if the window were your main subject, I would like to see the entire window.  however, it didn''t say that the blue had to be the main subject, so I really can''t complain about that.  This is some very detailed structure, and you have captured it nicely.  the focus and clarty are good, and you show us great detail.  good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I think if the window were your main subject, I would like to see the entire window.  however, it didn''t say that the blue had to be the main subject, so I really can''t complain about that.  This is some very detailed structure, and you have captured it nicely.  the focus and clarty are good, and you show us great detail.  good luck in the challenge.', '2002-12-08 23:57:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(166873, 9135, 3080, '<td valign="top">I love the blue on the yellow like this.  very nice capture.  I really like the angle and framing/cropping you have chosen. Definately blue.  Great focus and clarity.  a wonderful shot overall!  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I love the blue on the yellow like this.  very nice capture.  I really like the angle and framing/cropping you have chosen. Definately blue.  Great focus and clarity.  a wonderful shot overall!  Good luck in the challenge.', '2002-12-08 23:58:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(166875, 9143, 3080, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  Looks like there is a little fish swimming around in there.  Love the angle and framign/cropping as well.  The focus and clarity are good.  overall a very nice shot. definately blue.  good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Very nice.  Looks like there is a little fish swimming around in there.  Love the angle and framign/cropping as well.  The focus and clarity are good.  overall a very nice shot. definately blue.  good luck in the challenge.', '2002-12-08 23:59:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(166876, 9004, 3080, '<td valign="top">I liek the fact that you went "colorless" in this.  they are definately blue berries, and this does convey the IDEA blue.  angle and framig/cropping are good.  I only wish for better focus.  Great shot. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I liek the fact that you went "colorless" in this.  they are definately blue berries, and this does convey the IDEA blue.  angle and framig/cropping are good.  I only wish for better focus.  Great shot. Good luck in the challenge.', '2002-12-09 00:00:35.000000', NULL, 0),
