(167219, 8994, 327, '<td valign="top">#19<br/>Critique Club<br/>I like this photo Paganini.<br/>It really makes good use of light and color which is really appealing. The background is rich and perfect for the challenge.<br/>The composition, light, and focus all make a good photo that does look a bit like a fractal. <br/>I don''t think I''d change anything. Well done.</td>', '#19Critique ClubI like this photo Paganini.It really makes good use of light and color which is really appealing. The background is rich and perfect for the challenge.The composition, light, and focus all make a good photo that does look a bit like a fractal. I don''t think I''d change anything. Well done.', '2002-12-09 06:23:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(167222, 9111, 327, '<td valign="top">#65<br/>Critique Club<br/>First look....cute, natural.<br/>Good composition. Texture of the fur, and  blue jeans. The colors go together and are well balanced. I''m not crazy about the white base, only because it''s a bit harsh and too strong of a contrast. Nice focus and DOF.<br/>Over all it''s a good photo with an interesting subject.</td>', '#65Critique ClubFirst look....cute, natural.Good composition. Texture of the fur, and  blue jeans. The colors go together and are well balanced. I''m not crazy about the white base, only because it''s a bit harsh and too strong of a contrast. Nice focus and DOF.Over all it''s a good photo with an interesting subject.', '2002-12-09 06:34:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(167224, 9170, 327, '<td valign="top">#111<br/>Critique Club<br/>Emotion. You only have to glance at this to see this woman is in pain, she''s BLUE. <br/>It''s making a statement.<br/>I love the light and the colors are good also. <br/>The woman is lovely and appealing. <br/>The composition is perfect to show the tear on her cheek. The focus is just a little soft for my liking.<br/>I wouldn''t change anything here.<br/>This is very well done.</td>', '#111Critique ClubEmotion. You only have to glance at this to see this woman is in pain, she''s BLUE. It''s making a statement.I love the light and the colors are good also. The woman is lovely and appealing. The composition is perfect to show the tear on her cheek. The focus is just a little soft for my liking.I wouldn''t change anything here.This is very well done.', '2002-12-09 06:43:02.000000', NULL, 0),
