(202398, 9109, 1005, '<td valign="top">O.K. this wasn''t any kind of perfect shot, but it''s creative, funny and few true technical problems with it.  5 ones and 13 twos?  How did this not meet the challenge?  It''s blue enough.  The comments received seem more concerned with what''s going on rather than photo quality and creativity.  It was meant to confound/confuse/bemuse you.  Enjoy the ride!</td>', 'O.K. this wasn''t any kind of perfect shot, but it''s creative, funny and few true technical problems with it.  5 ones and 13 twos?  How did this not meet the challenge?  It''s blue enough.  The comments received seem more concerned with what''s going on rather than photo quality and creativity.  It was meant to confound/confuse/bemuse you.  Enjoy the ride!', '2003-01-28 15:20:30.000000', NULL, 0),
