(368958, 9226, 6771, '<td valign="top">that''s hysterical!!  Fits that challenge more than just a blue M&amp;M...ie: blue jokes=dirty jokes.  How can people be that sensitive, to a humorous picture?  It is just dolls!    LOL</td>', 'that''s hysterical!!  Fits that challenge more than just a blue M&M...ie: blue jokes=dirty jokes.  How can people be that sensitive, to a humorous picture?  It is just dolls!    LOL', '2003-07-28 19:04:27.000000', NULL, 0),
