(2197791, 9029, 54198, '<td valign="top">Great shot! was the camera on single shot or was it on a burst setting? i have tried to due something on the same idea with a small rock in a pond and never got it to look anything worth looking at. After looking at this and reading on it i am going to give it another shot.<br/>from a friendly photographer!</td>', 'Great shot! was the camera on single shot or was it on a burst setting? i have tried to due something on the same idea with a small rock in a pond and never got it to look anything worth looking at. After looking at this and reading on it i am going to give it another shot.from a friendly photographer!', '2006-03-03 08:46:26.000000', NULL, 0),
